<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CH" style="id">RRK14.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">2 OBUSINGYE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Ky'Eby'omu Busingye Bw'abagabe Ekya Kabiri</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Eby'omu Busingye</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Bus</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO</para>
  <para style="mt1">KY'EBY'OMU BUSINGYE BW'ABAGABE</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKYA KABIRI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Sulemaani okushaba obwengye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 2:46">1 Bag 2:46</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:25">1 Bus 29:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Sulemaani mwene Daudi akahamibwa omu bugabe bwe, MUKAMA Ruhanga we yaaguma nawe, yamukuza munonga. <verse eid="2CH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 27:1">1 Bus 27:1</ref>. </char></note> Sulemaani yaagamba na Israeli yoona, abakuru b'engabo rukumi-rukumi n'aba igana-igana, abaramuzi, n'abeembezi ba Israeli boona, abakuru b'amaju ga baishenkurubo. <verse eid="2CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:10">Kur 29:10</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 29:42">42</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 29:43">43</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 3:4">1 Bag 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 21:29">1 Bus 21:29</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Sulemaani hamwe n'omutwe gwona ogw'abantu baaza Gibeoni omu mwanya, mukuru gw'okuramizamu; ahabw'okuba niyo Eihema rya Ruhanga ry'okubugaabuganiramu, eri Musa omwiru wa MUKAMA yaakozire omu ihamba, ryabaire riri. <verse eid="2CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:25-16:1">1 Bus 15:25—16:1</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 6:2-17">2 Sam 6:2-17</ref>. </char></note> (Kwonka eshanduukye ya Ruhanga, Daudi akaba agiinamwire, agiihire Kiryasi-yearimu, agitwaire omu mwanya ogu yaabaire agibonereize; ahakuba akaba agiteereire eihema Yerusaalemu.) <verse eid="2CH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:1">Kur 27:1</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 27:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 31:2">31:2</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 13:3">1 Bus 13:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi eitambiro ry'emiringa eryakozirwe Bezaleeli mwene Uuri, mwijukuru wa Huuri, niyo ryabaire riri omu maisho g'Obutaaho bwa MUKAMA. Okwo niyo Sulemaani n'omutwe gw'abantu baabaire baza kusherura MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 1:6" />Ku baahikireyo, Sulemaani yaaza aha itambiro ry'emiringa omu maisho ga MUKAMA, eryabaire riri omu maisho g'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, yaaritambiraho ebitambo rukumi by'okwotsya.<verse eid="2CH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 1:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:7-12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 3:5-14">1 Bag 3:5-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekyo kiro Ruhanga yaayeyoreka Sulemaani, yaamugira ati: Shaba eki orikwenda ngu nkuhe. <verse eid="2CH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:5">1 Bus 28:5</ref>. </char></note> Sulemaani yaagira Ruhanga ati: Okagirira tata Daudi embabazi nyingi, wangira omugabe omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="2CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:17">2 Bus 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:26">1 Bag 8:26</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:16">Kut 13:16</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu MUKAMA Ruhanga, eki waaraganiise tata Daudi kihikiirizibwe; ahakuba ongizire omugabe w'abantu abarikwingana omucuucu gw'ahansi. <verse eid="2CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Kub 27:17</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo hati ninkushaba obwengye n'okwetegyereza oku ndaagume nintwaza omu maisho g'aba bantu omu kushohora n'omu kutaaha; ahatari ekyo, n'oha orikubaasa kutegyeka abantu baawe aba abarikwingana bati? <verse eid="2CH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 1:11" />Ruhanga yaamugira ati: Ahabw'okuba ekyo nikyo kibairi kikuri aha mutima, kandi tiwaayeshabira bintu, nari obutungi, nari ekitiinisa, nari okushabira abazigu baawe kufa, n'obu kwakuba okweshabire okuramaara, kureka waayeshabira obwengye n'okwetegyereza, ngu obone kutegyeka abantu bangye, abu nkwemekyeire, <verse eid="2CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 1:12" />mbwenu obwengye n'okwetegyereza waabiheebwa, kandi ndyakuha obutungi, ebintu n'ekitiinisa, ebitakagirwaga mugabe weena omu baakubandiize, kandi n'omu barikukurata tihaine oribigira. <verse eid="2CH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 1:13" />Bwanyima Sulemaani yaaruga Gibeoni omu maisho g'eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, eryabaire riri omu mwanya mukuru gw'okuramizamu, yaagaruka Yerusaalemu; yaategyeka Israeli.<verse eid="2CH 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 1:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:14-17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 10:26-29">1 Bag 10:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:25-28">2 Bus 9:25-28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Sulemaani yaateeranira hamwe ebigaari n'abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi; ebigaari bye bikaba biri rukumi n'amagana ana, n'abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi kakumi n'enkumi ibiri; yaabata omu ndembo z'ebigaari n'omuri Yerusaalemu ahu yaabaire ari.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:26">1 Bag 4:26</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:19">9:19</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 1:15" />Omugabe yaareetera Yerusaalemu okugira efeeza n'ezaabu nyingi nk'amabaare, n'ebiti by'emyereezi byaba nk'emisikamoori y'omu mpita. <verse eid="2CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 1:16" />Embaraasi ezi Sulemaani yaabaire atungire, bakaba baziiha Misri; abashuubuzi b'omugabe bakaba bazigura omu busyo, buri busyo bwine obuguzi bwabwo. <verse eid="2CH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 1:17" />Kandi ekigaari kikaba kiihwa Misri ahari shekeli z'efeeza magana mukaaga, n'embaraasi ahari igana na makumi ataano; kandi abashuubuzi ku baabaire bazireeta, baziguza abagabe boona ab'Abahiiti n'ab'Abasiria.<verse eid="2CH 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Sulemaani okushaba Huraamu kumuha abafundi b'okwombeka hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 5:5">1 Bag 5:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo Sulemaani akamariira kwombekyera eiziina rya MUKAMA hekalu, kandi n'okweyombekyera nyaruju y'obugabe. <verse eid="2CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:15">1 Bag 5:15</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 5:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:20">9:20</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 9:21">21</ref>. </char></note> Yaataho abantu obukumi mushanju b'okwekorera, obukumi munaan b'okuhigura amabaare omu nshozi, n'enkumi ishatu na magana mukaaga b'okubareeberera. <verse eid="2CH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3-16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:2-11">1 Bag 5:2-11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Sulemaani yaatuma ahari Hiraamu omugabe wa Tuuro, ati: Nk'oku waabaire ogirira tata Daudi, okamutwekyera emyereezi y'okweyombekyera enju y'okutaahamu, naanye obe nikwo wangirira.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 14:1">1 Bus 14:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:7">Kur 30:7</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:5-8">Lev 24:5-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 8:3-8">Kub 8:3-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:9">28:9</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 28:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, niinyenda kwombekyera eiziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye enju, n'okugimushoroorera, ngu mbone kugyotereramu obubaane oburikutaamirana omu maisho ge n'okuguma nimpongyeramu emigaati y'okumurikwa, n'okutambiramu ebitambo by'okwotsya obutoosha omu kasheeshe n'omu mwabazyo, ahari sabato, aha kuboneka kw'okwezi, n'aha magyenyi ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu agatairweho, nk'oku byaragiirwe Abaisraeli kuguma nibabikora ebiro byona. <verse eid="2CH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:25">1 Bus 16:25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15:11">Kur 15:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:8">Zab 86:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:5">135:5</ref>. </char></note> Enju ei ndikwenda kwombeka neija kuba mpango munonga; ahabw'okuba Ruhanga waitu ni mukuru okukira baaruhanga boona. <verse eid="2CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:27">1 Bag 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:49">Byak 7:49</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu n'oha orikubaasa kumwombekyera enju, ku araabe atarikuhika mu iguru, n'obu ryakuba iguru eririkweshumba agandi? Mbwenu niinye oha kumwombekyera enju, kureka ebe ey'okwotereramu obubaane omu maisho ge? <verse eid="2CH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:15">1 Bus 22:15</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu nyoherereza omushaija omunyamyoga, ow'okukora eby'ezaabu, eby'efeeza, eby'emiringa, n'eby'ebyoma, kandi n'eby'emyenda ya bujwa, eya karari, n'eya bururu, kandi orikumanya kusharura amabara, agume n'abanyamyoga abu nyine omuri Yuda na Yerusaalemu, abu tata Daudi yaataireho. <verse eid="2CH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 2:8" />Kandi ontwekyere embaaho z'emyereezi n'emiberooshi n'emiti ya aligumu ebya Lebanooni; ahakuba nimmanya abashaija baawe ku barikumanya kushara ebiti by'embaaho omuri Lebanooni. Kandi abashaija bangye baryakwatanisa n'abaawe, <verse eid="2CH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 2:9" />babone kunteekateekyera embaaho nyingi munonga; ahakuba enju ei ndikwenda kwombeka neija kuba mpango kandi erikutangaaza. <verse eid="2CH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 2:10" />Kandi ndyaha abashaija baawe, ababaizi b'okushara embaaho, encuro z'engano ezihwire obukumi bubiri, n'encuro za sayiri obukumi bubiri, n'enjoga za viinyo obukumi bubiri, n'entsimbo z'amajuta obukumi bubiri.<verse eid="2CH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 2:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 9:8">2 Bus 9:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hiraamu omugabe wa Tuuro yaahandikira Sulemaani ebaruha, ei yaamutwekyeire, naamugarukamu ati: Ahabwa MUKAMA kukunda abantu be, nikyo akugiriire omugabe waabo. <verse eid="2CH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 2:12" />Hiraamu yaagaruka yaagira ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, owaahangire eiguru n'ensi, ahimbisibwe, ahabw'okuba ahaire Daudi omwana w'obwengye, omwerinzi kandi orikwetegyereza, kuba niwe yaayombekyera MUKAMA enju, kandi n'okweyombekyera nyaruju y'obugabe.<verse eid="2CH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 2:13" />Mbwenu naayohereza omushaija omunyamyoga, orikwetegyereza munonga, orikwetwa Huraamu, <verse eid="2CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:14">1 Bag 7:14</ref>. </char></note> mutabani w'omukazi ow'omuri beene Daani, ou ishe yaabaire ari owa Tuuro. Ogwo mushaija akeegyesibwa kukora eby'ezaabu, eby'efeeza, eby'emiringa, eby'ebyoma, eby'amabaare n'eby'ebiti, kandi n'eby'emyenda ya bujwa, eya bururu, eya karari n'eya kitaani; kandi naamanya n'okusharura amabara g'emiringo yoona n'okukora ekintu kyona, eki bamuhaire eky'okureeberaho kyakyo; mbwenu akwatanise n'abanyamyoga baawe, nibo ba mukama wangye omugurusi waawe Daudi. <verse eid="2CH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 2:15" />N'ahabw'ekyo engano na sayiri, n'amajuta na viinyo, ebi mukama wangye agambireho, abitwekyere abairu be; <verse eid="2CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 2:16" />naitwe nitwija kushara embaaho zoona ezi orikwetenga omuri Lebanooni, tuzikomerane zibe nk'ebibaya, tuzirabye omu nyanja, tuzikureetere Yoopa, obone kuzitwara Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:2">1 Bus 22:2</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Sulemaani yaabara abanyamahanga boona, abaabaire bari omu nsi ya Israeli, nk'oku Daudi ishe yaababazire. Yaashanga bari akasiriira kamwe n'obukumi butaano n'enkumi ishatu na magana mukaaga. <verse eid="2CH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 2:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:2">2 Bus 2:2</ref>. </char></note> Yaiha omuribo abantu obukumi mushanju, baaba ab'okwekorera, obukumi munaana ab'okuhigura amabaare omu nshozi, n'enkumi ishatu na magana mukaaga baaba abanyampara b'okubakoresa.<verse eid="2CH 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Sulemaani okutandika kwombeka hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 21:15">1 Bus 21:15</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 21:18">18</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 21:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 6:1">1 Bag 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:2">Kut 22:2</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 22:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Sulemaani yaatandika kwombeka enju ya MUKAMA omuri Yerusaalemu aha kibungo Moria, ahu MUKAMA yaayeyorekyeire Daudi ishe, omu mwanya ogu Daudi yaatooraine aha mbuga ya Orunaani Omuyebusi. <verse eid="2CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 3:2" />Omu mwaka gwa kana ogw'omu busingye bwe, omu kwezi kwa kabiri, nibwo yaatandika kwombeka. <verse eid="2CH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3-4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:2">1 Bag 6:2</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 6:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Ebi nibyo bigyero by'enju ya Ruhanga ei Sulemaani yaayombekire. Oburaingwa bwayo omu kigyero kya ira bukaba buri mikono makumi mukaaga, n'obukiika mikono makumi abiri.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 3:11">Ezr 3:11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 3:4" />Ekisasi eky'omu maisho ga hekalu kikaba kiri mikono makumi abiri oburaingwa, nibwingana n'obukiika bwa hekalu, kandi obwemi bwakyo bukaba buri mikono igana na makumi abiri. Omu nda yaakyo yoona yaakishweka ezaabu eshemeziibwe. <verse eid="2CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:17">1 Bag 6:17</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 6:22">22</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 6:29">29</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 6:32">32</ref>. </char></note> Ekishengye kya hekalu eky'ahagati yaakishweka embaaho z'emiberooshi, nazo yaazishweka ezaabu eshemeziibwe, yaazisharuraho emikindo n'emikuuru. <verse eid="2CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 3:6" />Egyo nju yaagihunda n'amabare g'obuguzi bwingi; egyo zaabu ekaba eri eya Paruvaimu. <verse eid="2CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 3:7" />Atyo yaashweka egyo nju n'ezaabu, emitambiko yaayo, emiryango yaayo, ebisiika byayo n'enyigi zaayo; kandi ha bisiika byayo yaasharuraho ebishushani bya baakerubi.<verse eid="2CH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 3:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 6:16">1 Bag 6:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaayombeka Aharikwera munonga; oburaingwa bwaho bwaingana n'obukiika bwa hekalu, bwaba mikono makumi abiri, kandi n'obuhango bwaho bwaba mikono makumi abiri; yaahashweka n'etalanta z'ezaabu eshemeziibwe magana mukaaga. <verse eid="2CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:11">1 Bus 28:11</ref>. </char></note> Oburemeezi bw'emisomaari bwaba shekeli z'ezaabu makumi ataano. Kandi ebishengye bya kaanyina-ibiri nabyo yaabishweka ezaabu.<verse eid="2CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 3:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10-13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 6:23-28">1 Bag 6:23-28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu Mwanya ogurikwera munonga yaatamu ebishushani bya baakerubi ebi yaakozire omu mbaaho, yaabishweka ezaabu. <verse eid="2CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 3:11" />Amapapa ga baakerubi bombi, goona hamwe gaaba mikono makumi abiri oburaingwa; eipapa ry'omwe erya mikono etaano ryahika aha kisiika ky'enju, kandi erindi ipapa, naryo rya mikono etaano, ryahika aha ipapa rya kerubi ondiijo; <verse eid="2CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 3:12" />kandi eipapa rya kerubi ogwo owa kabiri rya mikono etaano ryahika aha kisiika ky'enju, n'erindi, naryo rya mikono etaano, ryahika aha ipapa rya mugyenzi we ow'okubanza. <verse eid="2CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 3:13" />Gatyo amapapa ga baakerubi abo gaaba mikono abiri oburaingwa. Ebishushani bya baakerubi bikaba byemereire, nibireeba ekishengye kya hekalu eky'ahagati. <verse eid="2CH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31">Kur 26:31</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaakora omukingo omu myenda ya bururu, bujwa, karara na kitaani, yaagutarizamu ebishushani bya baakerubi.<verse eid="2CH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 3:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 7:15-20">1 Bag 7:15-20</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:13">2 Bag 25:13</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 25:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:15">2 Bus 3:15</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 3:16">16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu maisho g'egyo nju yaabyaramu enyomyo ibiri ez'oburaingwa bwa mikono makumi ashatu n'etaano, buri emwe eine omutwe gwa mikono etaano; <verse eid="2CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 3:16" />yaaheesha emikuufu erikushusha enkwanzi, yaagijweka omu mitwe y'ezo nyomyo; yaaheesha ebishushani igana by'ebijuma by'amakomamahanga, yaabihanika ahari egyo mikuufu. <verse eid="2CH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:21">1 Bag 7:21</ref>. </char></note> Atyo yaabyara ezo nyomyo omu maisho ga hekalu, emwe aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo, endiijo aha rwa bumosho; ey'aha rwa buryo yaagyeta Yakiini, n'ey'aha rw'obwa bumosho yaagyeta Boazi.<verse eid="2CH 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Sulemaani okukora ebindi bintu bya hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 7:7">2 Bus 7:7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 8:12">8:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaakora eitambiro ry'emiringa, oburangwa bwaryo mikono makumi abiri, obuhango bwaryo mikono makumi abiri, n'obwemi bwaryo mikono ikumi. <verse eid="2CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:23-26">1 Bag 7:23-26</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaaheesha ekitanka ky'amaizi ekyezigoire; okukicwekanisa mikono ikumi, obwemi bwakyo mikono etaano, kandi okwehinguririza omugoma gwakyo mikono makumi ashatu. <verse eid="2CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 4:3" />Kandi ahansi y'obugyenyero bwakyo haakiikizemu ebishushani by'ebisisi biri omu mishorongo ebiri, biheesherainwe nakyo. <verse eid="2CH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 4:4" />Ekyo kitanka kikaba kiteekirwe aha bishushani by'enimi ikumi na ibiri, bishatu nibireeba aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, bishatu aha burengyerwa-izooba, bishatu aha bwa-buryo, na bishatu aha burugwa-izooba; ekyo kitanka kiteekirwe ahaiguru yaabyo, biteeraine ebibunu. <verse eid="2CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 4:5" />Omubiri gwakyo gukaba guri ekita kimwe; eminwa yaakyo ekaba ekozirwe nk'ey'ekikopo, nari nk'ekirabyo ky'emyangangye; nikigiibwamu encuro enkumi ishatu z'ebinyungu bihango. <verse eid="2CH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:38">1 Bag 7:38</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 7:39">39</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaakora ebinaabiro ikumi by'okunaabiramu; bitaano yaabita aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo, n'ebitaano aha rw'obwa bumosho. Ebyo nibyo baabaire bamunyungurizamu ebintu ebi baabaire bakoresa ahabw'ebitambo by'okwotsya, kandi ekitanka nikyo abanyamurwa baabaire banaabiramu.<verse eid="2CH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 7:40">1 Bag 7:40</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:31-39">Kur 25:31-39</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 27:20-21">27:20-21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaakora ebikondo by'ezaabu ikumi, nk'oku kyaragiirwe, yaabita omuri hekalu, bitaano aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo, n'ebitaano aha rwa bumosho. <verse eid="2CH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:48">1 Bag 7:48</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaakora emeeza ikumi, yaazita omuri hekalu, itaano aha rubaju rwa buryo, na itaano aha rwa bumosho; yaakora n'enyabya z'ezaabu igana. <verse eid="2CH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 4:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:13">1 Bag 6:13</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 6:36">36</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ekikaari ky'abanyamurwa, n'ekikaari ekirikwetwa ekihango, n'enyigi zaakyo, kandi ezo nyigi yaazishwekyesa emiringa. <verse eid="2CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:39">1 Bag 7:39</ref>. </char></note> Ekitanka yaakita aha nshonda y'orubaju rwa buryo rw'oburugwa-izooba bw'egyo nju.<verse eid="2CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 4:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:11—5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 7:40-51">1 Bag 7:40-51</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi na Huraamu yaakora ebinaabiro, n'ebyoma by'okuyooza eiju, n'enyungu. Atyo Huraamu yaaheza omurimo ogu yaakozire omu nju ya Ruhanga ahabw'omugabe Sulemaani;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:13">1 Bag 7:13</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 7:14">14</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2CH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 4:12" />enyomyo ibiri, n'enyaba, n'emitwe ebiri aha mitwe y'ezo nyomyo, n'obutimba bubiri bw'okushweka enyabya ibiri ez'aha mitwe y'ezo nyomyo; <verse eid="2CH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:20">1 Bag 7:20</ref>. </char></note> ebishushani by'ebijuma by'amakomamahanga eby'okuhunda aha butimba bwombi obwabaire buri aha mitwe y'enyomyo. <verse eid="2CH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:38">1 Bag 7:38</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 7:39">39</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaakora ebitebe n'ebinaabiro aharibyo, <verse eid="2CH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 4:15" />n'ekitanka kimwe n'ebishushani by'enimi ikumi na bibiri ebyabaire biri ahansi yaakyo. <verse eid="2CH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:17">1 Bus 28:17</ref>. </char></note> Ebiyungu n'ebyoma by'okuyooza eiju, kandi n'eby'okwihuza enyama, n'ebintu byabyo byona eby'okubikoresa, Huraamu yaabikorera enju ya MUKAMA omu miringa ekuubire ahabw'omugabe Sulemaani. <verse eid="2CH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 4:17" />Omugabe yaabiyagiza omu ruhita rwa Yorudani omu itaka ry'eibumba ahagati ya Sukoosi na Zereda. <verse eid="2CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 4:18" />Sulemaani yaakora ebintu bingi munonga ebi, oburemeezi bw'emiringa yaabyo bwabaire butarikubaasa kumanywa.<verse eid="2CH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 4:19" />Atyo Sulemaani yaakora ebintu byona eby'okuta omu nju ya MUKAMA; eitambiro ry'ezaabu, emeeza z'emigaati y'okumurikwa, <verse eid="2CH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 4:20" />ebikondo by'amatabaaza n'amatabaaza gaabyo g'ezaabu eshemeziibwe g'okwakira omu maisho g'Omwanya ogurikwera ogw'omunda, nk'oku kyaragiirwe; <verse eid="2CH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 4:21" />ebishushani by'ebirabyo, amatabaaza n'empana z'ezaabu, byona byaba eby'ezaabu eshemeziibwe munonga; <verse eid="2CH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 4:22" />makansi, enyabya, eshohaani z'obubaane n'eby'okuguhisa omuriro eby'ezaabu eshemeziibwe; kandi empata z'enyigi ez'ekishengye kya hekalu, n'ez'Aharikwera munonga, zikaba ziri ez'ezaabu.<verse eid="2CH 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1-10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:1-9">1 Bag 8:1-9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Gutyo omurimo gwona ogu Sulemaani yaakozire ahabw'enju ya MUKAMA gwahwa. Bwanyima Sulemaani yaataasyamu ebintu ebi Daudi ishe yaabaire ashoroire, yaata efeeza n'ezaabu n'ebintu byona omu mabiikiro g'enju ya Ruhanga.<verse eid="2CH 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sulemaani okutaasya eshanduukye y'endagaano omuri hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 5:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 6:12">2 Sam 6:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Sulemaani yaateeranira abakuru ba Israeli omuri Yerusaalemu, abakuru b'enganda zoona, abeebembezi b'amaju ga baishenkurubo ab'eihanga rya Israeli, kwinamura eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA nibagiiha omu rurembo rwa Daudi, nirwo Saayuuni. <verse eid="2CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 5:3" />Abashaija ba Israeli boona baateeranira omu maisho g'omugabe aha bugyenyi obw'omu kwezi kwa mushanju. <verse eid="2CH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:3">1 Bag 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:5">2 Bus 5:5</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 5:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Abakuru ba Israeli boona baija, n'Abaleevi baakiriza egyo shanduukye; <verse eid="2CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 23:18">2 Bus 23:18</ref>. </char></note> baaginamura hamwe n'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, n'ebintu byona ebirikwera ebyabaire biri omuri eryo ihema; abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi baaba nibo baabiinamura. <verse eid="2CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 5:6" />Omugabe Sulemaani n'omutwe gwona ogw'Abaisraeli abaabaire bateeraniire omu maisho ge, bakaba bari omu maisho g'eshanduukye nibatamba ebitambo by'entaama n'eby'ente bingi munonga, ebitarikubaasa kugambwa nari okubarwa. <verse eid="2CH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 5:7" />Batyo abanyamurwa baatwara eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA, baagita omu mwanya gwayo omunda y'Omwanya ogurikwera ogw'egyo nju, ogurikwetwa Aharikwera munonga, ahansi y'amapapa g'ebishushani bya baakerubi. <verse eid="2CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 5:8" />Ahakuba baakerubi abo bakaba bashashaanura amapapa gaabo ahaiguru y'omwanya gw'eshanduukye n'emigamba yaayo; <verse eid="2CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:8">1 Bag 8:8</ref>. </char></note> kandi emigamba ekaba eri miraingwa munonga; n'ahabw'ekyo emitwe yaayo ekaba ereebekyera omu mwanya ogurikwera omu maisho g'Omwanya ogurikwera ogw'omunda; kwonka ekaba etarikubaasa kureeberwa heeru; kandi na hati ekiriyo. <verse eid="2CH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:11">2 Bus 6:11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:2">Bir 10:2</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 10:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Omuri egyo shanduukye tihaine kindi ekyabaire kibamu, kureka ebishate by'amabaare bibiri, ebi Musa yaateereiremu ahari Horebu, ahu Musa yaaraganiire n'Abaisraeli endagaano nibaruga omu nsi ya Misri. <verse eid="2CH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 5:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 24:1">1 Bus 24:1</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 24:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:5">Luk 1:5</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abanyamurwa ku baarugire omu mwanya ogurikwera, (ahakuba abanyamurwa boona abaabaire bariyo bakaba baherize kweyeza, batarikufa ha mbu zaabo, <verse eid="2CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:39">1 Bus 6:39</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:16">15:16</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 15:24">24</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 25:1-4">25:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:6">2 Bus 7:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 150:3-5">Zab 150:3-5</ref>. </char></note> kandi abeeshongozi Abaleevi boona, Asafu, Hamani na Yedusuuni, hamwe n'abatabani baabo na beene waabo, bajwaire emyenda ya bafuta, baine ebitaasa n'enanga n'endingiri, baayemerera aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba rw'eitambiro hamwe n'abanyamurwa abarikuteera amakondere igana na makumi abiri; <verse eid="2CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 5:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:34">1 Bus 16:34</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 16:42">42</ref>. </char></note> kandi gukaba guri omurimo gw'abakondere n'abeeshongozi kuhurirwa nibeeshongora n'eiraka rimwe, nibahimbisa MUKAMA kandi nibamusiima.) Baimutsya ekyeshongoro nibateera amakondere n'ebitaasa n'ebindi bintu ebirikugamba, nibahimbisa MUKAMA, bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 5:13">Ahakuba ni murungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 5:13">Kandi embabazi ze n'ez'ebiro byona,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CH 5:13">egyo nju, enju ya MUKAMA, yaijura ekicu; <verse eid="2CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:35">Kur 40:35</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:11">1 Bag 8:11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:2">2 Bus 7:2</ref>. </char></note> batyo abanyamurwa tibaabaasa kwemerera kuheereza ahabw'ekyo kicu; ahabw'okuba ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kikaijura enju ya Ruhanga.<verse eid="2CH 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Okushaba kwa Sulemaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1-39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:15-50">1 Bag 8:15-50</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Sulemaani yaagira ati: MUKAMA, okagira oti: Ndyaguma omu mwirima ndindindi;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:18">Heb 12:18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2CH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 6:2" />kwonka nyowe nkwombekyeire enju y'ekitiinisa, omwanya gwawe gw'okutuuramu ebiro n'ebiro.<verse eid="2CH 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 6:3" />Omugabe yaahindukira eihanga ryona ey'Abaisraeli beemereire, yaabashabira omugisha, <verse eid="2CH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 6:4" />naagira ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli asiimwe, owaahikiiriza n'omukono gwe eki yaaraganiise tata Daudi n'akanwa ke naagira ati: <verse eid="2CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 6:5" />Okwiha obu naiha abantu bangye omuri Misri, tinkatooranaga rurembo mu nganda za Israeli zoona kwombekamu enju, ngu eiziina ryangye ribe nimwo ryaguma; kandi tindatooraine muntu weena kuba omutegyeki w'abantu bangye Israeli; <verse eid="2CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 6:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:11-13">1 Sam 16:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 12:13">2 Bus 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:68">Zab 78:68</ref>. </char></note> kwonka ntooraine Yerusaalemu kuba nimwo eiziina ryangye ryaguma, kandi ntooraine Daudi kutegyeka abantu bangye Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 6:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:2">2 Sam 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1">1 Bus 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 28:2">28:2</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu kikaba kiri omu mutima gwa tata Daudi kwombekyera eiziina rya MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli enju. <verse eid="2CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 6:8" />Kwonka MUKAMA yaagira tata Daudi ati: Obaire okozire gye ahabw'enaama ei obaire oine kwombekyera eiziina ryangye enju; <verse eid="2CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 6:9" />kwonka tiiwe oryombeka egyo nju, kureka mutabani waawe, ou orizaara, niwe aryombekyera eiziina ryangye enju. <verse eid="2CH 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 6:10" />Mbwenu MUKAMA yaahikiriza eki yaaraganiise, ahabw'okuba naaza omu mwanya gwa tata Daudi, naagaruka aha kitebe ky'obugabe bwa Israeli, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaraganiise, kandi nyombekire egi nju ahabw'eiziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 6:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 5:10">2 Bus 5:10</ref>. </char></note> Omwo nimwo ntaire omwanya ahabw'eshanduukye, ei endagaano ya MUKAMA erimu, ei yaaragaine n'abantu ba Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 6:12" />Atyo Sulemaani yaayemerera omu maisho g'eitambiro rya MUKAMA, eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli riri aho, yaimutsya emikono ye. <verse eid="2CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 11:14">2 Bag 11:14</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:3">23:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Sulemaani akaba akozire ekintu ky'emiringa ky'okwemereraho, oburangwa bwakyo mikono etaano, obuhango bwakyo mikono etaano, n'obwemi bwakyo mikono eshatu, yaakita omu kikaari, yaakyemereraho. Bwanyima yaatsimba amaju omu maisho g'Abaisraeli boona, yaimutsya emikono ye ahaiguru; <verse eid="2CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 6:14" />yaagira ati: Ai MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, tihariho ruhanga omu iguru nari omu nsi, orikushushan naiwe, omu kurinda endagaano, n'omu kigirira embabazi abairu baawe abarikugyendera omu maisho gaawe n'emitima yaabo yoona; <verse eid="2CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 6:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:9">1 Bus 22:9</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 22:10">10</ref>. </char></note> kandi okahamya eki waaraganiise omwiru waawe tata Daudi; eego, okakigamba n'akanwa kaawe, mbwenu waakihikiiriza eri izooba n'omukono gwawe. <verse eid="2CH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 7:18">2 Bus 7:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:12">Zab 132:12</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo, MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, hamya eki waaraganiise omwiru waawe tata Daudi, noogira oti: Batabani baawe ku barigira emicwe mirungi, baagyendera omu biragiro byangye, nk'oku iwe obaire noobigyenderamu, tiharibura muntu w'okushutama aha kitebe ky'obugabe bwa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 6:17" />Mbwenu hati, MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, ekigambo kyawe eki waagambiire omwiru waawe Daudi, okihamye. <verse eid="2CH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 6:18" />Beitu kwo, n'eky'amazima Ruhanga oryatuura n'abantu omu nsi? Reeba, eiguru, n'obu ryakuba eiguru eririkukirira kimwe kuba ahaiguru y'agandi torikubaasa kurihikamu; kaashwa egi nju ei nyombekire! <verse eid="2CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 6:19" />Kwonka MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye, ta omutima aha kushaba n'okweshengyereza kw'omwiru waawe, noohurira okutaka kwe n'okushaba oku arikushaba omu maisho gaawe, <verse eid="2CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 6:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:40">2 Bus 6:40</ref>. </char></note> obone kuguma otaire amaisho gaawe ahari egi nju nyomushana na nyekiro, omwanya ogu waaraganiise kutamu eiziina ryawe, obone kuguma noohurira okushaba oku omwiru waawe arishaba naareeba omwanya ogu. <verse eid="2CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 6:21" />Kandi ogume ohurire okweshengyereza kw'omwiru waawe n'okw'abantu baawe Israeli, baaba nibakushaba nibareeba omwanya ogu; ogume ohurire nooyema omu iguru, omu mwanya gwawe ogu otuuramu; kandi ku oraahurire, osaasire.<verse eid="2CH 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 6:22" />Omuntu ku arisiisira mutaahi we, baamurahiza, nawe yaija kyaarahira omu maisho g'eitambiro ryawe omu nju egi, <verse eid="2CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 6:23" />ohurire nooyema omu iguru, ogire eki waakora, ocwere abairu baawe orubanja, rusingye okozire kubi, aturwe okutahikiirira kwe, oihe orubanja ahari ohikiriire, omuzimuurire nk'okuhikiirira kwe oku kuri.<verse eid="2CH 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 6:24" />Kandi abantu baawe Abaisraeli ku baribingwa abazigu baabo ahabw'okukucumuraho, bwanyima baakugarukira, baikiriza eiziina ryawe, baakushaba nibeeshengyerereza omu nju egi, <verse eid="2CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 6:25" />ohurire nooyema omu iguru, osaasire abantu baawe Israeli ekibi kyabo, obagarure omu nsi ei waabahaire na baishenkurubo.<verse eid="2CH 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 6:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Bag 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:13">2 Bus 7:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi eiguru ku ririkingwa, enjura yaabura ahabw'abantu baawe kukucumuraho, bwanyima baashaba nibareeba omu mwanya ogu, baikiriza eiziina ryawe, baahinduka, baareka ekicumuro kyabo ahabw'okuhana kwawe, <verse eid="2CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 6:27" />ohurire ori omu iguru, osaasire abairu baawe, eihanga ryawe Israeli, ekibi kyabo, obeegyese emitwarize mirungi ei bashemereire kugyenderamu; kandi ogwisize ensi yaawe enjura, ei waahaire abantu baawe kuba obuhunguzi.<verse eid="2CH 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 6:28" />Kandi enjara ku eriteera ensi, nari orufu, okututa, nari okusya-nyamwenga, nari enzigye, nari kanyaananga; nari abazigu okubagotera omuri ibara rurembo rwabo; nari ku haribaho kahumpuri nari endiijo ndwara yoona; <verse eid="2CH 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 6:29" />omuntu weena nari eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli baakushaba nibakweshengyereza, buri muntu naamanya endwara y'omu mutima gwe, n'obusaasi bwe, kandi aimukize emikono ye naagyorekyeza, ei egi nju eri, <verse eid="2CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 6:30" />ohurire nooyema omu iguru omu mwanya gwawe ogu otuuramu, osaasire, oihure buri muntu, ou orikumanya omutima, nk'oku emitwarize ye eri; (niiwe wenka orikumanya emitima y'abaana b'abantu;) <verse eid="2CH 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 6:31" />babone kukutiina ebiro byona ebi barimara omu nsi ei waahaire baatatenkuriitwe.<verse eid="2CH 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 6:32" />Kandi n'omunyamahanga otari w'omu bantu baawe Israeli, oriruga omu nsi ya hare, akaija ahabw'eiziina ryawe erikuru, n'ahabw'omukono gwawe ogw'amaani kandi ogubangire, omuntu ogwo ku ariija yaashaba naareeba enju egi, <verse eid="2CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 6:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 7:14">2 Bus 7:14</ref>. </char></note> ohurire nooyema omu iguru omu mwanya gwawe ogu otuuramu, omumarire ebi ariba naakushaba byona, kibone kureetera amahanga goona ag'omu nsi kumanya eiziina ryawe n'okukutiina, nk'oku eihanga ryawe Israeli ririkukutiina, kandi bamanye egi nju ei nyombekire ku erikwetererwa eiziina ryawe.<verse eid="2CH 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 6:34" />Abantu baawe ku barihurura nibaza aha rugamba kurwana n'abazigu baabo, omu muhanda gwona ogu oribatoozamu, baakushaba nibareeba ei oru rurembo oru waatooraine ruri, n'egi nju ei nyombekyeire eiziina ryawe, <verse eid="2CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 6:35" />ohurire okushaba n'okweshengyereza kwabo, nooyema omu iguru, obarwanirire.<verse eid="2CH 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 6:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 3:2">Yak 3:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ku barikucumuraho, (ahakuba tihariho muntu otacumura,) waabagirira ekiniga, waabahayo aha bazigu baabo, baatwarwa omu nsi y'abazigu baabo, eya hare nari eya haihi, bari enkwatwa; <verse eid="2CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 6:37" />kwonka ku barihikayo, baayegarukamu, baayeteisa, baakweshengyererezayo nibagira bati: Tukacumura, twashiisha, twakora eby'obugomi; <verse eid="2CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2CH 6:38" />baakugarukira n'omutima gwabo gwona n'amagara gaabo goona, bakiri omu nsi y'abaabanyagire, baakushaba nibareeba ei ensi ei waahaire baishenkurubo eri, n'orurembo oru waatooraine, n'egi nju ei nyombekyeire eiziina ryawe, <verse eid="2CH 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2CH 6:39" />ohurire okushaba n'okweshengyereza kwabo nooyema omu iguru omu mwanya gwawe ogu otuuramu, obamarire ebyabo, osaasire abantu baawe abakucumwireho.<verse eid="2CH 6:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2CH 6:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 7:15">2 Bus 7:15</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 1:6">Neh 1:6</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 1:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 130:2">Zab 130:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu, ai Ruhanga wangye, ote amaisho gaawe, kandi otegye amatu gaawe aha kushaba okuraagume kwashabirwe omu mwanya ogu.<verse eid="2CH 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2CH 6:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:41: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 28:2">1 Bus 28:2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:10">2 Bus 7:10</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:25">Neh 9:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:8">Zab 132:8</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 132:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:10">Isa 61:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu, imuka, ai MUKAMA Ruhanga, oze omu buruhuukiro bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 6:41">Iwe hamwe n'eshanduukye y'Amaani gaawe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 6:41">Abanyamurwa baawe, MUKAMA Ruhanga, bajwekwe okujunwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 6:41">N'abarikwera baawe bashemerererwe omu burungi bwawe.<verse eid="2CH 6:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2CH 6:42" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:42: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 132:1">Zab 132:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 132:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai, MUKAMA Ruhanga, otabinga owaawe owaashukirweho amajuta!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 6:42">Ijuka embabazi ezi waagiriire omwiru waawe Daudi.<verse eid="2CH 6:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CH 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga okwijura hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:54">1 Bag 8:54</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:38">18:38</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 21:26">1 Bus 21:26</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2 Bus 5:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Sulemaani ku yaaherize okushaba kwe, omuriro gwaruga omu iguru, gwayokyeza kimwe ekitambo ky'okwotsya n'ebindi bitambo, ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kyaijura hekalu. <verse eid="2CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 7:2" />Abanyamurwa tibaabaasa kutaaha mu nju ya MUKAMA, ahabw'okuba ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kikaijura egyo nju ye. <verse eid="2CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 7:3" />Abaisraeli boona ku baareebire omuriro gwashuuma, n'ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kiri ahari hekalu, bainama ahansi, baajuumara aha mabaare gaariire, baaramya, baasiima MUKAMA nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 7:3">Ahakuba ni murungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 7:3">Ahabw'okuba embabazi ze n'ez'ebiro byona.<verse eid="2CH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 7:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:62">1 Bag 8:62</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 8:63">63</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omugabe n'abantu boona baatamba ebitambo omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 7:5" />Omugabe Sulemaani yaahonga ente obukumi bubiri n'enkumi ibiri, n'entaama akasiriira n'obukumi bubiri kuba ebitambo. Atyo omugabe n'abantu boona baashoroora enju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:16">1 Bus 15:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:12">2 Bus 5:12</ref>. </char></note> Abanyamurwa baayemerera omu myanya yaabo; n'Abaleevi baayemerera, baine ebintu by'okuteerera MUKAMA, ebi omugabe Daudi yaakozire ahabw'okusiima MUKAMA, akaguma naabiteera, ahu yaabaire ayendera kumusiimira hoona, naagira ati: Ahabw'okuba embabazi ze n'ez'ebiro byona. Omu maisho g'abo Baleevi abanyamurwa baateera amakondere, kandi Abaisraeli boona baayemerera.<verse eid="2CH 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'obugyenyi bw'okweza hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 7:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:7-10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:64-66">1 Bag 8:64-66</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Sulemaani yaayeza ahagati y'ekikaari ekyabaire kiri omu maisho g'enju ya MUKAMA; ahakuba okwo niyo yaahongyeire ekitambo ky'okwotsya, n'ebishanju by'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, ahabw'okuba eitambiro ry'emiringa eri Sulemaani yaakozire, tirirabaasize kuhikwaho bitambo by'okwotsya, n'empongano z'esaano, n'ebishaju. <verse eid="2CH 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 7:8" />Omuri obwo bunaku Sulemaani yaataho obugyenyi okumara ebiro mushanju, hamwe n'Abaisraeli boona, abaabaire bari omutwe muhango munonga, abaarugire hoona okuruga ahu orikutaahira nooza Hamasi, okuhika aha mugyera gwa Misri. <verse eid="2CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 7:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:36">Lev 23:36</ref>. </char></note> Aha izooba rya munaana baagira okuteerana okurikwera; ahakuba bakaba bamazire ebiro mushanju nibashoroora eitambiro, n'ebindi mushanju omu bugyenyi. <verse eid="2CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 7:10" />Aha kiro kya makumi abiri na bishatu eky'okwezi kwa mushanju yaayohereza abantu omu maka gaabo, bashemereirwe, kandi bananukire omu mitima ahabw'oburungi obu MUKAMA yaayorekire Daudi na Sulemaani n'abantu be Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 7:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11-22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:1-9">1 Bag 9:1-9</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Sulemaani yaaheza enju ya MUKAMA n'ey'omugabe; byona ebi Sulemaani yaabaire ateekateekire kukora omu nju ya MUKAMA n'omu nju ye, yaabiheza gye.<verse eid="2CH 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">MUKAMA okugaruka kweyoreka Sulemaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 7:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 12:5">Bir 12:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima MUKAMA yaayeyoreka Sulemaani nyekiro, yaamugira ati: Mpuriire okushaba kwawe, kandi nyetooraniire omwanya ogu kuba ogw'enju y'okutambiramu ebitambo. <verse eid="2CH 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 7:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:26">2 Bus 6:26</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 6:28">28</ref>. </char></note> Ku ndikinga eiguru, enjura yaabura, nari naaragiira enzigye kukunuura ensi, nari naayohereza orufu omu bantu bangye, <verse eid="2CH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 12:7">2 Bus 12:7</ref>. </char></note> abantu bangye abarikwetererwa eiziina ryangye, ku baryecureeza, baashaba, bansherura, baareka emitwarize yaabo emibi, obwo ndyahurira niinyema omu iguru, nsaasire ekibi kyabo, kandi ntambire ensi yaabo. <verse eid="2CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:40">2 Bus 6:40</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga hati niinyija kuguma ninta amaisho gangye, kandi nintega amatu gangye aha kushaba okurishabirwa omu mwanya ogu. <verse eid="2CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 7:16" />Ahabw'okuba hati naatoorana egi nju, kandi naagyeeza, ngu eiziina ryangye ribone kugigumamu ebiro byona; amaisho gangye n'omutima gwangye biryagigumaho obutwire bwona. <verse eid="2CH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 7:17" />Kandi iwe ku origyendera omu maisho gangye, nka sho Daudi oku yaatwarize, waakora byona ebi nkuragiire, waayorobera ebiragiro byangye n'ebi naataireho, <verse eid="2CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 7:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:25">1 Bag 8:25</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 6:16">2 Bus 6:16</ref>. </char></note> obwo ndyahamya ekitebe ky'obugabe bwawe, nk'oku naaragaine na sho Daudi, ningira nti: Toribura muntu w'okutegyeka Israeli.<verse eid="2CH 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 7:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:14">Lev 26:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:15">Bir 28:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ku muriteishuka, mwayanga kworobera ebiragiro byangye n'ebyatairweho ebi naataire omu maisho gaanyu, mwagyenda mwaheereza baaruhanga abandi, kandi mwabaramya, <verse eid="2CH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 7:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:37">Bir 28:37</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 29:28">29:28</ref>. </char></note> obwo ndyabarandura omu nsi ei naabahaire, kandi n'enju egi ei naashorooreire eiziina ryangye, ndyaginaga, ngiihe omu maisho gangye, ngihindure eky'okucwaho enfumu n'ekigaaniizo omu mahanga goona. <verse eid="2CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 7:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:24">Bir 29:24</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:8">Yer 22:8</ref>, <ref loc="JER 22:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi egi nju erikuhimbisibwa etyo, buri muntu oriba naarabaho aryatangaara, naagira ati: Beitu shi MUKAMA akatura ki egi nsi n'egi nju? <verse eid="2CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 7:22" />Bwanyima baagire bati: Ahabw'okuba bakatsigaho MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo owaabaihire omu nsi ya Misri, baahamira ahari baaruhanga abandi, baabaramya, kandi baabaheereza; nikyo abareeteireho obubi obu bwona.<verse eid="2CH 7:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CH 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ebindi ebi Sulemaani yaakozire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1-18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 9:10-28">1 Bag 9:10-28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha muheru gw'emyaka makumi abiri ei Sulemaani yaayombekyeiremu enju ya MUKAMA n'eye ahabwe, <verse eid="2CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 8:2" />Sulemaani akombeka busya endembo ezi Hiraamu yaamuhaire, yaazitamu Abaisraeli.<verse eid="2CH 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 8:3" />Bwanyima Sulemaani yaateera Hamasi-zooba, yaagikwata. <verse eid="2CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 8:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:7">2 Bus 14:7</ref>. </char></note> Yaayombeka Tadimoori omu ihamba, n'endembo zoona ez'amabiikiro ezi yaayombekire omuri Hamasi. <verse eid="2CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 8:5" />Kandi yaayombeka Besi-horoni eya ruguru na Besi-horoni eya ifo, endembo ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare, eziine amarembo g'enyigi ezirikukingwa empimbi, <verse eid="2CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 8:6" />na Baalasi n'endembo z'amabiikiro zoona ezi Sulemaani yaabaire aine, n'endembo zoona ez'ebigaari bye, n'endembo z'engabo ze ezirikugyendera aha mbaraasi, n'ekindi kyona eki Sulemaani yaabaire ayenda kwombeka omuri Yerusaalemu, Lebanooni n'ensi zoona ezaabaire ziri omu bugabe bwe. <verse eid="2CH 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 8:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:18-21">Kut 15:18-21</ref>. </char></note> Abantu boona abaahonokire aha Bahiiti, Abaamori, Abaperizi, Abahiivi n'Abayebusi abaabaire batari Baisraeli, <verse eid="2CH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 8:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:6">1 Bag 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 16:10">Yos 16:10</ref>. </char></note> baijukuru baabo abaahonokireho omuri egyo nsi, abu Abaisraeli bataracwekyerereize kimwe,–abo nibo Sulemaani yaahindwire abahuuku b'okubakorera emirimo, bakaguma batyo n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="2CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 8:9" />Kwonka Abaisraeli bo Sulemaani tarahindwire bahuuku b'okumukorera; kureka bakaba abaserukare, abandi baaba abatware be, abandi abakuru b'ebigaari bye, n'abandi baaba engabo ze ezirikugyendera aha mbaraasi. <verse eid="2CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 8:10" />Kandi abatware abo abakuru b'omugabe Sulemaani, abaabaire nibategyeka abantu, baaba magana abiri na makumi ataano.<verse eid="2CH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 8:11" />Sulemaani yaiha muhara wa Faraho omu rurembo rwa Daudi, yaamuta omu nju ei yaamwombekyeire; ahakuba akagira ati: Omukazi wangye tashemereire kuguma omu nju ya Daudi omugabe wa Israeli, ahabw'okuba emyanya ei eshanduukye ya MUKAMA eiziremu n'erikwera.<verse eid="2CH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 8:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 4:1">2 Bus 4:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Sulemaani yaatandika kutambira MUKAMA ebitambo by'okwotsya aha itambiro rya MUKAMA, eri yaayombekire omu maisho g'ekisasi kya hekalu, <verse eid="2CH 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 8:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:38">Kur 29:38</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:3">Kub 28:3</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 28:9">9</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 28:11">11</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 28:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 29:2">29:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:16">Bir 16:16</ref>. </char></note> nk'omurimo gwa buri izooba oku gwabaire nigwetengwa, naahonga nk'oku Musa yaaragiire ebya sabato, ebya buri kuboneka kw'okwezi, n'eby'amagyenyi ashatu aga buri mwaka–obugyenyi bw'emigaati etatumbisiibwe, obugyenyi bwa saabiiti, n'obugyenyi bw'ensiisira. <verse eid="2CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 8:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:17-23">1 Bus 9:17-23</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 24:1-31">24:1-31</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 25:1-30">25:1-30</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 26:1">26:1</ref>. </char></note> Nk'ekiragiro kya Daudi ishe oku kyabaire kiri, yaataho abanyamurwa b'okukora omurimo gw'obuheereza omu mbu, n'Abaleevi ahabw'omurimo gwabo ogw'okuhimbisa, n'ogw'okuheereza omu maisho g'abanyamurwa, nk'omurimo gwa buri izooba oku gwabaire nigwetengwa, kandi n'abakumiirizi b'amarembo ab'okurinda amarembo goona omu mbu; ahabw'okuba okwo nikwo Daudi omushaija wa Ruhanga yaabaire aragiire. <verse eid="2CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 8:15" />Kandi tibaateishuka kureka ebi omugabe yaaragiire abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi ebirikukwata aha kintu kyona n'aha by'amabiikiro.<verse eid="2CH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 8:16" />Okwo nikwo omurimo gwona ogwa Sulemaani gwahweire, okwiha aha izooba eri omusingi gw'enju ya MUKAMA gwateereirweho, okuhitsya ahu yaahwereire. Batyo baahereza kimwe enju ya MUKAMA.<verse eid="2CH 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 8:17" />Bwanyima Sulemaani yaaza Ezioni-geberi na Eloosi aha rubaju rw'enyanja omu nsi ya Edomu. <verse eid="2CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 8:18" />Hiraamu yaayohereza abagaragwa be kumutwarira emeeri n'abarimbi be abamanyiire enyanja, baaza Ofiri hamwe n'abashaija ba Sulemaani, baihayo etalanta z'ezaabu magana ana na makumi ataano, baazireetera omugabe Sulemaani.<verse eid="2CH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omugabekazi wa Sheeba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 10:1-13">1 Bag 10:1-13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omugabekazi wa Sheeba ku yaahuriire okurangaanwa kwa Sulemaani, yaija Yerusaalemu kumubuuza ebibuuzo bigumire naamugyeza; yaija ashendekyereziibwe abantu baingi munonga, n'engamira zeekoreire emigaju, n'ezaabu nyingi munonga, kandi n'amabaare ag'obuguzi bwingi. Ku yaahikire ahari Sulemaani, yaamugambira kyona ekyabaire kimuri aha mutima.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:42">Mat 12:42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:31">Luk 11:31</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 9:2" />Sulemaani yaagarukamu ebi yaamubuurize byona; tihariho kigambo na kimwe ekyayeshobire Sulemaani, eki ataramushobororeire. <verse eid="2CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 9:3" />Omugabekazi wa Sheeba ku yaareebire obwengye bwa Sulemaani, enju ei yaayombekire, <verse eid="2CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 9:4" />eby'okurya by'aha meeza ye, emishutamire y'abagaragwa be, n'emiheerereze y'abaheereza be, n'ebijwaro byabo, n'abagabuzi be ba viinyo n'ebijwaro byabo, n'ebitambo by'okwotsya ebi yaabaire naahongyera aha nju ya MUKAMA, omutima gwamuhwa omunda.<verse eid="2CH 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 9:5" />Yaagira omugabe ati: Ebigambo ebi naahuriire ndi omu nsi yangye ebirikugamba aha by'emitwarize yaawe n'obwengye bwawe bikaba biri eby'amazima, <verse eid="2CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 9:6" />kwonka tindabiikiriize okuhitsya obu nyeiziire, eriisho ryangye rikabyereebera; nkashanga batarangambiire n'obu kyakuba ekicweka kimwe kya kabiri ky'obwingi bw'obwengye bwawe; nookirira kimwe ebi naahuriire. <verse eid="2CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 9:7" />Abashaija baawe bahiiriirwe! N'abaheereza baawe, abeemerera obutoosha omu maisho gaawe, bakahurira obwengye bwawe, nabo bahiiriirwe! <verse eid="2CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 9:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:23">1 Bus 29:23</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 2:11">2 Bus 2:11</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ahimbisibwe, owaakusiimire, akakuta aha kitebe ky'obugabe bwe, kuba omugabe ahabwa MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe! Ruhanga waawe ogwo ahabw'okukunda Abaisraeli n'okwenda kubahamya ebiro byona, nikyo yaakuteereireho kuba omugabe w'okubategyeka, ngu obone kucwa emanja z'oburyo omu kuhikiirira. <verse eid="2CH 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 9:9" />Bwanyima yaaha omugabe etalanta z'ezaabu igana na makumi abiri, emigaju mingi munonga, n'amabaare g'obuguzi bwingi; tihakabahoga migaju nk'ei omugabekazi wa Sheeba yaahaire omugabe Sulemaani.<verse eid="2CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 9:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 8:18">2 Bus 8:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi abashaija ba Hiraamu n'aba Sulemaani, abaabaire bareeta ezaabu okuruga Ofiri, bakareeta embaaho za alumuugi n'amabaare g'obuguzi bwingi. <verse eid="2CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 9:11" />Ezo mbaaho za alumuugi omugabe yaazibaijamu amatembero g'enju ya MUKAMA n'ag'enju ye ahabwe, n'endingiri n'enanga ahabw'abeeshongozi; hakaba hatakareebwaga mbaaho za alumuugi ezirikushusha nk'ezo omu nsi ya Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 9:12" />Omugabe Sulemaani yaaha omugabekazi wa Sheeba ebi yaabaire naayenda byona, n'ebi yaamushabire byona, okwihaho ebi yaamureeteire. Bwanyima yaakuba, yaagaruka omu nsi ye n'abagaragwa be.<verse eid="2CH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obutungi bwa Sulemaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 9:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:13-28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 10:14-28">1 Bag 10:14-28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ezaabu eyaabaire ereetwa owa Sulemaani buri mwaka ekaba eba etalanta magana mukaaga na makumi mukaaga na mukaaga, <verse eid="2CH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 9:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:10">Zab 72:10</ref>. </char></note> otabariiremu eyaabaire eruga omu bashuubuzi n'omu batunzi; kandi abagabe ba Buharabu boona n'abategyeki b'omu nsi bakaba bareetera Sulemaani ezaabu n'efeeza. <verse eid="2CH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 9:15" />Omugabe Sulemaani yaaheeshesa engabo z'ezaabu magana abiri, engabo emwe neeheeshwa omu zaabu ya shekeli magana mukaaga. <verse eid="2CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 9:16" />Kandi yaaheeshesa ezindi ngabo z'ezaabu magana ashatu; engabo emwe neeheeshwa omu zaabu ya shekeli magana ashatu; omugabe yaazita omu nju y'ekibira kya Lebanooni. <verse eid="2CH 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 9:17" />Kandi yaabaijesa ekitebe ky'obugabe kihango omu miino y'enjojo, yaakishweka ezaabu eshemeziibwe. <verse eid="2CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 9:18" />Ekyo kitebe ky'obugabe kikaba kiine amatembero mukaaga, n'akatebe k'ebigyere k'ezaabu, ebyabaire bikoreirwe hamwe n'ekyo kitebe; aha buri rubaju rw'ekyo kitebe hariho ah'okuta emikono, n'ebishushani bibiri by'entare ezeemereire aha rubaju rw'ah'okuta emikono; <verse eid="2CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 9:19" />kandi n'ebindi bishushani by'entare ikumi na bibiri byemereire bibiri bibiri ahari buri itembero ahari ago matembero mukaaga. Omu bugabe obundi bwona tihariho kitebe ekyabaire nikishushana nakyo. <verse eid="2CH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 9:20" />Eby'okunywaisa eby'omugabe Sulemaani byona bikaba biri eby'ezaabu, kandi n'ebintu byona eby'omu nju y'omu kibira kya Lebanooni bikaba biri eby'ezaabu eshemeziibwe; omu biro bya Sulemaani efeeza ekaba etarikuteekateekwaho kuba ekintu. <verse eid="2CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 9:21" />Ahakuba emeeri z'omugabe zikaba ziza Tarushiishi n'abashaija ba Hiraamu; omurundi gumwe omu myaka eshatu ezo meeri za Tarushiishi zikaba ziija, zireetsire ezaabu, efeeza, emiino y'enjojo, enkobe na zaanyamunyonyi.<verse eid="2CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 9:22" />Okwo nikwo omugabe Sulemaani yaakirize abagabe boona ab'omu nsi obutungi n'obwengye. <verse eid="2CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 9:23" />Abagabe boona ab'omu nsi bakaba beetenga kureeba Sulemaani, ngu bahurire obwengye bwe, obu Ruhanga yaamuhaire. <verse eid="2CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 9:24" />Kandi weena owaabaire aija akaba areeta omutoijo, ebintu by'efeeza n'eby'ezaabu, ebijwaro, sumuruna, emigaju, embaraasi n'enyumbu; ebyo byona nikwo byabaire biija buri mwaka. <verse eid="2CH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 9:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 1:14">2 Bus 1:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Sulemaani akaba aine emyanya obukumi buna ei embaraasi ze ezirikukurura ebigaari zaabaire ziraaramu, kandi aine abashaija abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi kakumi n'enkumi ibiri, abu yaataire omu ndembo z'ebigaari bye, n'omuri Yerusaalemu owa omugabe. <verse eid="2CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 9:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:21">1 Bag 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 72:8">Zab 72:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaategyeka abagabe boona okuruga aha mugyera Furaati okuhika omu nsi y'Abafilistia n'aha mwatano gwa Misri. <verse eid="2CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 9:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 1:15">2 Bus 1:15</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 1:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaareetera Yerusaalemu kugira efeeza nyingi nk'amabaare, n'ebiti by'emyereezi byaba nk'emisikamoori y'omu mpita. <verse eid="2CH 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 9:28" />Kandi bakaba bareetera Sulemaani embaraasi nibaziiha Misri n'omu nsi ezindi zoona.<verse eid="2CH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Sulemaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 9:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:29-31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 11:41-43">1 Bag 11:41-43</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Sulemaani, okwiha aha kutandika okuhitsya aha muheru, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'ebyabaireho ekya Nasani nabi, n'omu kitabo ky'obunabi ekya Ahiya owa Shiilo, n'omu kitabo ky'okworekwa ekya Ido omuhanuuzi, aha bya Yeroboamu mwene Nebati?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:1">2 Sam 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:29">1 Bag 11:29</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:29">1 Bus 29:29</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 12:15">2 Bus 12:15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 13:22">13:22</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 9:30" />Sulemaani yaamara aha ngoma emyaka makumi ana naategyekyera Israeli yoona omuri Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 9:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:10">1 Bag 2:10</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Sulemaani yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa omu rurembo rwa Daudi ishe; Rehoboamu omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2CH 9:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CH 10" />
  <para style="s1">Obugabe bwa Israeli okucuubwamu habiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1-19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 12:1-20">1 Bag 12:1-20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Rehoboamu akaza Shekemu, ahakuba Abaisraeli boona niyo baabaire bagiire kumwemeka. <verse eid="2CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 10:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:40">1 Bag 11:40</ref>. </char></note> Yeroboamu mwene Nebati ku yaakihuriire, (ahakuba akaba ari Misri, ei yaabaire ahungiire omugabe Sulemaani), yaaruga Misri, yaagaruka owaabo. <verse eid="2CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 10:3" />Baatuma kumweta; atyo Yeroboamu n'Abaisraeli boona baija ahari Rehoboamu, baamugira bati: <verse eid="2CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:15">1 Bag 5:15</ref>. </char></note> Sho akongyera oburemeezi aha kutegyekwa kwaitu. Mbwenu otutuubize aha mirimo erikurusya, ei sho yaabaire atukoresa, n'aha buremeezi bw'okutegyeka kwe, naitwe nitwija kukuheereza. <verse eid="2CH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 10:5" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Mugarukye aha bwanyima y'ebiro bishatu. Batyo abantu baayaabuuka, baagyenda.<verse eid="2CH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 10:6" />Bwanyima omugabe Rehoboamu yaaza omu naama n'abagurusi abaabaire batabaarira Sulemaani ishe akiriho, yaabagira ati: Nimumpa bwengye ki okugarukamu abo bantu? <verse eid="2CH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 10:7" />Baamugira bati: Ku oraatwaze gye abo bantu, waabagwisa gye, obwo nibwo bariba abairu baawe ebiro byona. <verse eid="2CH 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 10:8" />Kwonka we yaayanga enaama ei abo bagurusi baamuhaire, yaaza omu naama n'abatsigazi abaanyeetsire nawe, kandi abaabaire nibamutabaarira. <verse eid="2CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 10:9" />Yaababuuza ati: Nimumpa bwengye ki okugarukamu abo bantu, abangizire ngu mbatuubize aha buremeezi bw'obutegyeki obu tata yaabataireho? <verse eid="2CH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 10:10" />Abo batsigazi abaanyeetsire nawe baamugira bati: Oku nikwo oraagarukyemu abantu abakushabire nibagira bati: Sho akongyera oburemeezi aha kutegyekwa kwaitu; mbwenu iwe otutuubieho; obagire oti: Akakumu kangye akahera nikakira obuhango enyugunyu ya tata. <verse eid="2CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 10:11" />Mbwenu nk'oku tata yaabeekoreize omugamba guremeire, nyowe niinyija kukizaho. Tata akabateeza enkoba, nyowe niinyija kubateeza skorupio.<verse eid="2CH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 10:12" />Aha kiro kya kashatu Yeroboamu n'abantu boona baija aha mugabe Rehoboamu, nk'oku yaabagizire ati: Mugarukye aha kiro kya kashatu. <verse eid="2CH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 10:13" />Omugabe Rehoboamu yaabagarukamu n'amaani, naayanga obwengye obu abagurusi babaire bamuhaire; <verse eid="2CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 10:14" />yaabagarukamu nk'obwengye bw'abatsigazi obu bamuhaire oku bwabaire buri, ati: Tata akabeekoreza omugamba guremeire, kwonka nyowe niinyija kukizaho; akabateeza enkoba, kwonka nyowe niinyija kubateeza skorupio. <verse eid="2CH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:29-39">1 Bag 11:29-39</ref>. </char></note> Atyo omugabe tiyaabahurira, ahabw'okuba kikaba kirugire ahari Ruhanga, ngu MUKAMA ahikiirize ekigambo eki yaagambiire Yeroboamu mwene Nebati, naakirabya omuri Ahiya owa Shiilo.<verse eid="2CH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 10:16" />Abaisraeli boona ku baareebire omugabe yaayanga kubahurira, baamugira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">Twine kakwate ki na Daudi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">Titwine buhunguzi omuri mwene Yese.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">Imwe Baisraeli 'mwe, nimugarukye omu mahema gaanyu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">Naimwe aba Daudi mugume mwemarire ebyanyu n'oruganda rwanyu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 10:16">Batyo Abaisraeli boona baagaruka omu maka gaabo. <verse eid="2CH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 10:17" />Kwonka Rehoboamu yaagumizamu naategyeka Abaisraeli abaabaire batwire omu ndembo za Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 10:18" />Bwanyima omugabe Rehoboamu yaatuma Hadoraamu, owaabaire ari omukuru w'abakozi b'emirimo y'okuhatwa; Abaisraeli boona baamuteera amabaare, yaafa. Omugabe ku yaabihuriire, ahonaaho yaaza omu kigaari kye kuhungira Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 10:19" />Okwo nikwo Abaisraeli baagomeire enju ya Daudi n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="2CH 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CH 11" />
  <para style="s1">Rehoboamu okuhamya obugabe bwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1-4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 12:21-24">1 Bag 12:21-24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Rehoboamu ku yaahikire Yerusaalemu, yaateeranira hamwe enju ya Yuda yoona n'oruganda rwa Benyamiini, yaatooranamu abashaija emanzi akasiriira n'obukumi munaana ab'okurwanisa Israeli, ngu babone kumugarurira obugabe. <verse eid="2CH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 11:2" />Kwonka ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Shemaaya, omushaija wa Ruhanga, nikigira kiti: Gambira Rehoboamu mwene Sulemaani omugabe wa Yuda n'Abaisraeli boona ab'omuri Yuda na Benyamiini, oti: <verse eid="2CH 11:2" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 11:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:8">2 Bus 28:8</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 28:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Mutahurura, n'obu kwakuba okurwanisa beene waanyu. Buri muntu agarukye omu ka ye, ahakuba ekintu eki niinye kirugireho. Batyo baahurira ekigambo kya MUKAMA, baagarukayo, tibaarwanisa Yeroboamu.<verse eid="2CH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 11:5" />Rehoboamu yaatuura Yerusaalemu, kandi yaayombeka omuri Yuda endembo z'okwerinda abazigu. <verse eid="2CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 11:6" />Yaayombeka Betelehemu, Etamu, Tekoa, <verse eid="2CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 11:7" />Besi-zuuri, Sooko, Adulaamu, <verse eid="2CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 11:8" />Gaasi, Mareesha, Ziifu, <verse eid="2CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 11:9" />Adoraimu, Lakishi, Azeka, <verse eid="2CH 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 11:10" />Zoora, Ayalooni, na Heburooni, endembo z'omuri Yuda na Benyamiini ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare. <verse eid="2CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 11:11" />N'ebigo byazo yaabigumya, yaabitamu abakuru b'engabo, yaabibiikamu eby'okurya n'amajuta na viinyo. <verse eid="2CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 11:12" />Kandi omuri ezo ndembo zoona yaatamu engabo n'amacumu, yaazihindura ez'amaani maingi munonga. Atyo yaagumya Abayuda n'Ababenyamiini bari abe.<verse eid="2CH 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 11:13" />Bwanyima abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi, abaabaire batwire omuri Israeli yoona, baaruga omu myanya yoona ei baabaire batwiremu, baija ah'ari. <verse eid="2CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 11:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:9">2 Bus 13:9</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 35:2">Kub 35:2</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Abaleevi bakareka amariisizo gaabo n'obutaka bwabo, baija omuri Yuda na Yerusaalemu, ahabw'okuba Yeroboamu n'abatabani bakabaiha omu murimo gw'obuheereza bw'abanyamurwa ba MUKAMA, <verse eid="2CH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 11:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28">1 Bag 12:28</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 12:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 13:33">13:33</ref>. </char></note> yaataho abanyamurwa abe kuheereza omu myanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, n'okukora omurimo gw'okuheereza baadaimoni, n'ebishushani by'enyana bibiri ebi yaakozire. <verse eid="2CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:9">2 Bus 15:9</ref>. </char></note> Ab'omu nganda zoona eza Israeli, abaataire emitima yaabo aha kusherura MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, baija bakuratiire abo Baleevi, baahika Yerusaalemu, baatambirirayo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo ebitambo. <verse eid="2CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 11:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 12:1">2 Bus 12:1</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baahamya obugabe bwa Yuda, kandi baamara emyaka eshatu nibagumiza kimwe Rehoboamu mwene Sulemaani; ahabw'okuba omuri egyo myaka eshatu bakaguma nibagyendera omu muhanda gwa Daudi na Sulemaani.<verse eid="2CH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 11:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 16:6">1 Sam 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 17:13">17:13</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 17:28">28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Rehoboamu akashwera Mahalaasi muhara wa Yerimoosi mwene Daudi na Abihaili muhara wa Eliabu mwene Yese; <verse eid="2CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 11:19" />yaamuzaarira abaana b'aboojo, Yeushi, Shemaria na Zahaamu. <verse eid="2CH 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 11:20" />Bwanyima y'ogwo yaashwera Maaka, muhara wa Abusalomu, yaamuzaarira Abiya, Atai, ziiza na Shelomiisi. <verse eid="2CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 11:21" />(Kandi Rehoboamu akashwera abakazi ikumi na munaana n'ebinyanshunju makumi mukaaga; yaazaara abaana b'aboojo makumi abiri na munaana, n'ab'abaishiki makumi mukaaga); kwonka akaba akunda Maaka muhara wa Abusalomu okukira abakazi be boona n'ebinyanshunju bye; <verse eid="2CH 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 11:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:31">1 Bag 14:31</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:15-17">Bir 22:15-17</ref>. </char></note> n'ahabw'ekyo yaagira Abiya mwene Maaka omwana mukuru omuri beene ishe, ahakuba akaba naayenda kumuhindura omugabe. <verse eid="2CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 11:23" />Yaakoresa obwengye, yaata abatabani omu byanga byona eby'omuri Yuda na Benyamiini omu ndembo zoona ezirimu ebigo; yaabaha eby'okurya bingi munonga, kandi yaabashwererera abakazi.<verse eid="2CH 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CH 12" />
  <para style="s1">Omugabe wa Misri okuteera Yuda n'okunyaga eby'omuri hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 14:22-24">1 Bag 14:22-24</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 11:17">2 Bus 11:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:16">26:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obugabe bwa Rehoboamu ku bwaherize kuhama n'okuba obw'amaani, we n'Abaisraeli boona baareka kukuratira ebiragiro bya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:40">1 Bag 11:40</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:25">14:25</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omu mwaka gwa kataano ogw'omu busingye bwe Shishaki omugabe wa Misri akainamuka, yaateera Yerusaalemu, <verse eid="2CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 12:3" />aine ebigaari rukumi na magana abiri, n'abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi obukumi mukaaga; n'abantu abarugire nawe Misri bakaba batarikubarwa, bari aba Libya, aba Sukimu n'aba Esiopia. <verse eid="2CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 11:5-12">2 Bus 11:5-12</ref>. </char></note> Yaakwata endembo ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare, yaahika Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 12:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:22">1 Bag 12:22</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 11:2">2 Bus 11:2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 15:2">15:2</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaahikireyo, Shemaaya nabi yaija ahari Rehoboamu n'aha bategyeki ba Yuda, abaabaire bateeraniire Yerusaalemu ahabwa Shishaki, yaabagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Ondugireho, mbwenu naanye naakurekurira Shishaki. <verse eid="2CH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 12:6" />Ahonaaho abategyeki ba Israeli n'omugabe baayecureeza, nibagira bati: MUKAMA niwe ahikiriire. <verse eid="2CH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 12:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:29">1 Bag 21:29</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:14">2 Bus 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 34:25">34:25</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA ku yaareebire baayecureeza, ekigambo kye kyaizira Shemaaya nikigira kiti: Beecureize; n'ahabw'ekyo tinkibahwerekyereza; kureka niinyija kugira eki naabajuna, kandi ekiniga kyangye tikirikwija kushukwa hari Yerusaalemu kuteerwa Shishaki. <verse eid="2CH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 12:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:47">Bir 28:47</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 28:48">48</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:13">Isa 26:13</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka nibaija kuba abairu be, babone kumanya obutegyeki bwangye, n'obw'abagabe b'ezo nsi.<verse eid="2CH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 12:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:9-11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 14:25-28">1 Bag 14:25-28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo Shishaki omugabe wa Misri yaateera Yerusaalemu, yaanyaga ebintu by'obuguzi bwingi eby'omu nju ya MUKAMA, n'eby'omu nju y'omugabe; yaatwara ebintu byona. Kandi yaatwara n'engabo z'ezaabu ezi Sulemaani yaabaire aheesire;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 9:15">2 Bus 9:15</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 9:16">16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 12:10" />bwanyima omugabe Rehoboamu yaaheesha ezindi z'emiringa omu mwanya gwazo, yaazibiitsya abakuru b'abarinzi, abaabaire barinda orwigi rw'enju y'omugabe. <verse eid="2CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 12:11" />Obutoosha omugabe ku yaabaire aza omu nju ya MUKAMA, abo barinzi baija, bazihagatira, bwanyima bazigarura omuri egyo nju y'abarinzi. <verse eid="2CH 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 12:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:3">2 Bus 19:3</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaayecureize, ekiniga kya MUKAMA kyamurugaho, ngu arekye kumucwekyerereza kimwe; kandi omuri Yuda ebintu bikaba biriho gye.<verse eid="2CH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 12:13" />Atyo omugabe Rehoboamu yaayegaruramu amaani, yaategyeka. Rehoboamu akaba aine emyaka makumi ana na gumwe, obu yaatandika kutegyeka; yaategyekyera emyaka ikumi na mushanju omuri Yerusaalemu, orurembo oru MUKAMA yaatooraine omu nganda zoona ez'Abaisraeli kuba nimwo yaata eiziina rye. Nyina akaba naayetwa Naama Omuamoni. <verse eid="2CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 12:14" />Akakora kubi, ahabw'okuba tarataire mutima aha kusherura MUKAMA.<verse eid="2CH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 12:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 14:29">1 Bag 14:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu ebi Rehoboamu yaakozire okwiha aha kutandika okuhitsya aha muheru, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'ebyabaireho ekya Shemaaya nabi, n'ekya Ido omuhanuuzi? Kandi hakaba habaho obweme ahagati ya Rehoboamu na Yeroboamu. <verse eid="2CH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 12:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:31">1 Bag 14:31</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Rehoboamu yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa omu rurembo rwa Daudi; Abiya omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2CH 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Abiya omugabe wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 15:1">1 Bag 15:1</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 15:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa ikumi na munaana ogw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Yeroboamu, Abiya akatandika kutegyeka Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:7">1 Bag 15:7</ref>. </char></note> Yaategyekyera emyaka eshatu omuri Yerusaalemu. Nyina akaba naayetwa Mikaya, muhara wa Urieli owa Gibea.<verse eid="2CH 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 13:3" />Omuri obwo bunaku hakabaho obweme ahagati ya Abiya na Yeroboamu. Abiya yaahurura n'abashaija amamanzi abamanyiire engamba, abashaija entoore obusiriira buna; Yeroboamu we yaatenga orugamba kumurwanisa n'abashaija entoore abarwani b'amaani obusiriira munaana. <verse eid="2CH 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 13:4" />Bwanyima Abiya yaayemerera aha kibungo Zemaraimu, ekiri omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, yaagira ati: Muntegye amatu, iwe Yeroboamu n'Abaisraeli mwena. <verse eid="2CH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 13:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 2:13">Lev 2:13</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:19">Kub 18:19</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam 7:12</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Timushemereire kumanya ku MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli yaahaire Daudi n'abatabani obugabe kutegyeka Israeli, naabaraganisa endagaano y'omwonyo? <verse eid="2CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 13:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:26">1 Bag 11:26</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 12:19">12:19</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 12:20">20</ref>. </char></note> N'obu kiraabe kyabaire kityo, Yeroboamu mwene Nebati, omugaragwa wa Sulemaani mwene Daudi, akaimuka yaagomera mukama we; <verse eid="2CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 13:7" />abashaija bamwe abataine mugasho baija, baakwatanisa nawe, baahiga Rehoboamu mwene Sulemaani akiri muto, atakahamire, atarikubaasa kubazibira.<verse eid="2CH 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 13:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 12:28">1 Bag 12:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu nimuteekateeka ngu nimwija kuzibira obugabe bwa MUKAMA oburi omu mikono ya beene Daudi, ngu niho muri omutwe muhango munonga, kandi ngu niho mwine enyana z'ezaabu ezi Yeroboamu yaabaheesheire kuba baaruhanga baanyu? <verse eid="2CH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 13:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 11:14">2 Bus 11:14</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 11:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:7">Yer 5:7</ref>. </char></note> Timurabingire abanyamurwa ba MUKAMA beene Arooni, n'Abaleevi, mukeeteeraho abandi nk'abantu b'agandi mahanga? Omuntu weena orikwija kweyeza, areetsire enimi y'ekimasha nari empaya z'entaama mushanju, ahinduka omunyamurwa w'abatari baaruhanga. <verse eid="2CH 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 13:10" />Kwonka itwe, MUKAMA niwe Ruhanga waitu, kandi titukamutsigahoga. Abanyamurwa abu twine, abarikuheereza MUKAMA, ni batabani ba Arooni, kandi twine Abaleevi b'okubaheereza. <verse eid="2CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 13:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:31-39">Kur 25:31-39</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 27:20">27:20</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 27:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:2-4">Lev 24:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 1:53">Kub 1:53</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 2:4">2 Bus 2:4</ref>. </char></note> Buri kasheeshe na buri mwabazyo bahongyera MUKAMA ebitambo by'okwotsya, bamwoterera obubaane bw'emigaju erikutaamirana, batebeekanisa emigaati ey'okumurikwa aha meeza y'ezaabu eshemeziibwe, kandi bareeberera ekikondo ky'amatabaaza ky'ezaabu, ngu amatabaaza gaakyo gabone kwaka buri mwabazyo; ahakuba itwe tukuratira ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu yaaturagiire, kwonka imwe mumutsigireho. <verse eid="2CH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 13:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:9">Kub 10:9</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 5:39">Byak 5:39</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, Ruhanga ari hamwe naitwe, naatwebembera, kandi n'abanyamurwa be bari aha, baine enzamba z'okuhuruza ab'okubarwanisa. Imwe beene Israeli 'mwe, murekye kurwanisa MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baashwenkuriimwe; ahabw'okuba timurikubaasa kusingura.<verse eid="2CH 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 13:13" />Obwo Yeroboamu akaba ayohereize ab'okubagwera, ngu babateere nibabareetwa enyima; n'ahabw'ekyo engabo ze zikaba ziri omu maisho g'Abayuda, n'ab'okubagwera babari enyima. <verse eid="2CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:11">2 Bus 14:11</ref>. </char></note> Abayuda ku baanagire amaisho, baashanga orugamba rubaturukire omu maisho n'enyima; baatakira MUKAMA, abanyamurwa baateera enzamba, <verse eid="2CH 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 13:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:12">2 Bus 14:12</ref>. </char></note> n'abashaija ba Yuda baateera orwari; ku baaruteire, Ruhanga yaasingura Yeroboamu n'Abaisraeli boona omu maisho ga Abiya n'Abayuda. <verse eid="2CH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 13:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:8">2 Bus 16:8</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli baahunga Abayuda, Ruhanga yaabahayo omu mikono yaabo. <verse eid="2CH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 13:17" />Abiya n'abantu be baabaitamu abantu baingi munonga; batyo Abaisraeli baafamu abashaija entoore obusiriira butaano. <verse eid="2CH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 13:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:11">2 Bus 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 16:7">16:7</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 16:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo Abaisraeli baahweire eishaija omu bunaku obwo, Abayuda bakabasingura, ahabw'okwesiga MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo. <verse eid="2CH 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 13:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:8">2 Bus 15:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 17:2">17:2</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Abiya yaakurata Yeroboamu, yaamunyaga endembo ezi, Beseeli n'ebirorero byayo, Yeshana n'ebirorero byayo na Efurooni n'ebirorero byayo. <verse eid="2CH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 13:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:20">1 Bag 14:20</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 25:38">1 Sam 25:38</ref>. </char></note> Omu busingye wa Abiya Yeroboamu taragizire bu agaruka kugira amaani; bwanyima MUKAMA yaamurwaza, yaafa. <verse eid="2CH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 13:21" />Kwonka Abiya yaayeyongyera amaani. Yaashwera abakazi ikumi na bana, yaazaara abatabani makumi abiri na babiri, na bahara ikumi na mukaaga. <verse eid="2CH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 13:22" />Endiijo mirimo ya Abiya, emicwe ye n'ebigambo bye bihandiikirwe omu kitabo kya nabi Ido.<verse eid="2CH 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2CH 14" />
  <para style="s1">Asa okuteerwa Abaesiopia, n'okujunwa MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 15:8">1 Bag 15:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Abiya yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa omu rurembo rwa Daudi; Asa omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. Omu biro bye ensi ekamara emyaka ikumi eine obusingye. <verse eid="2CH 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 14:2" />Asa yaakora ebirungi kandi ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 14:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:24">Kur 23:24</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:13">34:13</ref>. </char></note> Akaihaho amatambiro g'enduga-mahanga n'emyanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, yaasheenya enyomyo z'amabaare, yaatema Ashera, <verse eid="2CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 14:4" />kandi yaaragiira Abayuda kusherura MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo, n'okworobera ebiragiro n'ebyatairweho. <verse eid="2CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 14:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:30">Lev 26:30</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 34:4">2 Bus 34:4</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 34:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 17:8">Isa 17:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 27:9">27:9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 6:4">Ezk 6:4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 6:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaiha omu ndembo zoona eza Yuda emyanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, n'ebyoterero by'okwotereraho obubaane. Obugabe bwagira obuhuumure omu busingye bwe. <verse eid="2CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 14:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:15">2 Bus 15:15</ref>. </char></note> Yaayombeka endembo ezeehinguririziibwe amabaare omuri Yuda, ahakuba ensi ekaba eine obusingye. Omuri egyo myaka tiyaagira ngamba; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akamuha obusingye. <verse eid="2CH 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 14:7" />Yaagira Abayuda ati: Ka twombekye endembo ezi, tuzeehinguririze engo z'amabaare, tuzombekyeho eminaara, n'amarembo againe enyigi ezirikukingwa empimbi; ensi ekiri eyaitu, ahabw'okuba tusherwire MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu; tumusherwire, nawe yaatuha obusingye embaju zoona. Batyo baayombeka, baaba gye. <verse eid="2CH 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 14:8" />Kandi Asa akaba aine eihe ry'abashaija obusiriira bushatu b'abarugire Yuda abaine engabo n'amacumu, n'abarugire Benyamiini obusiriira bubiri n'obukumi munaana, ab'engabo n'amata; abo boona bakaba bari abashaija b'amaani amamanzi.<verse eid="2CH 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 14:9" />Bwanyima Zeera owa Esiopia yaija kubarwanisa n'eihe ry'engabo akakaikuru n'ebigaari magana ashatu, yaahika Mareesha. <verse eid="2CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 14:10" />Asa yaashohora kumubugana, baatenga orugamba omu ruhita rwa Zefasa ahari Mareesha. <verse eid="2CH 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:10">Kur 14:10</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 17:45">1 Sam 17:45</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 13:14">2 Bus 13:14</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 13:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:5">Zab 22:5</ref>. </char></note> Asa yaatakira MUKAMA Ruhanga we, naagira ati: Ai MUKAMA, tihaine orikwingana naiwe omu kuhwera abataine maani baateerwa ab'amaani. MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, otuhe emikono, ahabw'okuba niiwe turikwesiga, kandi omu iziina ryawe twizire kurwanisa omutwe ogu muhango munonga ogw'engabo. Ai MUKAMA, niiwe Ruhanga waitu, otaikiriza omuntu kukusingura. <verse eid="2CH 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 14:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:15">2 Bus 13:15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 16:8">16:8</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA yaasingura Abaesiopia omu maisho ga Asa n'Abayuda, Abaesiopia baahunga. <verse eid="2CH 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 14:13" />Asa n'abantu abu yaabaire aine baababinga, baabahitsya Geera, Abaesiopia baafa baingi munonga, tibaabaasa kugaruka kweyunga; ahabw'okuba bakacwekyerezibwa omu maisho ga MUKAMA n'eihe rya. Abashaija ba Yuda baatwara eminyago mingi munonga; <verse eid="2CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 14:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 17:10">2 Bus 17:10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:29">20:29</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:5">Kut 35:5</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima baacwekyereza endembo zoona ezaabaire zeehinguririize Geera, ahabw'okuba Abaesiopia bakaba baitsirwe obwoba obwareetsirwe MUKAMA. Baanyaga ezo ndembo zoona, ahakuba zikaba zirimu eminyago mingi. <verse eid="2CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 14:15" />Kandi baacwekyereza amahema g'abaabaire batungire ente, baanyaga entaama n'engamira nyingi munonga. Bwanyima baagaruka Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="2CH 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2CH 15" />
  <para style="s1">Asa n'Abayuda okuragaana na MUKAMA endagaano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 24:2">Kub 24:2</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 3:10">Bar 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:14">2 Bus 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20">24:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omwoyo wa Ruhanga yaija ahari Azaria mwene Odedi, <verse eid="2CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:9">1 Bus 28:9</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:17">2 Bus 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20">24:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:13">Yer 29:13</ref>. </char></note> yaashohora kubugana Asa, yaamugira ati: Iwe n'Abayuda n'Ababenyamiini, mumpurire. Ruhanga ari hamwe naimwe, mwaba muri hamwe nawe. Ku murikumusherura, nimumuzoora; kwonka ku murikumutsigaho, nawe naabatsigaho. <verse eid="2CH 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 15:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 17:8">2 Bus 17:8</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 17:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 35:3">35:3</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 10:11">Lev 10:11</ref>. </char></note> Nimumanya ku Abaisraeli baamazire omwanya muhango bataine Ruhanga nyamuhanga, n'obu yaakuba omunyamurwa orikubeegyesa, kandi bataine biragiro; <verse eid="2CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:29">Bir 4:29</ref>. </char></note> kwonka ku baahindukiire MUKAMA Ruhanga wa israeli omu busaasi bwabo, baamusherura, baamuzoora. <verse eid="2CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 15:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:6">Bar 5:6</ref>. </char></note> Omu biro ebyo hakaba hatariho busingye aha muntu weena orikushohora, nari orikutaaha, ahabw'okuba emirabanamu mingi ekagwisa kubi munonga abatuuzi boona ab'omuri ago mahanga. <verse eid="2CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 15:6" />Baataanamu, eihanga ryarwana n'erindi, n'orurembo rwarwana n'orundi, ahakuba Ruhanga akabatuntuza n'obusaasi bw'emiringo yoona. <verse eid="2CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 15:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:1">Kut 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:6">Yos 1:6</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 1:7">7</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 1:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Zab 62:12</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka imwe, mugume! Mutacweka emikono; ahabw'okuba emirimo yaanyu eryazimurirwa.<verse eid="2CH 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 15:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 8:12">2 Bus 8:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Asa ku yaahuriire ebyo bigambo by'obunabi bwa Azaria mwene Odedi, yaaguma, yaiha ebishushani ebirikunugwa omu nsi yoona eya Yuda n'eya Benyamiini n'omu ndembo ezi yaakubwire omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, kandi yaahunduuza eitambiro rya MUKAMA eryabaire riri omu maisho g'ekisasi eky'omu maisho ga hekalu ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 15:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 11:16">2 Bus 11:16</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaateeranira hamwe Abayuda n'Ababenyamiini boona, n'abaarugire omuri Efuraimu, Manaase na Simeoni, abaabaire baabashuhuukiiremu; ahakuba abantu baingi, ku baareebire MUKAMA Ruhanga we ari hamwe nawe, baacwa omuri Israeli, baija, baamwehongyera. <verse eid="2CH 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 15:10" />Omu kwezi kwa kashatu kw'omu mwaka gwa ikumi n'etaano ogw'omu busingye bwa Asa, nibwo baateeranira Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 15:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:13-15">2 Bus 14:13-15</ref>. </char></note> Ahari eryo izooba baatambira MUKAMA ente magana mushanju n'entaama obukumi mushanju, nibaziiha omu minyago ei baabaire bareetsire. <verse eid="2CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 15:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:3">2 Bag 23:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 29:10">2 Bus 29:10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 34:31">34:31</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 10:29">Neh 10:29</ref>. </char></note> Baaragaana endagaano kusherura MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo n'omutima gwabo gwona n'amagara gaabo goona; <verse eid="2CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 15:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:6-9">Bir 13:6-9</ref>. </char></note> kandi ngu, omuntu weena oraayangye kusherura MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa israeli, yaaba muto, yaaba mukuru, yaaba mushaija, yaaba mukazi, aitwe. <verse eid="2CH 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 15:14" />Baarahira omu maisho ga MUKAMA n'eiraka rihango, nibateera akaari, n'amakondere n'enzamba. <verse eid="2CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 15:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:7">2 Bus 14:7</ref>. </char></note> Abayuda boona baashemerererwa egyo ndahiro; ahakuba bakarahira n'omutima gwabo gwona, kandi baamusherura n'okwetenga kwabo kwona, baamuzoora; MUKAMA yaabaha obuhuumure embaju zoona.<verse eid="2CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 15:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 15:13-15">1 Bag 15:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:13">Kur 34:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omugabe Asa yaabinga Maaka nyina, yaamwiha aha bwanyin'omugabe, naamutura okukorera Ashara ekishushani ekirikunugwa. Asa yaatema ekyo kishushani, yaakihondahonda, yaakyokyeza aha mugyera Kidirooni. <verse eid="2CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 15:17" />Kwonka emyanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu teraihirwe muri Israeli. N'obu kiraabe kyabaire kityo, omutima gwa Asa gukaba gutaine ky'okuhanwa ebiro bye byona.<verse eid="2CH 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 15:18" />Kandi yaareeta omu nju ya Ruhanga ebintu ebi ishe yaashoroire, efeeza, n'ezaabu, n'ebintu by'okukoresa. <verse eid="2CH 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 15:19" />Tihaabaho bundi bweme okuhitsya omu mwaka gwa makumi ashatu n'etaano ogw'omu busingye bwe.<verse eid="2CH 15:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2CH 16" />
  <para style="s1">Asa okukwatanisa n'Abasiria, n'okuhanwa omuhanuuzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 16:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1-6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 15:17-22">1 Bag 15:17-22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa makumi ashatu na mukaaga ogw'omu busingye bwa Asa, Baasha omugabe wa Israeli akainamuka, yaateera Yuda, yaayombeka Raama, ngu abone kuzibira omuntu weena kuruga owa Asa omugabe wa Yuda, nari okutaaha owe. <verse eid="2CH 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 16:2" />Asa nikwo kwiha efeeza n'ezaabu omu mabiikiro g'omu nju ya MUKAMA, n'ag'omu nju y'omugabe, akabitwekyera Benihadadi omugabe wa Siria, owaabaire atwire Damasiko, naagira ati: <verse eid="2CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 16:3" />Ka turagaane endagaano y'okukwatanisa, nk'oku tata yaaragaine na sho. Reeba, naakutwekyera efeeza n'ezaabu. Gyenda, oite endagaano ei waaragaine na Baasha omugabe wa Israeli, abone kundugira omu nsi. <verse eid="2CH 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 16:4" />Benihadadi yaikiriza eby'omugabe Asa, yaatuma abakuru b'amahe ge kuteera endembo za Israeli, baakwata Iyooni, Daani, Abeeli-maimu n'endembo z'amabiikiro zoona ez'omuri Nafutaali. <verse eid="2CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 16:5" />Baasha ku yaakihuriire, yaarekyera aho kwombeka Raama, yaayemereza omurimo. <verse eid="2CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 16:6" />Bwanyima omugabe Asa yaatwara Abayuda boona, baiha omuri Raama amabaare n'embaaho, ebi Baasha yaabaire naayombekyesa; yaabyombekyesa Geeba na Mizipa.<verse eid="2CH 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 16:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 16:1">1 Bag 16:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 19:2">2 Bus 19:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 31:1">Isa 31:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:5">Yer 17:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu bunaku obwo Hanania omuhanuuzi yaija ahari Asa omugabe wa Yuda, yaamugira ati: Ahabw'okuba oyesigire omugabe wa Siria, tiwaayesiga MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, nikyo eihe ry'omugabe wa Siria rikukiriireho. <verse eid="2CH 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 16:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 12:3">2 Bus 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 14:9-15">14:9-15</ref>. </char></note> Abaesiopia n'Abalibya bakaba batari eihe rihango munonga, eriine ebigaari bingi n'abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi baingi? N'obu kiraabe kyabaire kiri kityo, kwonka ahabw'okwesiga MUKAMA akabahayo omu mikono yaawe. <verse eid="2CH 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 16:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:13">1 Sam 13:13</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:61">1 Bag 8:61</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 15:16">15:16</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 15:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 15:3">Enf 15:3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:10">Zek 4:10</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba amaisho ga MUKAMA gairuka oku n'oku nigabuga ensi yoona, okweyoreka ku ari ow'amaani kuhwera abaine emitima eshugaine ahariwe. Omuri eki okozire eby'obushema; n'ahabw'ekyo okuruga hati noija kuguma noogira obweme. <verse eid="2CH 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 16:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 18:26">2 Bus 18:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:2">Yer 20:2</ref>, <ref loc="JER 20:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho Asa yaagirira omuhanuuzi ekiniga, yaamuta omu nkomo, yaamutwara omu kihome; ahabw'okuba akamugwerwa kubi munonga ahabw'ekyo. Kandi omu bunaku obwo Asa yaabonabonesa abantu bamwe.<verse eid="2CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 16:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:11-14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 15:23">1 Bag 15:23</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 15:24">24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebi Asa yaakozire, okwiha aha kutandika okuhitsya aha muheru, bihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'abagabe ba Yuda na Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 16:12" />Bwanyima omu mwaka gwa makumi ashatu na mwenda ogw'omu busingye bwe, Asa yaarwara ebigyere, egyo ndwara yaaba ey'amaani munonga; hoona n'obu yaarwaire, tarasherwire buhwezi ahari MUKAMA, kureka akabusherura aha bafumu. <verse eid="2CH 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 16:13" />Bwanyima Asa yaafa omu mwaka gwa makumi ana na gumwe ogw'omu busingye bwe, yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru. <verse eid="2CH 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 16:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:19">2 Bus 21:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 34:5">Yer 34:5</ref>. </char></note> Baamuziika omu kituuro, eki yaayetimbiire omu rurembo rwa Daudi. Baarambika omutumbi gwe aha kitanda, ekiijwire emigaju ey'emiringo etari emwe, ejwangiibwe abanyamyoga, kandi baacumika omuriro mwingi kumuhaisa ekitiinisa.<verse eid="2CH 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2CH 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yehoshafaati okuza aha ngoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 17:1" />Yehoshafaati omutabani akategyeka omu mwanya gwa Asa ishe, yaakora eby'okwehamya ngu ayerinde Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 17:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:8">1 Bus 15:8</ref>. </char></note> Yaata emitwe y'engabo omu ndembo zoona eza Yuda ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare, yaata abarinzi omu nsi ya Yuda, n'omu ndembo za Efuraimu, ezi Asa ishe yaakubwire. <verse eid="2CH 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 17:3" />MUKAMA yaaguma na Yehoshafaati, ahabw'okuba akagyendera omu micwe ya ishe ey'okubanza; tiyaakuratira Baabaali, <verse eid="2CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 17:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28">1 Bag 12:28</ref>. </char></note> kureka yaakuratira Ruhanga wa ishe, yaaguma naayorobera ebiragiro bye, tiyaakuratira mitwarize ya Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 17:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 18:1">2 Bus 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:23">32:23</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA yaahamya obugabe bwe; Abayuda boona baaguma nibatoijera Yehoshafaati, yaatunga munonga, kandi yaagira ekitiinisa kingi. <verse eid="2CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 17:6" />Yaagyendera omu muhanda ya MUKAMA n'omutima gutaine bwoba; kandi yaihaho emyanya mikuru y'okuramizamu na Ashera omuri Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 17:7" />Omu mwaka gwa kashatu ogw'omu busingye bwe, yaatuma abatware be Benihaili, Obadia, Zekaria, Netaneeli na Mikaaya kwegyesa omu ndembo za Yuda; <verse eid="2CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 17:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:8">2 Bus 19:8</ref>. </char></note> yaabatuma n'Abaleevi aba, Shemaya, Netania, Zebadia, Asaheeli, Shemiramoosi, Yehonasaani, Adoniya, Tobiya na Tobadoniya; hamwe n'abo Baleevi yaatuma abanyamurwa Elishaama na Yehoraamu. <verse eid="2CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 17:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:3">2 Bus 35:3</ref>. </char></note> Baayegyesa omuri Yuda, baine ekitabo kya MUKAMA eky'ebiragiro; baaraba omu ndembo zoona eza Yuda, nibeegyesa abantu.<verse eid="2CH 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 17:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 14:14">2 Bus 14:14</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:29">20:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaitsa obwoba abagabe b'amahanga goona ag'ensi ezaabaire zeehinguririize Yuda, tibaarwanisa Yehoshafaati. <verse eid="2CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 17:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:2">2 Sam 8:2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:8">2 Bus 26:8</ref>. </char></note> Abamwe aha Bafilistia baareetera Yehoshafaati ebiconco, kandi baaguma nibamutoijera efeeza; kandi n'Abaharabu baamureetera empaya z'entaama enkumi mushanju na magana mushanju, n'empaya z'embuzi enkumi mushanju na magana mushanju. <verse eid="2CH 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 17:12" />Yehoshafaati yaaguma naayeyongyera ekitiinisa; yaayombeka omuri Yuda ebigo n'endembo z'amabiikiro; <verse eid="2CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 17:13" />kandi yaabiika ebintu bingi omu ndembo zaayo. N'omuri Yerusaalemu yaagiramu abaserukare, abashaija b'amaani amamanzi. <verse eid="2CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 17:14" />Ogu nigwo mubaro gwabo, nk'amaju ga baishenkurubo oku gaabaire gari; omu Bayuda, abakuru b'amahe bakaba bari aba: Aduna, omukuru w'engabo owaabaire aine abashaija b'amaani amamanzi obusiriira bushatu, <verse eid="2CH 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 17:15" />orikumukurata akaba ari Yehohanani omukuru w'engabo owaabaire aine abashaija obusiriira bubiri n'obukumi munaana, <verse eid="2CH 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 17:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:2">Bar 5:2</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 5:9">9</ref>. </char></note> n'orikutaho akaba ari Amasia mwene Zikuri, owaayehaireyo kuheereza MUKAMA n'omutima gwekundiire; we akaba aine abashaija b'amaani amamanzi obusiriira bubiri. <verse eid="2CH 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 17:17" />Omu Babenyamiini abakuru b'amahe bakaba bari aba: Eliada omushaija ow'amaani emanzi, owaabaire aine abashaija b'amata n'engabo obusiriira bubiri, <verse eid="2CH 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 17:18" />n'orikumukurata Yehozabadi, owaabaire aine abashaija akasiriira n'obukumi munaana abeeteekateekyeire orugamba. <verse eid="2CH 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 17:19" />Abo nibo baabaire nibakorera omugabe, otabariireho abo abu omugabe yaataire omu ndembo zeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare omuri Yuda yoona.<verse eid="2CH 17:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2CH 18" />
  <para style="s1">Yehoshafaati okukwatanisa na Ahabu, n'okuhanwa Mikaaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 18:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 8:18">2 Bag 8:18</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 17:5">2 Bus 17:5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 21:6">21:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yehoshafaati akaba atungire munonga, kandi aine ekitiinisa kingi; yaashwererana na Ahabu, baagira obuzaare. <verse eid="2CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 18:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2-34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:2-35">1 Bag 22:2-35</ref>. </char></note> Emyaka ku yaahingwireho, yaashuuma, yaashanga Ahabu omuri Samaria; Ahabu yaamubaagira entaama n'ente nyingi, n'abu yaabaire aine, yaamubeihabeiha kuhurura nawe kuteera Ramosi-gileadi. <verse eid="2CH 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 18:3" />Ahabu omugabe wa Israeli yaagira Yehoshafaati omugabe wa Yuda ati: Noija kuhurura naanye Ramosi-gileadi? Yaamugarukamu ati: Nyowe naiwe turi bamwe, abantu bangye nibo baawe. Nitwija kukwatanisa naiwe omu rugamba.<verse eid="2CH 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 18:4" />Yehoshafaati yaagira omugabe wa Israeli ati: Ninkweshengyereza, banza oyehanuuze ahari MUKAMA, oreebe eki arikugamba eri izooba. <verse eid="2CH 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 18:5" />Atyo omugabe wa Israeli yaateerana baanabi abashaija magana ana, yaababuuza ati: Tuteere Ramosi-gileadi, nari ndereere? Baamugarukamu bati: Irooko, ohurure, ahakuba MUKAMA naija kugihayo omu mikono y'omugabe. <verse eid="2CH 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 18:6" />Kwonka Yehoshafaati yaagira ati: Beitu shi aha, tihariho nabi wa MUKAMA, tukamubuuza? <verse eid="2CH 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 18:7" />Omugabe wa Israeli yaagira Yehoshafaati ati: hakiriho omushaija omwe, ou turikubaasa kwehanuuzaho ebya MUKAMA, niwe Mikaaya mwene Imula; kwonka nimmwanga, ahabw'okuba tandagurira birungi, kureka ebibi. Yehoshafaati yaagira ati: Nyakusinga, reka kugamba otyo. <verse eid="2CH 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 18:8" />Atyo omugabe wa Israeli yaayeta omukuru w'abaserukare, yaamugira ati: Ndahukiza Mikaaya mwene Imula. <verse eid="2CH 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 18:9" />Obwo omugabe wa israeli na Yehoshafaati omugabe wa Yuda bakaba bashutami aha bitebe byabo eby'obugabe, bajwaire zaabushuuti zaabo, bari aha mbuga omu irembo rya Samaria, baanabi boona babari omu maisho nibaragura. <verse eid="2CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 18:10" />Zedekia mwene Kenaana yaayekorera amahembe g'ekyoma, yaaragura ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Aga mahembe nigo oraabingise Abasiria okuhitsya obu baraacwekyerere. <verse eid="2CH 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 18:11" />Kandi na baanabi boona baaragura batyo nibagira bati: Irooko oteere Ramosi-gileadi, osingure; MUKAMA naija kugihayo omu mikono y'omugabe. <verse eid="2CH 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 18:12" />Entumwa eyaaza kweta Mikaaya yaamugira eti: Reeba, ebigambo bya baanabi nibiikirizana, biragura gye aha mugabe; naiwe ebigambo byawe bibe nk'ebyabo, oragure gye. <verse eid="2CH 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 18:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:18">Kub 22:18</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 24:13">24:13</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Mikaaya yaagira ati: Nindahira MUKAMA, eki MUKAMA arangambire, nikyo ndaagambe. <verse eid="2CH 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 18:14" />Ku yaahikire omugabe, omugabe yaamubuuza ati: Mikaaya, tuteere Ramosi-gileadi, nari ndereere? Yaamugarukamu ati: Hurura, osingure; nibaija kuheebwayo omu mikono y'omugabe. <verse eid="2CH 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 18:15" />Kwonka omugabe yaamugira ati: Nkurahize kangahi okutangambira kindi omu iziina rya MUKAMA kureka amazima? <verse eid="2CH 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 18:16" />Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Ndeebire Abaisraeli boona bataataaniire aha bibungo nk'entaama ezitaine muriisa; MUKAMA yaagira ati: Aba tibaine mukama; boona bagarukyeyo n'obusingye, buri muntu omu ka ye. <verse eid="2CH 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 18:17" />Omugabe wa Israeli yaagira Yehoshafaati ati: Tinaakugambira nti: Tarikwija kundagurira birungi kureka ebibi? <verse eid="2CH 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 18:18" />Mikaaya yaagira ati: Mbwenu hurira ekigambo kya MUKAMA. Naareeba MUKAMA ashutami aha kitebe kye, n'eihe ryona ery'omu iguru ryemereire aha rubaju rwe rwa buryo n'orwa bumosho; <verse eid="2CH 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 18:19" />MUKAMA yaagira ati: N'oha oraabeihabeihe Ahabu, akateera Ramosi-gileadi, akagwayo? Omwe yaagamba okundi, n'ondi okundi. <verse eid="2CH 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 18:20" />Bwanyima haija omwoyo, gwayemerera omu maisho ga MUKAMA, gwagira guti: Niinye ndaamubeihabeihe. MUKAMA yaagubuuza ati: Noomubeihabeihesa ki? <verse eid="2CH 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 18:21" />Gwagira guti: niinyija kugyenda, mpindukye omwoyo gw'ebishuba, ngambire omuri baanabi be boona. MUKAMA yaagira ati: niiwe oraamubeihabeihe, kandi noija kukibaasa; irooko okore otyo. <verse eid="2CH 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 18:22" />N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA ataire omwoyo gw'ebishuba omuri baanabi baawe aba boona; kandi MUKAMA akugambireho kubi.<verse eid="2CH 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 18:23" />Bwanyima Zedekia mwene Kenaana yairira haihi, yaateera Mikaaya oruhi rw'omushaaya, naagira ati: Omwoyo wa MUKAMA arabire hi kundugaho kugamba naiwe? <verse eid="2CH 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 18:24" />Mikaaya yaagira ati: Mbwenu oryakireeba ahari eryo izooba ku oriba nooza kweshereka omu kishengye ky'omunda. <verse eid="2CH 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 18:25" />Omugabe wa Israeli yaagira ati: Twara Mikaaya, omugarure ahari Amoni omukuru w'orurembo na Yoasi mutabani w'omugabe, <verse eid="2CH 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 18:26" />omugire oti: oku nikwo omugabe arikugamba naagira ati: Mute ekishaija eki omu kihome, mukiriise eby'okurya kandi mukinywaise amaizi eby'akahenano, okuhitsya obu ndaagarukye n'obusingye. <verse eid="2CH 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 18:27" />Mikaaya yaagira ati: Ku oraagarukye n'obusingye, biri MUKAMA tagambiire muriinye. Yaagaruka yaagira ati: Naimwe bantu 'mwe mwena, mukihurire!<verse eid="2CH 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 18:28" />Bwanyima omugabe wa Israeli na Yehoshafaati omugabe wa Yuda bainamuka, baateera Ramosi-gileadi. <verse eid="2CH 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 18:29" />Omugabe wa Israeli yaagira Yehoshafaati ati: Nyowe naaza kwehindura, nze kurwana, kwonka iwe ogume ojwaire ebijwaro byawe by'obugabe. Atyo omugabe wa Israeli yaayehindura, yaaza aha rugamba. <verse eid="2CH 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 18:30" />Kandi omugabe wa Siria akaba aragiire abakuru b'ebigaari bye ati: Mutarwana n'abato, n'obu baakuba abakuru, kureka omugabe wa Israeli wenka. <verse eid="2CH 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 18:31" />Abo bakuru b'ebigaari, ku baareebire Yehoshafaati, baagira bati: Buzima niwe mugabe wa Israeli. Baakubuuka kurwana nawe. Yehoshafaati yaateera enduuru, MUKAMA yaamuhwera; Ruhanga yaabamwihaho; <verse eid="2CH 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 18:32" />abakuru b'ebigaari, ku baareebire atari mugabe wa Israeli, baagarukayo, baareka kumubinga. <verse eid="2CH 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 18:33" />Kwonka haarugaho omushaija yaananuura obuta, yaafa okurasha omwambi, yaateera omugabe wa Israeli, ahu ebijwaro bye eby'okurwanisa n'eky'aha kifuba birikuteeranira; omugabe nikwo kugambira omuvugi w'ekigaari kye ati: Hinduka, onyihe omu rugamba, ahabw'okuba naahutaara munonga. <verse eid="2CH 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 18:34" />Eryo izooba orugamba rwayeyongyera amaani, omugabe baamuhigika omu kigaari kye naareebana n'Abasiria, okuhitsya omu mwabazyo; eizooba ku ryabaire nirirengarenga, yaafa.<verse eid="2CH 18:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2CH 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 19:1" />Bwanyima Yehoshafaati omugabe wa Yuda yaagaruka buhooro omu kikaari kye omuri Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 19:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:1">1 Bag 16:1</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 16:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:1">2 Bus 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 19:10">19:10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:34">20:34</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 20:37">37</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:18">24:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:21">Zab 139:21</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabaire atakataahire, Yehu mwene Hanani omuhanuuzi yaaza kumubugana, yaamugira ati: Oshemereire kuha ababi emikono, n'okukunda abarikwanga MUKAMA? N'ahabw'ekyo ekiniga kya MUKAMA kyakwijaho. <verse eid="2CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 19:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:14">1 Bag 13:14</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 12:12">2 Bus 12:12</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 17:16">17:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 30:19">30:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 7:10">Ezr 7:10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka, n'obu kiraabe kiri kityo, omuriiwe harimu n'ebirungi, ahakuba okacwekyereza Ashera omu nsi, kandi omutima gwawe waaguta aha kusherura MUKAMA.<verse eid="2CH 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoshafaati okutaho abaramuzi, n'okubashobororera omurimo gwabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 19:4" />Bwanyima Yehoshafaati yaatuura Yerusaalemu; yaagaruka yaagyendagyenda omu bantu, okuruga Beeri-sheba okuhika omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, yaabagarura ahari MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo. <verse eid="2CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 19:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 16:18">Bir 16:18</ref>. </char></note> Yaata abaramuzi omu nsi, omu ndembo zoona eza Yuda ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare, omuri buri rumwe, <verse eid="2CH 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 19:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:17">Bir 1:17</ref>. </char></note> yaagambira abaramuzi ati: Muteekateekye eki murikukora; ahakuba timurikuramurira bantu, kureka MUKAMA; kandi ari hamwe naimwe omu kucwa emanja. <verse eid="2CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 19:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:25">Kut 18:25</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Bir 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:4">32:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 8:3">Yob 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 34:10">34:10</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:14">Rom 9:14</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mugume mutiine MUKAMA; kandi mwerinde omu bi murikukora; ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu taita manja, tashoroora mu bantu, kandi tarya nguzi.<verse eid="2CH 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 19:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 7:25">Ezr 7:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omuri Yerusaalemu Yehoshafaati yaataho Abaleevi bamwe n'abanyamurwa, n'abakuru b'emiryango ya Israeli, kuguma nibacwa emanja ahabwa MUKAMA, kandi n'okumarira abarikujurira emanja zaabo. Abo baramuzi bakaba batuura Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 19:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 23:3">2 Sam 23:3</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:61">1 Bag 8:61</ref>. </char></note> Yaabeehanangiriza ati: Oku nikwo muritwaza omu kutiina MUKAMA, omu bwesigwa, mutaireho emitima yaanyu yoona. <verse eid="2CH 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 19:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:8">Bir 17:8</ref>. </char></note> Beene waanyu abatwire omu ndembo zaabo, ku bariguma baabareetera emanja, z'obwitsi, ez'ebiragiro, ez'ebyaragiirwe, ez'ebyatairweho nari ez'emigyenzo, muryaguma mubahabure, barekye kugiibwaho orubanja omu maisho ga MUKAMA, naimwe na beene waanyu murekye kuhikwaho ekiniga. Okwo nikwo muritwaza, mukareka kugiibwaho orubanja. <verse eid="2CH 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 19:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:10">1 Bus 28:10</ref>. </char></note> Kandi reeba, Amaria omunyamurwa omukuru niwe arikubategyeka omu bigambo byona ebya MUKAMA, na Zebedia mwene Ishimaeli omutegyeki w'enju ya Yuda, omu bigambo byona eby'omugabe; kandi Abaleevi baryaguma nibabaheereza nk'abakuru. Mukore n'obumanzi; kandi MUKAMA agume n'abarikukora eby'oburyo.<verse eid="2CH 19:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2CH 20" />
  <para style="s1">Abayuda okuteerwa Abamoabu, n'okujunwa MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 20:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 3:4">2 Bag 3:4</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 3:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo Abamoabu, Abaamoni n'abamwe aha Bameuni bakaija kurwanisa Yehoshafaati. <verse eid="2CH 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 20:2" />Haija abantu baagambira Yehoshafaati bati: Omutwe muhango gw'engabo guri omu muhanda niguruga Edomu, seeri y'enyanja, gwizire kukuteera; reeba, baahika Hazazoni-tamaari, niyo Enigeedi. <verse eid="2CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 20:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:3">2 Bus 19:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 8:21">Ezr 8:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 36:9">Yer 36:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 1:14">Yoel 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:15">2:15</ref>; <ref loc="JON 3:5">Yon 3:5</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho Yehoshafaati yaatiina, yaamariirira kusherura MUKAMA, kandi yaaragiira Abayuda boona kwesiibyakwo. <verse eid="2CH 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 20:4" />Abayuda baayeteerana kusherura obuhwezi ahari MUKAMA; baaruga omu ndembo z'omuri Yuda zoona kuza kusherura MUKAMA.<verse eid="2CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 20:5" />Yehoshafaati yaayemerera ahagati y'omutwe gw'Abayuda n'aba Yerusaalemu, abateeraniire omu nju ya MUKAMA omu maisho g'ekikaari kisya, <verse eid="2CH 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 20:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:39">Bir 4:39</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:12">1 Bus 29:12</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:17">Dan 4:17</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 4:25">25</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 4:32">32</ref>. </char></note> yaagira ati: Ai MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa baatatenkuriitwe, tiiwe Ruhanga ow'omu iguru? Tiiwe orikutegyeka obugabe bwona obw'amahanga? Omu mukono gwawe harimu obushoboorozi n'amaani, tihariho orikubaasa kukuza omu kaso. <verse eid="2CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 20:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:2">Zab 44:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:8">Isa 41:8</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:23">Yak 2:23</ref>. </char></note> Ai Ruhanga waitu, torabingire abatuuzi b'omuri egi nsi omu maisho g'abantu baawe Israeli, okagiha baijukuru ba Abrahamu munywani waawe kuba eyaabo ebiro byona? <verse eid="2CH 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 20:8" />Kandi kwo bakagituuramu, baayombekyeramu eiziina ryawe Omwanya ogurikwera, nibagira bati: <verse eid="2CH 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 20:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:33">1 Bag 8:33</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 8:37">37</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 6:20">2 Bus 6:20</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 6:28-30">28-30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 14:21">Ezk 14:21</ref>. </char></note> Akabi ku karituhikaho, rurara, okugira orubanja, orufu, nari enjara, turyayemerera omu maisho g'enju egi n'omu maisho gaawe, ahakuba eiziina ryawe rituura omuri egi nju, tukutakire omu kubonabona kwaitu; naiwe ohurire kandi ojune. <verse eid="2CH 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 20:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:21">Kub 20:21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 2:4">Bir 2:4</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 2:5">5</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 2:9">9</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 2:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu reeba, Abaamoni, Abamoabu n'ab'omu bibungo bya Seiri, abu waayangire Abaisraeli ku bateera ensi yaabo, obu baabaire nibaruga omu nsi ya Misri, kureka bakabaraba hangahari, batabacwekyereze, <verse eid="2CH 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 20:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:6">Zab 83:6</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 83:7">7</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 83:12">12</ref>. </char></note> reeba oku barikutuzimuurira, nibaza kutubinga omu buhunguzi bwawe, obu waatuhaire kuhungura. <verse eid="2CH 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 20:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:13">1 Sam 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 25:15">Zab 25:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 123:1">123:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 123:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 141:8">141:8</ref>. </char></note> Ai Ruhanga waitu, torikwija kubacwera orubanja, okabafubira? Ahakuba titwine maani g'okurwanisa eri ihe rihango eriizire kuturwanisa; kandi titurikumanya oku turaagire; kureka niiwe tuhangire amaisho.<verse eid="2CH 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 20:13" />Omuri obwo bunaku abashaija ba Yuda boona bakaba beemereire omu maisho ga MUKAMA n'abeereere baabo n'abakazi baabo n'abaana baabo. <verse eid="2CH 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 20:14" />Ahonaaho Omwoyo wa MUKAMA yaija ahari Yahazieli mwene Zekaria, mwijukuru wa Benaaya, ya Yayeli mwene Matania, Omuleevi ow'omuri beene Asafu, ahu yaabaire ari ahagati y'ogwo mutwe. <verse eid="2CH 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 20:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:29">Bir 1:29</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 1:30">30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 31:6">31:6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 17:47">1 Sam 17:47</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:7">2 Bus 32:7</ref>. </char></note> Yaagira ati: Muhurire, imwe Abayuda, n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu n'omugabe Yehoshafaati, oku nikwo MUKAMA arikubagambira naagira ati: Mutatiina ogu mutwe muhango gw'engabo, kandi mutahahaaza emitima; ahakuba orugamba ti rwanyu, n'orwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 20:16" />Nyencakare mushuume, mubateere; nibaija kwinamukira ahu orikutembera nooza Ziizi; nimwija kubashanga aha muheru gw'oruhanga aha burugwa-izooba bw'eihamba rya Yerueli. <verse eid="2CH 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 20:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:13">Kur 14:13</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 14:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:9">Kub 14:9</ref>. </char></note> Omuri orwo rugamba timurikwija kwetenga kurwana; muze omu myanya yaanyu, mwemerere kwonka, mureebe oku MUKAMA araabasingurire, imwe Abayuda n'aba Yerusaalemu. Mutatiina, kandi mutahahaaza emitima; nyencakare muhurure mubateere; MUKAMA naija kuba hamwe naimwe. <verse eid="2CH 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 20:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:31">Kur 4:31</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 29:29">2 Bus 29:29</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 29:30">30</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 8:6">Neh 8:6</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yehoshafaati yainika omutwe ahansi, yaaramya, n'Abayuda n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu boona nabo baagwa omu maisho ga MUKAMA bajuumaire, nibamuramya. <verse eid="2CH 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 20:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:16">Kur 6:16</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 6:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 9:19">1 Bus 9:19</ref>. </char></note> Abaleevi ab'omuryango gwa Kohasi, n'ab'omu gwa Koora, baayemerera kuhimbisa MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli n'eiraka rihango munonga. <verse eid="2CH 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 20:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:9">Isa 7:9</ref>. </char></note> Omu kasheeshe munonga baimuka, baaza omu ihamba rya Tekoa; ku baabaire nibakigyenda, Yehoshafaati yaayemerera, yaagira ati: Mumpurire, imwe Abayuda n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu, Mwesigye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, nibwo muraahamibwe; mwikirize baanabi be, nibwo muraabe gye. <verse eid="2CH 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 20:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:29">1 Bus 16:29</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 16:34">34</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaaherize kuhanuura n'abantu, yaataho ab'okweshongorera MUKAMA, n'okumuhimbisa bajwaire ebirikwera, kugyenda beebembeire eihe, nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 20:21">Musiime MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 20:21">Ahakuba embabazi ze n'ez'ebiro byona.<verse eid="2CH 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 20:22" />Ku baatandikire kweshongora n'okuhimbisa, MUKAMA yaataho ab'okugwera Abaamoni, n'Abamoabu n'ab'omu bibungo bya Seiri abaizire kurwanisa Abayuda; baabarabanisamu. <verse eid="2CH 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 20:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 7:22">Bar 7:22</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 14:20">1 Sam 14:20</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Abaamoni n'Abamoabu bakagurukana abatuuzi b'omu bibungo bya Seiri, baabacwekyerereza kimwe; ku baaherize kucwekyereza aba Seiri, baayehindukiririzana, baatandika kwitana bonka, buri muntu yaita mugyenzi we. <verse eid="2CH 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 20:24" />Abayuda ku baahikire aha munaara gw'abarinzi omu ihamba, baanaga amaisho ei ogwo mutwe gw'engabo gwabaire guri, baashanga boona baabaire emitumbi barambiire ahansi, hataine ohonokireho. <verse eid="2CH 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 20:25" />Yehoshafaati n'abantu be ku baahikireyo kubanyaga, baashangayo amatungo maingi munonga, ebintu, ebijwaro n'ebindi bintu eby'obuguzi bwingi, baabyetwarira okuhitsya obu byabaremeireho. Ahabw'okuba bingi munonga, baamara ebiro bishatu nibanyaga. <verse eid="2CH 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 20:26" />Aha kiro kya kana baateeranira omu ruhanga rwa Beraaka, baasiimirayo MUKAMA; nikyo ogwo mwanya gurikweterwa Beraaka n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="2CH 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 20:27" />Bwanyima buri muntu ow'omu Bayuda n'aba Yerusaalemu hamwe na Yehoshafaati abeebembeire baagaruka Yerusaalemu bashemereirwe, ahakuba MUKAMA akabaha okweraata aha bazigu baabo. <verse eid="2CH 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 20:28" />Baahika Yerusaalemu aha nju ya MUKAMA, baine enanga n'endingiri n'amakondere. <verse eid="2CH 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 20:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:14">2 Bus 14:14</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 17:10">17:10</ref>. </char></note> Ab'omu bugabe bw'amahanga goona, ku baahuriire ngu MUKAMA arwaniise abazigu ba Israeli baashwekwa obwoba ahabw'okutiina Ruhanga. <verse eid="2CH 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 20:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:6">2 Bus 14:6</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 14:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 15:15">15:15</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo obugabe bwa Yehoshafaati bwatuuza, ahakuba Ruhanga we akamuha obuhuumure embaju zoona.<verse eid="2CH 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 20:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:31-33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 22:41-43">1 Bag 22:41-43</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo nikwo Yehoshafaati yaategyekire Yuda. Akatandika kutegyeka aine emyaka makumi ashatu n'etaano; yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu emyaka makumi abiri n'etaano. Nyina akaba naayetwa Azuubu muhara wa Shiluhi. <verse eid="2CH 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 20:32" />Yaagyendera omu muhanda gwa Asa ishe, tiyaagira bu aguteishukire; kureka yaakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 20:33" />Kwonka emyanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu tiyaihwaho, ahakuba abantu bakaba batakataire mitima yaabo ahari Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo.<verse eid="2CH 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 20:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 16:7">1 Bag 16:7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 19:2">2 Bus 19:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Endiijo mirimo ya Yehoshafaati, okwiha aha kutandika okuhitsya aha muheru, ehandiikirwe omu kitabo kya Yeehu mwene Hanani eky'eby'omu busingye, ebyahandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'abagabe ba Israeli.<verse eid="2CH 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 20:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 22:48">1 Bag 22:48</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 22:49">49</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo Yehoshafaati omugabe wa Yuda yaayeteerana na Ahazia omugabe wa Israeli, owaabaire naakora kubi. <verse eid="2CH 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 20:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 9:21">2 Bus 9:21</ref>. </char></note> Yaakwatanisa nawe kubaija emeeri z'okuza Tarushiishi, baazibaijera Ezioni-geberi. <verse eid="2CH 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 20:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:2">2 Bus 19:2</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Eliezeeri mwene Dodavahu owa Mareesha, yaaragura ahari Yehoshafaati naagira ati: Ahabw'okweteerana na Ahazia, MUKAMA naija kucwekyereza eki obaizire. Ezo meeri zaahendagurika, tizaabaasa kuza Tarushiishi.<verse eid="2CH 20:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2CH 21" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Yehoraamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 21:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 22:50">1 Bag 22:50</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yehoshafaati yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa hamwe nabo omu rurembo rwa Daudi; Yehoraamu omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="2CH 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 21:2" />Akaba aine abarumuna, abaana ba Yehoshafaati, Azaria, Yehieli, Zekaria, Azaria, Mikaeli na Shefatia; abo boona bakaba bari batabani ba Yehoshafaati omugabe wa Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 21:3" />Ishebo akabaha ebiconco bingi, by'efeeza, n'ezaabu n'ebintu by'obuguzi bwingi hamwe n'endembo omuri Yuda ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare; kwonka obugabe yaabuha Yehoraamu, ahabw'okuba omwana w'omujigaijo. <verse eid="2CH 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 21:4" />Yehoraamu ku yaagiire aha kitebe ky'obugabe bwa ishe, yaahamibwa, yaita abarumuna boona na rurara, n'abandi banyiginya b'omuri Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 21:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:17-22">2 Bag 8:17-22</ref>. </char></note> Yehoraamu akaba ahikize emyaka makumi ashatu n'ebiri, obu yaaza aha ngoma, yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu emyaka munaana. <verse eid="2CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28-30">1 Bag 12:28-30</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 16:31-33">16:31-33</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:18">2 Bag 8:18</ref>. </char></note> Yaagyendera omu mihanda y'abagabe ba Israeli, nk'ab'enju ya Ahabu ashweire muhara wa Ahabu. Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 21:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:36">1 Bag 11:36</ref>. </char></note> N'obu biraabe byabaire biri bityo, MUKAMA akanga kucwekyerereza kimwe enju ya Daudi, ahabw'endagaano ei yaaragaine na Daudi, n'ahabw'okumuraganisa we n'oruzaaro rwe, kubaha etabaaza ebiro byona.<verse eid="2CH 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 21:8" />Omu biro bye Abanyaedomu bakagoma, baaruga omu butegyeki bwa Yuda, baayeteeraho owaabo mugabe. <verse eid="2CH 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 21:9" />Bwanyima Yehoraamu yaayambuka n'abakuru b'engabo n'ebigaari bye byona; yaimuka nyekiro, yaateera Abanyaedomu, abaabaire bamwehinguririize n'abakuru b'ebigaari bye. <verse eid="2CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 21:10" />Okwo nikwo Edomu yaagomire, ekaruga omu butegyeki bwa Yuda n'okuhitsya hati. Omu bunaku obwo Libuna nayo yaamugomera, ahabw'okuba akaba atsigireho MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkuru.<verse eid="2CH 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 21:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:16">Kur 34:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:7">Lev 17:7</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:5">20:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi akata emyanya mikuru y'okuramizamu omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Yuda, yaareetera abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu okuruga ahari MUKAMA, kandi yaahabisa n'Abayuda. <verse eid="2CH 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 21:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:2-5">2 Bus 14:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 17:3">17:3</ref>.</char></note> Bwanyima yaatunga ebaruha erikuruga ahari nabi Eliya, neegira eti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Daudi shwenkuru arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'okuba togyendeire mu mihanda ya sho Yehoshafaati, n'obu yaakuba eya Asa omugabe wa Yuda, <verse eid="2CH 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 21:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:6">2 Bus 21:6</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 21:11">11</ref>.</char></note>ogyendeire omu mihanda y'abagabe ba Israeli, waareetera Abayuda n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu okuruga ahari Ruhanga, kandi waataho n'okwita barumuna baawe, ab'enju ya sho, abaabaire nibakuhita, <verse eid="2CH 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 21:14" />reeba, MUKAMA naija kureeta ekibonaboneso kihango aha bantu baawe, aha baana baawe, aha bakazi baawe n'aha bintu byawe byona, <verse eid="2CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 21:15" />kandi naiwe wenka noija kurwara endwara mbi munonga omu mara, okuhitsya obu oraagume nooreeta omwoyo buri izooba.<verse eid="2CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 21:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 11:14">1 Bag 11:14</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 17:11">2 Bus 17:11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 22:1">22:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:7">26:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima MUKAMA yaareetera Abafilistia n'Abaharabu, abahereraine na Abaesiopia kugirira Yehoraamu ekiniga; <verse eid="2CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 21:17" />baija kurwanisa Yuda, baagiteera, baanyagayo ebintu byona ebi baashangire omu nju y'omugabe, kandi n'abatabani n'abakazi be, tiyaatsigaza mwana weena ow'omwojo kureka Yehoahazi omwana we wa bucuranda. <verse eid="2CH 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 21:18" />Bwanyima y'ebyo byona, MUKAMA yaamurwaza endwara etarikukira omu mara. <verse eid="2CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 21:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:14">2 Bus 16:14</ref>. </char></note> Ebiro ku byahingwireho, aha muheru gw'emyaka ebiri, yaatandika kureeta omwoyo ahabw'egyo ndwara, yaafa aine obuhuruzi bwingi munonga. Abantu be tibaacumika muriro gw'okumuhaisa ekitiinisa, nk'oku baagiriire baishenkuru. <verse eid="2CH 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 21:20" />Obu yaatandika kutegyeka, akaba aine emyaka makumi ashatu n'ebiri, yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu emyaka munaana, yaafa atakiine orikumwenda. Baamuziika omu rurembo rwa Daudi, kwonka ti mu bituuro by'abagabe.<verse eid="2CH 21:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2CH 22" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Ahazia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 8:24-29">2 Bag 8:24-29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu baagira Ahazia mutabani wa Yehoraamu omuto omugabe omu mwanya gwa ishe; ahabw'okuba omutwe gw'abashaija, abaizire omu rusiisira n'Abaharabu, bakaba baitsire abaana bakuru boona. N'ahabw'ekyo Ahazia mwene Yehoraamu omugabe wa Yuda yaategyeka. <verse eid="2CH 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 22:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:6">2 Bus 21:6</ref>. </char></note> Ahazia akaba aine emyaka makumi ana n'ebiri, obu yaatandika kutegyeka, yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu omwaka gumwe. Nyina akaba naayetwa Atalia mwijukuru wa Omuri. <verse eid="2CH 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 22:3" />Ahazia nawe yaagyendera omu micwe y'ab'enju ya Ahabu, ahabw'okuba nyina niwe yaabaire amuha obwengye kukora kubi. <verse eid="2CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 22:4" />Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, nk'oku ab'enju ya Ahabu baakozire; ahakuba ishe ku yaaherize kufa, baaguma nibamuha obwengye obwamucwekyereize. <verse eid="2CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 22:5" />Kandi akakuratira obwengye bwabo, yaagyenda na Yoramu mwene Ahabu omugabe wa Israeli kurwanisa Hazaeli omugabe wa Siria ahari Ramosi-gileadi. Abasiria baahutaaza Yoramu, <verse eid="2CH 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 22:6" />yagaruka Yezereeli kurwarirayo obuhuta, obu baamuhutaariize Raama, obu baarwana na Hazaeli omugabe wa Siria. Bwanyima Ahazia mwene Yehoraamu omugabe wa Yuda yaashuuma Yezereeli kureeba Yoramu mwene Ahabu, ahakuba akaba arwaire.<verse eid="2CH 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 22:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 9:6">2 Bag 9:6</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 9:7">7</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 9:21">21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka kikaba kiteekateekirwe Ruhanga, ngu okufa kwa Ahazia kubeho agiire kureeba Yoramu. Ahakuba ku yaahikireyo, yaagyenda na Yoramu kubugana Yehu mwene Nimushi, ou MUKAMA yaashukireho amajuta kucwekyereza enju ya Ahabu. <verse eid="2CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 22:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:11-14">2 Bag 10:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:24">2 Bus 24:24</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabaire naaha ab'enju ya Ahabu ekifubiro, yaabugana abanyiginya ba Yuda n'abatabani ba barumuna ba Ahazia, abaabaire nibaheereza Amazia, yaabaita. <verse eid="2CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 22:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 17:4">2 Bus 17:4</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:27">2 Bag 9:27</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaasherura Ahazia, baamukwata ayesherekire omuri Samaria, baamureetera Yehu, yaamwita. Baamuziika, ahabw'okuba bakagira ngu ni mwijukuru wa Yehoshafaati, owaabaire naasherura MUKAMA n'omutima gwe gwona. Okuruga aho enju ya Ahazia yaabura omuntu orikubaasa kutwara engoma.<verse eid="2CH 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 22:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:10-12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 11:1-3">2 Bag 11:1-3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atalia nyina wa Ahazia, ku yaareebire omutabani yaafa, yaimuka yaacwekyereza ab'oruganda rw'omugabe wa Yuda boona. <verse eid="2CH 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 22:11" />Kwonka Yehoshabeasi muhara w'omugabe yaatwara Yoasi mwene Ahazia, yaamwiba omuri batabani b'omugabe, abaabaire bari haihi kwitwa, we n'omurezi we yaabata omu kishengye ky'okuraaramu. Atyo Yehoshabeasi, muhara w'omugabe Yehoraamu, kandi muka Yehoyaada omunyamurwa, ahabw'okuba munyaanya wa Ahazia, yaamushereka Atalia, tiyaamwita. <verse eid="2CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 22:12" />Yaamara nabo emyaka mukaaga, asherekirwe omu nju ya Ruhanga; obwo Atalia naategyeka ensi.<verse eid="2CH 22:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2CH 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yehoyaada okwemeka Yoasi, n'okwita Atalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 23:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:1-21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 11:4-20">2 Bag 11:4-20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka omu mwaka gwa mushanju Yehoyaada akeegumya, yaaragaana endagaano n'abakuru b'engabo igana-igana, Azaria mwene Yerohaamu, Ishimaeli mwene Yehohanani, Azaria mwene Obedi, Maaseya mwene Adaaya na Elishafaati mwene Zikuri. <verse eid="2CH 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 23:2" />Baaraba omuri Yuda yoona, baateerana Abaleevi, nibabaiha omu ndembo zoona eza Yuda, n'abakuru b'amaju ga baishenkuru b'Abaisraeli, baija Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 23:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:16">2 Bus 6:16</ref>. </char></note> Abateeraine boona baaragaana endagaano n'omugabe bari omu nju ya Ruhanga. Yehoyaada yaabagira ati: Omwana w'omugabe ngugu! K'ategyekye, nk'oku MUKAMA yaagambire ahari beene Daudi. <verse eid="2CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 23:4" />Mbwenu oku nikwo muraatwaze. Omuriimwe abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi abarikwihwa aha murimo ahari sabato, ekicweka kimwe kya kashatu kibe eky'ab'okurinda amarembo, <verse eid="2CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 23:5" />kimwe kya kashatu kibe eky'aha nju y'omugabe, na kimwe kya kashatu ekindi kibe eky'aha irembo ry'omusingi; kandi abantu boona baze omu bikaari by'enju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 23:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:27-32">1 Bus 23:27-32</ref>. </char></note> Hatagira ondiijo weena owaataaha omu nju ya MUKAMA, kureka abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi abarikuheereza; bo bataahemu, ahabw'okuba n'abarikwera; kwonka abandi boona bategyereze okuragiira kwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 23:7" />Abaleevi beehinguririze omugabe, buri muntu aine eby'okurwanisa bye omu ngaro; kandi omuntu weena oraataahe omu nju aitwe. Mugume n'omugabe, yaaba naataahamu, nari naashohora.<verse eid="2CH 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 23:8" />Abaleevi n'Abayuda boona baakora nk'ebi Yehoyaada omunyamurwa yaabaragiira byona. Buri omwe yaareeta abantu be ab'okwihwa aha murimo ahari sabato, n'ab'okwija aha murimo ahari sabato; ahabw'okuba Yehoyaada omunyamurwa tararagiire baabaire bari aha rubu kutaaha. <verse eid="2CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 23:9" />Bwanyima Yehoyaada omunyamurwa yaaha abakuru b'engabo amacumu n'engabo mpango n'enkye, ezaabaire ziri ez'omugabe Daudi, nizibiikwa omu nju ya Ruhanga; <verse eid="2CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 23:10" />yaataho abantu boona kuba abarinzi b'omugabe, buri muntu aine eky'okurwanisa kye omu ngaro, okuruga aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo bw'enju, okuhika aha rw'obwa bumosho, baayehinguririza eitambiro n'enju. <verse eid="2CH 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 23:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:18">Bir 17:18</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 17:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaashohoza omwana w'omugabe, yaamujweka ekirunga, yaamuha Eby'okuhamya; baamuranga ku yaaba omugabe, Yehoyaada n'abatabani baamushukaho amajuta, baagira bati: Omugabe nakaramaare!<verse eid="2CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 23:12" />Atalia ku yaahuriire orwari rw'abantu nibairuka nibahimbisa omugabe, yaataaha omu nju ya MUKAMA ahu bantu bari; <verse eid="2CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 23:13" />ku yaanagire amaisho, yaareeba omugabe ayemereire aha rubaju rw'enyomyo ye aha irembo, n'abakuru b'engabo n'abakondere bamwemereire aha rubaju, n'abantu boona ab'omuri egyo nsi nibashemererwa nibateera amakondere, kandi n'abeeshongozi baine ebintu byabo by'okuteera nibeebembera abarikweshongora. Ahonaaho Atalia yaataagura ebijwaro bye, yaagira ati: Okwebumba! Okwebumba! <verse eid="2CH 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 23:14" />Yehoyaada omunyamurwa yaashohoza abakuru b'engabo abaatairweho kutegyeka eihe, yaabagira ati: Mumurabye omu ngabo, mumushohoze; oraamukurate weena, mumwite na rurara. Ahakuba omunyamurwa akaragiira ati: Mutamwitira omu nju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 23:15" />Batyo baamutaho engaro, baamurabya omu irembo ry'embaraasi aha irembo ry'enju y'omugabe, baamwitirayo. <verse eid="2CH 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 23:16" />Bwanyima Yehoyaada yaaragaana endagaano n'abantu boona kandi n'omugabe kuba abantu ba MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 23:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:9">Bir 13:9</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga aho abantu boona baaza ahari nyaruju ya Baali, baagisheenya; amatambiro ge n'ebishushani bye baabisheenyagurira kimwe, baitira Mataani omunyamurwa wa Baali omu maisho g'ago matambiro. <verse eid="2CH 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 23:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:2">Kub 28:2</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 23:3-6">1 Bus 23:3-6</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 23:26-32">26-32</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 25:1">25:1</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 25:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yehoyaada yaataho abantu b'okurinda enju ya MUKAMA kuguma nibareebererwa abanyamurwa Abaleevi, n'abandi Baleevi, abu Daudi yaataireho kuguma nibareeberera enju ya MUKAMA, kuhongyera MUKAMA ebitambo by'okwotsya, nk'oku kihandiikirwe omu biragiro bya Musa, ngu babihongye nibashemererwa nibeeshongora, nk'oku Daudi yaaragiire. <verse eid="2CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 23:19" />Abarinzi b'amarembo yaabata aha marembo g'enju ya MUKAMA, ngu omuntu weena otashemeire omu muringo gwona arekye kutaahamu. <verse eid="2CH 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 23:20" />Bwanyima yaatwara abakuru b'engabo, n'ab'ekitiinisa, n'abategyeki b'abantu, hamwe n'abantu boona ab'omuri egyo nsi, baashuumya omugabe nibamwiha omu irembo rya ruguru, baamutaasya omu nju y'omugabe, baamuta aha kitebe ky'obugabe. <verse eid="2CH 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 23:21" />Batyo abantu boona ab'omuri egyo nsi baashemererwa; kandi bwanyima y'okwita Atalia na rurara, orurembo rwatuuza.<verse eid="2CH 23:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2CH 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yoasi okuhunduuza hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 24:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1-14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 11:21-12:5">2 Bag 11:21—12:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yoasi akaba aine emyaka mushanju, obu yaatandika kutegyeka; yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu emyaka makumi ana; nyina akaba naayetwa Zibia owa Beeri-sheba. <verse eid="2CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 24:2" />Omu biro byona ebya Yehoyaada omunyamurwa Yoasi akakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 24:3" />Yehoyaada yaamushwererera abakazi babiri, yaazaara abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki.<verse eid="2CH 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 24:4" />Bwanyima y'ekyo Yoasi yaamariirira kuhunduuza enju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 24:5" />Yaateerana abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi, yaabagira ati: Mwirooko muze omu ndembo za Yuda, muteerane omu Baisraeli boona empiiha z'okuhunduuza enju ya Ruhanga waanyu buri mwaka; kandi mukirahutsye. Kwonka Abaleevi tibaakirahutsya. <verse eid="2CH 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 24:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:12-16">Kur 30:12-16</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe nikwo kweta Yehoyaada omukuru, akamugira ati: Ahabw'enki toragiire Baleevi kwiha omu Bayuda n'aba Yerusaalemu emitoijo, ei Musa omugaragwa wa MUKAMA yaaragiire eihanga ryona erya Israeli kuha, ngw'ebe ey'Eihema ry'Eby'okuhamya? <verse eid="2CH 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 24:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:15">1 Bag 15:15</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba batabani ba Atalia, ogwo mukazi mubi, bakataaha omu nju ya Ruhanga, kandi ebintu byona eby'omu nju ya MUKAMA ebyashoroirwe, baabikoresa ahabwa Baabaali.<verse eid="2CH 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 24:8" />N'ahabw'ekyo omugabe yaaragiira, baabaija eshanduukye, baagita aheeru y'eirembo ry'enju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 24:9" />Baaranga omuri Yuda n'omuri Yerusaalemu yoona, ku baareetera MUKAMA emitoijo ei Musa omugaragwa wa Ruhanga yaaragiire Abaisraeli bari omu ihamba. <verse eid="2CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 24:10" />Abanyiginya boona n'abantu boona baashemererwa, baareeta emitoijo yaabo, baagita omuri egyo shanduukye okuhitsya obu baaherize. <verse eid="2CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 24:11" />Abaleevi ku baabaire bareetera abatware b'omugabe egyo shanduukye, baareeba erimu empiiha nyingi, omuhandiiki w'omugabe n'omutware w'omunyamurwa mukuru baija, baihamu ebirimu byona, bagitwara, bagigarura omu mwanya gwayo. Okwo nikwo baabaire bakora buri izooba, bakateerana empiiha nyingi munonga. <verse eid="2CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 24:12" />Omugabe na Yehoyaada baziha abarikureeberera omurimo gw'enju ya MUKAMA, bagurira abombeki n'ababaizi kuhunduuza egyo nju, hamwe n'abaheesi b'ebyoma n'ab'emiringa. <verse eid="2CH 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 24:13" />Batyo abaakwatsiibwe omurimo baakora n'amaani, baaguhereza kimwe, enju ya Ruhanga baagihunduuza, baagigarura omu buteeka, baagihamya. <verse eid="2CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 24:14" />Ku baagiherize, baareetera omugabe na Yehoyaada empiiha ezaashaagireho, baazikoramu ebintu by'enju ya MUKAMA, eby'okuheerezesa, eby'ebitambo by'okwotsya, eshohaani z'obubaane, n'ebintu by'efeeza n'ezaabu. Kandi omu biro bya Yehoyaada byona bakaguma nibatambira ebitambo by'okwotsya omu nju ya MUKAMA.<verse eid="2CH 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 24:15" />Kwonka Yehoyaada yaakura, yaahika omu ngingo zaabukuru, yaafa; kandi akafa ahikize emyaka igana na makumi ashatu. <verse eid="2CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 24:16" />Baamuziika omu bagabe omu rurembo rwa Daudi, ahabw'okuba akakora gye omuri Israeli ahari Ruhanga n'aha b'enju ye. <verse eid="2CH 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 24:17" />Yehoyaada ku yaaherize kufa, abanyiginya ba Yuda baija, baatangirira omugabe. Okuruga aho omugabe yaaguma naahurira ebi barikumugambira. <verse eid="2CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 24:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:15">2 Bus 36:15</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:15">Neh 13:15</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 13:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:4">Yer 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:34">Mat 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:49">Luk 11:49</ref>. </char></note> Baareka enju ya MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo, baaheereza Ashera n'ebishushani ebirikuramibwa. Ahabw'ekyo kicumuro kyabo, ekiniga kya Ruhanga kyaija aha Bayuda n'aba Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 24:19" />Hoona, n'obu kiraabe kyabaire kityo, akaguma naabatumaho baanabi kubagarura ahari MUKAMA; baanabi abo baaboomesereza, kwonka baayanga kuhurira.<verse eid="2CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 24:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:41">Kub 14:41</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 15:1">2 Bus 15:1</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 15:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Omwoyo wa Ruhanga yaija ahari Zekaria mwene Yehoyaada omunyamurwa, yaayemerera eruguru y'abantu, yaabagira ati: Ahabw'enki mugomeire ebiragiro bya MUKAMA, kikabareetera kutaba gye? Mutsigireho MUKAMA, nawe nikyo abatsigiireho. <verse eid="2CH 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 24:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:26">Neh 9:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:51">Luk 11:51</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka baamugirira enaama, baamuteerera amabaare omu kikaari ky'enju ya MUKAMA ahabw'ekiragiro ky'omugabe. <verse eid="2CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 24:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:5">Kut 9:5</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo Yoasi omugabe yaayebirwe embabazi, ezi Yehoyaada, ishe wa Zekaria, yaamugiriire, akamwitira omwana. Zekaria ku yaabaire naafa, yaagira ati: MUKAMA akireebe, kandi ahoore!<verse eid="2CH 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 24:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 12:17">2 Bag 12:17</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 12:18">18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha muheru gw'omwaka eihe ry'Abasiria ryaija kuteera Yoasi. Baahika omuri Yuda na Yerusaalemu, baacwekyereza abategyeki boona aba bantu, baabamaramu, baatwekyera omugabe wa Damasiko ebi baanyagire byona. <verse eid="2CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 24:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:8">Lev 26:8</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 26:36">36</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 26:37">37</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:17">Isa 30:17</ref>. </char></note> N'obu eihe ry'Abasiria ryaizire n'abantu bakye, MUKAMA akahayo omu mikono yaabo eihe rihango munonga, ahabw'okuba Abayuda abo bakatsigaho MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo. Okwo nikwo Abasiria baahaire Yoasi ekifubiro. <verse eid="2CH 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 24:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:25-27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:20">2 Bag 12:20</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 12:21">21</ref>. </char></note> Abasiria ku baamurugireho, baatsiga ahutaire munonga, abaheereza be baamugirira enaama nibahoorera eshagama ya mwene Yehoyaada omunyamurwa, baamwitira aha kitanda kye. Atyo yaafa, baamuziika omu rurembo rwa Daudi; kwonka tibaamuziika mu bituuro by'abagabe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:35">Bir 28:35</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2CH 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 24:26" />Abaamugiriire enaama bakaba bari Zabadi mwene Shineasi Omuamonikazi, na Yehozabadi mwene Shimuriisi Omumoabukazi. <verse eid="2CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 24:27" />Eby'abatabani, n'ebi baanabi baamuhanire, n'eby'okuhunduuza enju ya Ruhanga, bihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'ebirikushoboorora eby'omu kitabo ky'abagabe. Amazia omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2CH 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2CH 25" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Amazia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 25:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:1-4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 14:1-6">2 Bag 14:1-6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amazia akaba aine emyaka makumi abiri n'etaano, obu yaatandika kutegyeka; yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu emyaka makumi abiri na mwenda. Nyina akaba naayetwa Yehoadaani, owa Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 25:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 25:14">2 Bus 25:14</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA, kwonka ataine mutima guhikire. <verse eid="2CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 25:3" />Ku yaaherize kuhamibwa ati omu bugabe bwe, yaita abaheereza be abaitsire omugabe ishe; <verse eid="2CH 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 25:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:16">Bir 24:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:30">Yer 31:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:20">Ezk 18:20</ref>. </char></note> kwonka tiyaita baana baabo, nk'oku kihandiikirwe omu kitabo kya Musa ey'ebiragiro, omu MUKAMA yaaragiriire ati: Baishe b'abaana batariitwa nibaturwa abaana baabo, kandi n'abaana batariitwa nibaturwa baishebo; kureka omuntu weena aryaitwa ahabw'ekibi kye.<verse eid="2CH 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 25:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 1:3">Kub 1:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Amazia yaateerana abashaija ba Yuda, yaabataho kutegyekwa abakuru b'engabo rukumi-rukumi n'aba igana-igana, nk'amaju ga baishenkurubo oku gaabaire gari, ahabwa Yuda na Benyamiini yoona. Yaateerana abahikize emyaka makumi abiri n'okukiraho, yaashanga bari obusiriira bushatu, abashaija entoore, abarikubaasa eby'engamba, bakamanya kurwanaisa amacumu n'engabo. <verse eid="2CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 25:6" />Yaagaruka yaagurira abashaija b'amaani amamanzi aba Israeli akasiriira kamwe n'etalanta z'efeeza igana. <verse eid="2CH 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 25:7" />Kwonka omushaija wa Ruhanga yaija ah'ari, yaamugira ati: Nyakusinga omugabe, otaikiriza eihe rya Israeli kuhurura naiwe, ahabw'okuba MUKAMA tari hamwe na Israeli, Abaefuraimu aba boona. <verse eid="2CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 25:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:6">2 Bus 20:6</ref>. </char></note> Ku oraabe noogira ngu oine amaani g'okurwana, omanye ngu Ruhanga naija kukuteera ahansi omu maisho g'abazigu baawe; ahakuba Ruhanga aine obushoboorozi bw'okuhwera, nari obw'okutuura ahansi. <verse eid="2CH 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 25:9" />Amazia yaagira ogwo mushaija wa Ruhanga ati: Mbwenu shi tugire tuta ezo talanta igana, ezi mpaire eihe rya Israeli? Omushaija wa Ruhanga yaamugarukamu ati: MUKAMA naabaasa kukuha nyingi munonga ezirikukira ezo. <verse eid="2CH 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 25:10" />Bwanyima Amazia yaaragiira eihe, eryamwizireho niriruga Efuraimu, kugaruka omuka. Baagwerwa kubi munonga Abayuda, baagaruka omuka baine ekiniga kingi. <verse eid="2CH 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 25:11" />Kwonka Amazia we yaaguma, yaahuruza abantu be, baaza omu ruhita rw'omwonyo, baita omu bashaija ba Seiri abantu kakumi. <verse eid="2CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 25:12" />Kandi Abayuda baakwata abandi kakumi bahuriire, baabatwara aha mutwe gw'ekibaare kihango, baabatambika, baayetuura ahansi, baacwagacwagurika boona. <verse eid="2CH 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 25:13" />Kwonka abashaija b'eryo ihe, abu Amazia yaagarwireyo, akanga ku bahurura nawe, baateera endembo za Yuda okuruga Samaria okuhika Besi-horoni, baaziitamu abantu enkumi ishatu, baanyaga eminyago mingi.<verse eid="2CH 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 25:14" />Amazia ku yaarugire kwita Abanyaedomu, yaareeta ebishushani bya baaruhanga ba Seiri, yaabyemereza kuba baaruhanga be, yaabiramya, yaabihongyera empongano. <verse eid="2CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 25:15" />Nikyo MUKAMA yaagwereirwe kubi Amazia, akamutumaho nabi, akamugira ati: Ahabw'enki oyehongyeire baaruhanga abatarabaasize kujuna abantu baabo omu mikono yaawe? <verse eid="2CH 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 25:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:20">Yos 11:20</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabaire naakigamba, omugabe yaamugira ati: Beitu shi tukugizire omuhanuuzi w'omugabe? Hunama! Mbwenu oitirwe ki? Atyo nabi yaahunama; kwonka yaagira ati: Nimmanya ngu Ruhanga amaririire kukucwekyereza, ahabw'okukora eki, okanga kuhurira eki nkuhabwire.<verse eid="2CH 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 25:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:17-24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 14:8-14">2 Bag 14:8-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Amazia yaaza omu naama, yaatuma ahari Yehoashi mwene Yehoahazi, mwijukuru wa Yehu omugabe wa Israeli, naamugira ati: Rugayo, twereebanire akaso omu kandi. <verse eid="2CH 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 25:18" />Yehoashi omugabe wa Israeli yaatuma ahari Amazia omugabe wa Yuda naagira ati: Eitojo rya Lebanooni rikatuma aha mwereezi gwa Lebanooni nirigira riti: Ha mutabani wangye muhara waawe, amushwere. Ku bwaseesire, enyamaishwa y'omu ihamba rya Lebanooni yaija neerabaho, yaariribata. <verse eid="2CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 25:19" />Ogizire oti: Reeba, nteire Abanyaedomu, naabasingura; omutima gwawe gwakureetera eishaija, waayehimbisa. Kwonka ogume omuka; ahabw'enki nootaara akabi, ngu ofe, na Yuda nayo efe.<verse eid="2CH 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 25:20" />Kwonka Amazia yaayanga kuhurira, ahabw'okuba kikaba kirugire ahari MUKAMA, ngu abone kubahayo omu mikono y'abazigu baabo ahabw'okwehongyera baaruhanga ba Edomu. <verse eid="2CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 25:21" />N'ahabw'ekyo Yehoashi omugabe wa Israeli, yainamuka; we na Amazia omugabe wa Yuda baabugaabuganira Beti-shemeshi eya Yuda, baarwanirayo. <verse eid="2CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 25:22" />Abayuda baabingwa Abaisraeli, buri muntu yaahungira omu ka ye. <verse eid="2CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 25:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:17">2 Bus 21:17</ref>. </char></note> Yehoashi omugabe wa Israeli yaakwata Amazia omugabe wa Yuda, mwene Yoasi, mwijukuru wa Ahazia; yaamukwatira Beti-shemeshi, bwanyima yaamureeta Yerusaalemu, yaasheenya orugo rwayo rw'amabaare ekicweka kya mikono magana ana okuruga aha irembo rya Efuraimu okuhika aha irembo ry'aha keekubo. <verse eid="2CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 25:24" />Kandi yaanyaga ezaabu n'efeeza zoona n'ebintu byona ebyashangirwe omu nju ya Ruhanga hamwe na Obededomu; yaagaruka yaanyaga eby'omu mabiikiro g'eju y'omugabe, kandi yaabaihamu abantu, yaabagira omukwato; bwanyima yaagaruka Samaria.<verse eid="2CH 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 25:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 14:17-22">2 Bag 14:17-22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amazia mwene Yoasi omugabe wa Yuda akamara emyaka ikumi n'etaano bwanyima y'okufa kwa Yehoashi mwene Yehoahazi omugabe wa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 25:26" />Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Amazia, okuruga aha kutandika okuhika aha muheru, tehandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'abagabe ba Yuda na Israeli? <verse eid="2CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 25:27" />Okuruga omu bunaku obu yaarugiiremu ahari MUKAMA, bakamugirira enaama y'okumugomera omuri Yerusaalemu; yaahungira Lakishi; kwonka baamukuratsa abantu Lakishi, baamwitirayo. <verse eid="2CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 25:28" />Baamureetera aha mbaraasi, baamuziika omu rurembo rwa Daudi hamwe na baishenkuru.<verse eid="2CH 25:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="2CH 26" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Uziya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 26:1" />Abayuda boona baatwara Uziya, owaabaire aine emyaka ikumi na mukaaga, baamwemeka omu mwanya gwa ishe. <verse eid="2CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 26:2" />Yaayombeka Eloosi, yaagigarurira Abayuda, omugabe ishe aherize kugwejegyera kushanga baishenkuru. <verse eid="2CH 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 26:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:3, 4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:2">2 Bag 15:2</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 15:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Uziya akaba aine emyaka ikumi na mukaaga, obu yaatandika kutegyeka, yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu emyaka makumi ataano n'ebiri. Nyina akaba naayetwa Yekolia owa Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 26:4" />Yaakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA, nk'ebi Amazia ishe yaakozire byona. <verse eid="2CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 26:5" />Omu biro bya Zekaria, owaabaire naamwegyesa okutiina Ruhanga, akamariirira kusherura Ruhanga; kandi omwanya gwona ogu yaamazire naasherura MUKAMA, Ruhanga akamuha omugisha.<verse eid="2CH 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 26:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:29">Isa 14:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yaahurura, yaaza kurwana n'Abafilistia, yaasheenya orugo rw'amabaare orwa Gaasi, orwa Yabune n'orwa Ashidoodi; yaayombeka endembo omu ishaza rya Ashidoodi n'ahandi omu nsi y'Abafilistia. <verse eid="2CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 26:7" />Kandi Ruhanga yaamuhwera omu kurwanisa Abafilistia n'Abaharabu, abaabaire batwire Gurubaali, n'Abameuni. <verse eid="2CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 26:8" />Abaamoni baareetera Uziya emitoijo; kandi okurangaanwa kwe kwabuga, kwahika n'aha mwatano gwa Misri; ahakuba akaba ow'amaani munonga. <verse eid="2CH 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 26:9" />Kandi Uziya yaayombeka eminaara omuri Yerusaalemu aha Irembo ry'aha keekubo, aha Irembo ry'oruhanga, n'aha Keekubo, yaagihamya. <verse eid="2CH 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 26:10" />Yaagaruka yaayombeka eminaara omu ihamba, yaatimba amaziba maingi, ahakuba akaba aine amasyo maingi omu mirambi n'omu mpita; kandi aine abahingi n'abasharizi b'emizaabibu omu bibungo n'omu byanga ebirikweza; ahabw'okuba akaba akunda munonga eby'okuhinga.<verse eid="2CH 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 26:11" />Kandi Uziya akaba aine eihe ry'abaserukare, abahikire kuza aha rugamba, bari omu mitwe y'engabo, nk'oku omubaro gwabaire guri ogw'abaabazirwe Yeyeli omuhandiiki na Maaseya omutware, nibareebererwa Hanania, omwe aha bakuru b'engabo b'omugabe. <verse eid="2CH 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 26:12" />Omubaro gwona ogw'abakuru b'amaju ga baishenkurubo, abashaija b'amaani amamanzi, gukaba guri enkumi ibiri na magana mukaaga. <verse eid="2CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 26:13" />Bakaba nibategyeka eihe ry'abashaija obusiriira bushatu n'enkumi mushanju na magana ataano, abaabaire nibabaasa kurwanisa amaani maingi, bakahwera omugabe kumujuna abazigu. <verse eid="2CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 26:14" />Kandi Uziya yaateekateekyera eihe ryona engabo, amacumu, enkofiira z'orugamba, ebizibaho by'ebyoma, amata n'amabaare g'enjungu. <verse eid="2CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 26:15" />Omuri Yerusaalemu yaakoreramu ebyoma, ebyagunzirwe abanyamyoga, eby'okuta aha minaara n'aha bwekubo bw'engo z'amabaare, okurasisa emyambi n'okurekyeza amabaare mahango. Okurangaanwa kwe kwabuga hoona; ahakuba akahwerwa okutakareebwaga, okuhitsya obu yaahamire. <verse eid="2CH 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 26:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 12:1">2 Bus 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:25">32:25</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 8:14">Bir 8:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:15">32:15</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku yaaherize kuhama, yaagira amaryo, gaamwita; ahakuba akacumura ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga we, yaataaha omuri hekalu ya MUKAMA kwoterera obubaane aha kyoterero kyabwo. <verse eid="2CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 26:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:10">1 Bus 6:10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Azaria omunyamurwa yaataahamu amukuratiire, n'abanyamurwa ba MUKAMA makumi munaana, abashaija amamanzi; <verse eid="2CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 26:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:40">Kub 16:40</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:7">18:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 30:7">Kur 30:7</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 30:8">8</ref>. </char></note> baamuzibira nibamugira bati: Ti murimo gwawe, Uziya, kwoterera MUKAMA obubaane, kureka n'ogw'abanyamurwa beene Arooni abashorooreirwe okwotera obubaane. Ruga omu Mwanya ogurikwera; ahakuba waacumura, kandi tikirikwija kukuhaisa kitiinisa ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga. <verse eid="2CH 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 26:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:27">2 Bag 5:27</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 12:10">Kub 12:10</ref>. </char></note> Uziya yaagira ekiniga. Obwo akaba aine akooterero k'obubaane omu ngaro, naaza kubwotera; ku yaagiriire ati abanyamurwa ekiniga, ahonaaho ebibembe byamusheesha aha buso omu maisho g'abanyamurwa omu nju ya MUKAMA, ahu yaabaire ayemereire aha rubaju rw'ekyoterero ky'obubaane. <verse eid="2CH 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 26:20" />Azaria omunyamurwa omukuru n'abandi banyamurwa boona ku baagiire kumwetegyereza bati, baashanga aine ebibembe aha buso. Baamutsindika n'amaani kumushohoza, kandi nawe yairuka, yaashohora, ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akaba amuteire. <verse eid="2CH 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 26:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:21-23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:5-7">1 Bag 15:5-7</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe Uziya yaaguma ari omubembe okuhitsya aha izooba eri yaafeereireho; ahabw'okubemba yaaguma hangahari naaraara omu nganyo, ahabw'okuba akacuubwa omu nju ya MUKAMA. Bwanyima Yosamu omutabani yaaguma naareeberera ekikaari ky'omugabe, kandi naategyeka abantu b'omuri egyo nsi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 13:46">Lev 13:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 5:2">Kub 5:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="2CH 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 26:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:1">Isa 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:1">6:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Endiijo mirimo ya Uziya, okuruga aha kutandika, okuhika aha muheru ekahandiikwa Isaaya nabi mwene Amozi. <verse eid="2CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 26:23" />Uziya yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, baamuziika omu iziikiro eryabaire riri ery'abagabe; ahabw'okuba bakagira bati: N'omubembe. Yosamu omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2CH 26:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="2CH 27" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Yosamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 27:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:1-3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 15:29">2 Bag 15:29</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 16:7-10">16:7-10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yosamu akaba aine emyaka makumi abiri n'etaano, obu yaatandika kutegyeka; yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu emyaka ikumi na mukaaga. Nyina akaba naayetwa Yerusha muhara wa Zadoki. <verse eid="2CH 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 27:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:16">2 Bus 26:16</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA, nk'ebi Uziya ishe yaakozire byona, okwihaho eky'okutaahisa amaani omuri hekalu ya MUKAMA. Kwonka abantu baagumizamu nibakora ebibi. <verse eid="2CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 27:3" />Yaayombeka eirembo rya ruguru ery'enju ya MUKAMA, kandi yaayombeka ebyombeko bingi aha rugo rw'amabaare rwa Ofeli. <verse eid="2CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 27:4" />Kandi yaayombeka endembo omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Yuda, hamwe n'ebigo n'eminaara aha bubungo bw'ebibira. <verse eid="2CH 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 27:5" />Yaarwanisa abagabe b'Abaamoni, yaabasingura. Omu mwaka ogwo Abaamoni baamutoijera etalanta z'efeeza igana, n'ebitenga by'engano kakumi, n'ebya sayiri kakumi. Kandi omu mwaka gwa kabiri n'ogwa kashatu Abaamoni baamutoijera batyo. <verse eid="2CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 27:6" />Atyo Yosamu yaahinduka ow'amaani, ahabw'okushemeza emitwarize ye omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga we.<verse eid="2CH 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 27:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 15:36">2 Bag 15:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Endiijo mirimo ya Yosamu, n'engamba ze zoona, n'emitwarize ye, reeba bihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'abagabe ba Israeli n'aba Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 27:8" />Akaba aine emyaka makumi abiri n'etaano, obu yaatandika kutegyeka, yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu emyaka ikumi na mukaaga. <verse eid="2CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 27:9" />Yosamu yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa omu rurembo rwa Daudi. Ahazi omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2CH 27:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="2CH 28" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Ahazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 28:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:1-4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 16:2-4">2 Bag 16:2-4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahazi akaba aine emyaka makumi abiri, obu yaatandika kutegyeka, yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu emyaka ikumi na mukaaga. Tiyaakora birikusiimwa MUKAMA nka Daudi ishenkuru, <verse eid="2CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 28:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:17">Kur 34:17</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 2:11">Bar 2:11</ref>. </char></note> kureka yaakuratira emicwe y'abagabe ba Israeli. Kandi yaaheesha n'ebishushani ebirikuramibwa ahabwa Baabaali; <verse eid="2CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 28:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:25">2 Bus 28:25</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 33:2">33:2</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 33:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:9">Bir 18:9</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18:21</ref>. </char></note> yaaguma naayoterera obubaane omu ruhanga rwa mwene Hinoomu, yaarabya abaana be omu muriro, naakuratira emigyenzo erikunugwa ey'abanyamahanga, abu MUKAMA yaabingire omu maisho g'Abaisraeli. <verse eid="2CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 28:4" />Yaaguma naatambira omu myanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, aha bibungo, n'ahansi ya buri kiti ekyetwa omurinzi, kandi naayotererayo obubaane.<verse eid="2CH 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 28:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 16:5">2 Bag 16:5</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 16:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 7:1">Isa 7:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo MUKAMA Ruhanga we yaamuheereireyo omu mikono y'omugabe wa Siria, ogwo mugabe akamusingura, akakwata abantu be baingi munonga, akabatwara Damasiko bari enkwatwa. Kandi yaaheebwayo omu mikono y'omugabe wa Israeli, yaita abantu be baingi munonga, yaamusingura. <verse eid="2CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 28:6" />Ahakuba Peeka mwene Remalia omu izooba rimwe akaita omuri Yuda abashaija amamanzi akasiriira n'obukumi bubiri, ahabw'okuba bakatsigaho MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo. <verse eid="2CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 28:7" />Na Zikuri, omushaija rugambwa owa Efuraimu yaita Maaseya mutabani w'omugabe, na Azurikaamu omukuru w'ekikaari ky'omugabe, na Elukaana enganzi y'omugabe.<verse eid="2CH 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 28:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 11:4">2 Bus 11:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaisraeli baakwata omuri beene waabo abantu obusiriira bubiri, abakazi, abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki; kandi baabanyaga eminyago mingi, baagitwara Samaria. <verse eid="2CH 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 28:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:6">Ezr 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 47:6">Isa 47:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12">Ezk 25:12</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 25:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:2">26:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:5">Kush 18:5</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka okwo hakaba hariyo nabi wa MUKAMA owaabaire naayetwa Odedi; nabi ogwo yaashohora kubugana eihe eryabaire niritabaaruka, niriza Samaria; yaabagira ati: Nimumanya ku MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baashwenkuriimwe yaagwereirwe kubi Abayuda, akabahayo omu mikono yaanyu; kwonka imwe murengyesereize, mwabaita mwine ekiniga kingi ekihinguraine munonga. <verse eid="2CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 28:10" />Mbwenu nimwenda kugira Abayuda n'aba Yerusaalemu abahuuku n'abazaana. Imwe timwine ebibi byanyu, ebi mucumwire ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu? <verse eid="2CH 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 28:11" />Mbwenu mumpurire, mugarureyo aba bantu, abu mukwatsire omuri beene waanyu, ei mubaihire, ahakuba MUKAMA abagiriire ekiniga kingi munonga. <verse eid="2CH 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 28:12" />Kandi n'abakuru bamwe b'Abaefuraimu, Azaria, mwene Yohanaani, Berekia mwene Meshilemoosi, Mehizikia mwene Shalumu na Amasa mwene Hadulai, baayemerera kukumiirira abaabaire nibaruga aha rugamba, <verse eid="2CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 28:13" />baabagira bati: Timurikwija kureeta aha nkwatwa, ahabw'okuba nimwenda kutureetera orubanja rw'okucumura ahari MUKAMA, kwongyera aha bibi n'orubanja ebi twine; haza orubanja oru twine ruri ruhango, kandi ahari Israeli hariho ekiniga kingi. <verse eid="2CH 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 28:14" />N'ahabw'ekyo abo bashaija abaabaire baine eby'okurwanisa baatsiga enkwatwa n'eminyago omu maisho g'abakuru n'omutwe gwona ogw'abateeraine. <verse eid="2CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 28:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:22">2 Bag 6:22</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 25:21">Enf 25:21</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 25:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:20">Rom 12:20</ref>. </char></note> Abo bakuru, abu amaziina gaabo gaagambwaho, baimuka, baayakiira enkwatwa, boona abaabire bajwaire busha omuribo baabajweka eby'omu minyago; batyo baabajweka, baabaha enkaito, baabaha eby'okurya n'eby'okunywa, baabasiiga amajuta, boona abaabaire bataine maani omuribo baabaheeka aha ndogoya, baabahitsya omuri beene waabo ahari Yeriko, orurembo rw'emikindo. Bwanyima baagaruka Samaria.<verse eid="2CH 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 28:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 16:7">2 Bag 16:7</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 16:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu bunaku obwo omugabe Ahazi akatuma aha mugabe wa Asiria kumuha emikono; <verse eid="2CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 28:17" />ahabw'okuba Abanyaedomu bakaba batabaire Yuda, bagisingwire, bakwatsireyo enkwatwa. <verse eid="2CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 28:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:27">Ezk 16:27</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:57">57</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'Abafilistia bakaba bateire endembo z'omu mirambi n'omuri Negebu eya Yuda, bakwatsire Beti-shemeshi, Ayalooni, Gederoosi, Sooko n'ebirorero byayo, Timuna n'ebirorero byayo, na Gimuzo n'ebirorero byayo; bwanyima baazituuramu. <verse eid="2CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 28:19" />Ahakuba MUKAMA akaba agarwire Abayuda ahansi, naabatura Ahazi omugabe wa Israeli, ahabw'okuba akakorera omuri Yuda ebitahikire, yaacumura munonga ahari MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 28:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:29">2 Bag 15:29</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 16:7">16:7</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo Tigulaasi-peleseeri omugabe wa Asiria yaija yaamuteera, yaamubonabonesa omu mwanya gw'okumugumya. <verse eid="2CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 28:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:8">2 Bag 16:8</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 16:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Ahazi akaiha ebintu omu nju ya MUKAMA n'omu y'omugabe n'omu maju g'abanyiginya, yaabitoijera omugabe wa Asiria; kwonka tibyagira ki byamugasira.<verse eid="2CH 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 28:22" />Kandi omu biro by'obusaasi bwe akeeyongyera kucumura ahari MUKAMA, ogwo mugabe weena Ahazi; <verse eid="2CH 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 28:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 25:14">2 Bus 25:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:17">Yer 44:17</ref>, <ref loc="JER 44:18">18</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba akatambira baaruhanga ba Damasiko ebitambo, abaabaire bamusingwire, yaagira ati: Ahabw'okuba baaruhanga b'abagabe ba Siria bakabahwera, naanye niinyija kubatambira ebitambo, babone kumpwera. Kwonka bakaba bari ab'okumucwekyereza hamwe na Israeli yoona. <verse eid="2CH 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 28:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:17">2 Bag 16:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 29:3">2 Bus 29:3</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 29:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 30:14">30:14</ref>. </char></note> Ahazi yaateeranira hamwe ebintu by'omu nju ya Ruhanga, yaabitematemamu ebicweka, yaakinga enyigi z'enju ya MUKAMA, yaayeyombekyera amatambiro buri hantu omuri Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 28:25" />Kandi omuri buri rurembo rwa Yuda yaakoramu emyanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, kuguma naayoterereramu baaruhanga abandi obubaane, naagwisa kubi MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkuru.<verse eid="2CH 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 28:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:26, 27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 16:19">2 Bag 16:19</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 16:20">20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Endiijo mirimo ye n'emitwarize ye yoona, okwiha aha kutandika okuhitsya aha muheru, reeba, bihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'abagabe ba Yuda n'aba Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 28:27" />Bwanyima Ahazi yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa omu rurembo Yerusaalemu, ahabw'okuba tibaramuziikire mu bituuro by'abagabe ba Israeli. Hezekia omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2CH 28:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="2CH 29" />
  <para style="s1">Hezekia okugarura Abayuda ahari MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 29:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:1, 2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 18:1-3">2 Bag 18:1-3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hezekia akatandika kutegyeka aine emyaka makumi abiri n'etaano; yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu emyaka makumi abiri na mwenda. Nyina akaba naayetwa Abiya muhara wa Zekaria.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:5">2 Bus 26:5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 29:2" />Akakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA, nk'ebi Daudi, ishe, yaakozire byona.<verse eid="2CH 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 29:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 28:24">2 Bus 28:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gw'okubanza ogw'omu busingye bwe, omu kwezi kw'okubanza, akaigura enyigi z'enju ya MUKAMA, yaazihunduuza. <verse eid="2CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 29:4" />Yaataasyamu abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi, yaabateeranira omu mwanya omuhango aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, <verse eid="2CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 29:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:6">2 Bus 35:6</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:12">1 Bus 15:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:20">Ezr 6:20</ref>. </char></note> yaabagira ati: Imwe Baleevi 'mwe, nimumpurire! Mweyeze hati, mweze n'enju ya MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa baashwekuriimwe, mwihe oburofa omu Mwanya ogurikwera. <verse eid="2CH 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 29:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:27">Yer 2:27</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 8:16">Ezk 8:16</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba batatenkuriitwe bakacumura, baakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, Ruhanga waitu; baamutsigaho, baagaruka baiha amaisho aha Butaaho bwa MUKAMA, baamuteera amabega. <verse eid="2CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 29:7" />Kandi baakinga enyigi z'ekisasi, baaraaza amatabaaza, kandi tibaayoterera Ruhanga wa Israeli bubaane, n'obu kwakuba okumutambira ebitambo by'okwotsya omu Mwanya ogurikwera. <verse eid="2CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 29:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:18">2 Bus 24:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:25">Bir 28:25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:8">Yer 19:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:9">25:9</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:18">29:18</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:16">Mik 6:16</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo kyareeteire MUKAMA kugirira Abayuda n'aba Yerusaalemu ekiniga, akabahayo kuba eky'okutiinisa, n'eky'okutangarirwa, kandi n'eky'okweshaanya, nk'oku murikubireebesa amaisho gaanyu. <verse eid="2CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 29:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:5">2 Bus 28:5</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 28:6">6</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 28:8">8</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 28:17">17</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, ebyo bikareetera baatatenkuriitwe kwitwa rurara, kandi batabani baitu na bahara baitu n'abakazi baitu baaba enkwatwa. <verse eid="2CH 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 29:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:12">2 Bus 15:12</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ekindi aha mutima n'okuragaana endagaano na MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, ngu ekiniga kye kingi kibone kuturugaho. <verse eid="2CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 29:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:6">Kub 3:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 8:14">8:14</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:2">18:2</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 18:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Baana bangye, murekye kweganda, ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akabatoorana kwemerera omu maisho ge, okumuheereza, okuba abaheezera be, n'okumwoterera obubaane.<verse eid="2CH 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 29:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 3:17">Kub 3:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Abaleevi baimuka, Mahasi mwene Amasai, Yoeli mwene Azaria, ab'omuri beene Kohasi; ab'omuri beene Merari, Kiishi mwene Abudi, Azaria mwene Yehaleleeli; ab'omuri beene Gereshoni, Yoa mwene Zima, na Edeni mwene Yoa; <verse eid="2CH 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 29:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:39">1 Bus 6:39</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:8">15:8</ref>. </char></note> ab'omuri beene Elizafaani, Shimuri na Yeueli; ab'omuri beene Asafu, Zekaria na Matania; <verse eid="2CH 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 29:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:33">1 Bus 6:33</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 9:16">9:16</ref>. </char></note> ab'omuri beene Hemani, Yehueli na Shimei; n'ab'omuri beene Yedusuuni, Shemaaya na Uzieli. <verse eid="2CH 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 29:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:12">2 Bus 30:12</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:9">Neh 13:9</ref>. </char></note> Baateerana beene waabo, baayeyeza, baataaha omu nju ya MUKAMA kugishemeza, nk'omugabe oku yaaragiire naakuratira ebigambo bya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 29:16" />Abanyamurwa baaza omu nju ya MUKAMA aha muheru kuhashemeza, baashohoza oburofa bwona obu baashangire omuri hekalu ya MUKAMA, baabuhitsya omu kikaari ky'enju ya MUKAMA; bwanyima Abaleevi baabutwara, baabuhitsya aha kagyera Kidirooni. <verse eid="2CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 29:17" />Baatandika kugyeeza aha kiro ky'okubanza ky'okwezi kw'okubanza, aha kiro kya munaana ky'okwo kwezi baahika aha kisasi kya MUKAMA; bwanyima baamara ebiro munaana nibeeza enju ya MUKAMA, baagiheza aha kiro kya ikumi na mukaaga ky'okwo kwezi. <verse eid="2CH 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 29:18" />Bwanyima baataaha ow'omugabe Hezekia, baamugira bati: Twaheza kushemeza enju ya MUKAMA yoona, n'eitambiro ry'ebitambo by'okwotsya n'ebintu byaryo byona, n'emeeza y'emigaati y'okumurikwa n'ebintu byayo byona. <verse eid="2CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 29:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:24">2 Bus 28:24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'ebintu byona, ebi omugabe Ahazi yaanagire omu kucumura kwe ari aha ngoma, twabishemeza, twabyeza. Mbwenu biri omu maisho g'eitambiro rya MUKAMA.<verse eid="2CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hezekia okugaruraho emigyenzo y'omuri hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 29:20" />Ku bwaseesire, omugabe Hezekia yaimuka kare, yaateerana abakuru b'orurembo, yainamuka omu nju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 29:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:14">Lev 4:14</ref>. </char></note> Baareeta enimi mushanju, empaya z'entaama mushanju, abaana b'entaama mushanju, kandi n'empaya z'embuzi mushanju aha bugabe, n'aha Mwanya ogurikwera, kandi n'ahari Yuda. Yaaragiira abanyamurwa beene Arooni kubitambira aha itambiro rya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 29:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:11">2 Bus 35:11</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:21">Heb 9:21</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 8:15">Lev 8:15</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 8:19">19</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 8:24">24</ref>. </char></note> Batyo ezo nimi baaziita, abanyamurwa baatangiriza eshagama yaazo, baagishukyeera eitambiro; baita empaya z'entaama, eshagama yaazo baagishukyera eitambiro; baita n'abaana b'entaama, n'eshagama yaabo baagishukyera eitambiro; <verse eid="2CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 29:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:15">Lev 4:15</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima ezo mpaya z'embuzi ez'okuba empongano y'ekibi zaareetwa omu maisho g'omugabe n'omu maisho g'omutwe gwona oguteeraine, baazitaho engaro zaabo; <verse eid="2CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 29:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:26">Lev 4:26</ref>. </char></note> abanyamurwa baaziita, baatambira eshagama yaazo aha itambiro kuba empongano y'ekibi, okurihiirira Abaisraeli boona; ahakuba omugabe akaragiira ngu batambe ekitambo ky'okwotsya n'empongano y'ekibi ahabwa Israeli yoona.<verse eid="2CH 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 29:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 8:14">2 Bus 8:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:16">1 Bus 15:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 16:4">16:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 23:5">23:5</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 25:1">25:1</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 25:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaata Abaleevi omu nju ya MUKAMA, baine ebitaasa n'enanga n'endingiri, nk'oku kyaragiirwe Daudi na Gaadi omuhanuuzi w'omugabe na Nasani nabi; ahabw'okuba ekiragiro kikaruga ahari MUKAMA, kyaraba omuri baanabi be. <verse eid="2CH 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 29:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:24">1 Bus 15:24</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 23:5">1 Sam 23:5</ref>. </char></note> Batyo Abaleevi baayemerera, baine ebintu bya Daudi eby'okweshongoza, n'abanyamurwa baine amakondere. <verse eid="2CH 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 29:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 23:18">2 Bus 23:18</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Hezekia yaaragiira kutambira ekitambo ky'okwotsya aha itambiro. Ekitambo ky'okwotsya ku kyatandikire kutambwa, ekyeshongoro ky'okweshongorera MUKAMA nakyo kyatandika, hamwe n'amakondere n'ebindi bintu by'okweshongoza bya Daudi omugabe wa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 29:28" />Omutwe gwona ogw'abantu gwaramya, abeeshongozi baayeshongora, n'abateezi b'amakondere baagateera; ebyo byona byagumizamu, okuhitsya obu ekitambo ky'okwotsya kyahweire. <verse eid="2CH 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 29:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:18">2 Bus 20:18</ref>. </char></note> Ekitambo ku kyaherize kutambwa, omugabe n'abaabaire bari hamwe nawe boona bainama, baaramya. <verse eid="2CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 29:30" />Omugabe Hezekia n'abanyiginya baaragiira Abaleevi kweshongorera MUKAMA eby'okuhimbisa, ebi Daudi na Asafu omuhanuuzi baagunzire. Baayeshongora eby'okuhimbisa bashemereirwe, bainama ahansi, baaramya.<verse eid="2CH 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 29:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 35:5">Kur 35:5</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 35:22">22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Hezekia yaagira ati: Mbwenu obu mwayohongyera MUKAMA, mwirire haihi, mureete ebitambo n'empongano z'okusiima omu nju ya MUKAMA. Batyo abantu baareeta ebitambo n'empongano z'okusiima; kandi n'abaabaire baine emitima eyekundiire boona baareeta ebitambo by'okwotsya. <verse eid="2CH 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 29:32" />Omubaro gw'ebitambo by'okwotsya ebi abantu baareetsire gukaba guri enimi makumi mushanju, empaya z'entaama igana, n'abaana b'entaama magana abiri; ebyo byona bikaba biri ebitambo by'okwokyeza MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 29:33" />Kandi empongano ezeeziibwe zikaba ziri enimi magana mukaaga n'entaama enkumi ishatu. <verse eid="2CH 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 29:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:3">2 Bus 30:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 35:11">35:11</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abanyamurwa bakaba bakye, tibaabaasa kubaaga bitambo by'okwotsya byona; nikyo kyareeteire beene waabo Abaleevi kubahwera, okuhitsya obu omurimo gwahweire, abandi banyamurwa batakeeyerize; ahabw'okuba Abaleevi bakaba nibakiza abanyamurwa omutima gw'okwezirikira okweyeza. <verse eid="2CH 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 29:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 3:1">Lev 3:1</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 3:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 15:7">Kub 15:7</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 15:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Okwongyera ahari ebyo bitambo by'okwotsya ebingi munonga, hakaba hariho n'ebishaju by'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, n'ez'eby'okunywa ebirikuhongwa na buri kitambo kyona eky'okwotsya. Okwo nikwo omurimo gw'obuheereza bw'omu nju ya MUKAMA gwagarwireho. <verse eid="2CH 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 29:36" />Hezekia n'abantu boona baashemerererwa ebi Ruhanga yaakoreire abantu; ahabw'okuba bikakorwa ahonaaho.<verse eid="2CH 29:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="2CH 30" />
  <para style="s1">Abantu okweteguurira Okuhingurwaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 30:1" />Bwanyima Hezekia yaatuma aha Baisraeli n'aha Bayuda boona, kandi yaahandiikira Abaefuraimu n'Abamanaase ebaruha, kwija omu nju ya MUKAMA Yerusaalemu, kukorera MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho. <verse eid="2CH 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 30:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 9:10">Kub 9:10</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 9:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba omugabe n'abanyiginya be, n'abantu boona abaateeraniire Yerusaalemu bakaba bahanwire kutaho obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho omu kwezi kwa kabiri, <verse eid="2CH 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 30:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:17">2 Bus 29:17</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 29:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:6">Kur 12:6</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 12:18">18</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba tibarabaasize kubutaho mu bunaku bwabwo ahabw'omubaro gw'abanyamurwa abeeyerize kutahika, kandi n'ahabw'abantu kushangwa batateeraniire Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 30:4" />Egyo naama yaasiimwa omugabe n'abantu boona. <verse eid="2CH 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 30:5" />Batyo baataho ekirangiriro, baakirangirira omuri Israeli yoona, okutandikira Beeri-sheba okuhika Daani, ngu abantu baije Yerusaalemu, bakorere MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho; ahabw'okuba bakaba batakibukora bari baingi munonga, nk'oku kyabaire kihandiikirwe. <verse eid="2CH 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 30:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:19">2 Bag 15:19</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 15:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:1">Yer 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:12">Yoel 2:12</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 2:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baamatarisi baatwara ebaruha ezirikuruga aha mugabe n'abanyiginya be, baazibuzya Israeli na Yuda yoona, ezirikugamba ekiragiro ky'omugabe naagira ati: Imwe Baisraeli 'mwe, mugarukire MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Abrahamu, owa Isaaka kandi owa Israeli, nawe abone kubagarukira, imwe abatsigaireho, abaahonokire omu mikono y'omugabe wa Asiria. <verse eid="2CH 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 30:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:8">2 Bus 29:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:18">Ezk 20:18</ref>. </char></note> Mutaba nka baashwenkuriimwe nari beene waanyu, abaabaire bacumura ahari MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo, kikamureetera kubahayo, bakahwerekyerera, nk'oku murikureeba. <verse eid="2CH 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 30:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:10">2 Bus 29:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17">Yer 17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23">23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:51">Byak 7:51</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:14">2 Bag 17:14</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 32:9">Kur 32:9</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mbwenu mutagira ebitsya bigangaire nka baashwenkuriimwe, kureka mwehongyere MUKAMA, mutaahe omu Mwanya gwe ogurikwera, ogu yaayerize kuba ogurikwera ebiro byona, muheereze MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, ekiniga kye kingi kibone kubarugaho. <verse eid="2CH 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 30:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6">Kur 34:6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 7:3">1 Sam 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:46">Zab 106:46</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:9">Dan 9:9</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ku muraagarukire MUKAMA, beene wanyu n'abaana baanyu nibaija kugirirwa embabazi abaabatwaire bari enkwatwa, bagarukye omu nsi egi. Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu agira embabazi n'esaasi; kandi ku muraamugarukire, tarikwija kubaima maisho.<verse eid="2CH 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 30:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Bus 36:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Batyo baamatarisi baaraba omu nsi ya Efuraimu n'eya Manaase, nibaruga omu rurembo nibaza omurundi, baahika n'omu nsi ya Zebuluuni; abaayo baabashekyerera munonga, baabateerera enaku. <verse eid="2CH 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 30:11" />Kwonka abamwe aha Baasheri n'Abamanaase n'Abazebuluuni baayoroba, baija Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 30:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:15">2 Bus 29:15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'omuri Yuda omukono gwa MUKAMA gwabaha kugira omutima gumwe, baayorobera ekiragiro ky'omugabe n'abanyiginya eki baaragiirwe ekigambo kya MUKAMA.<verse eid="2CH 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwijuka Okuhingurwaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 30:13" />Bwanyima abantu baingi baateeranira Yerusaalemu kwijuka obugyenyi bw'emigaati etatumbisiibwe omu kwezi kwa kabiri, bari omutwe muhango munonga. <verse eid="2CH 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 30:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:16">2 Bus 15:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 28:24">28:24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:6">2 Bag 23:6</ref>. </char></note> Baimuka, baiha Yerusaalemu amatambiro agaabaire gariyo, n'ebyoterero by'okwotereraho obubaane byona baabitwara, baabinaga omu kagyera Kidirooni. <verse eid="2CH 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 30:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:34">2 Bus 29:34</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 35:11">35:11</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:20">Ezr 6:20</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baita omwana gw'entaama gw'Okuhingurwaho aha kiro kya ikumi na bina omu kwezi kwa kabiri. Abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi baakwatwa enshoni, baayeyeza, baareeta ebitambo by'okwotsya omu nju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 30:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:10">2 Bus 35:10</ref>. </char></note> Baayemerera omu myanya yaabo nk'emigyenzo yaabo oku yaabaire eri, nibakuratira ekiragiro kya Musa omushaija wa Ruhanga; abanyamurwa baamiisha eshagama ei baahairwe Abaleevi. <verse eid="2CH 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 30:17" />Ahabw'okuba hakaba hariho baingi omu mutwe ogwo abaabaire bateeyerize; nikyo kyareeteire Abaleevi kwita omwana gw'entaama gw'Okuhingurwaho ahabwa buri muntu weena owaabaire atashemeire, okubeereza MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 30:18" />Ahakuba abantu baingi munonga omu Baefuraimu, Abamanaase, Abaisakaari n'Abazebuluuni bakaba bateeyerize, baafa okurya omwana gw'entaama gw'Okuhingurwaho omu muringo ogutarikwikirizibwa biragiro. <verse eid="2CH 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 30:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:3">2 Bus 19:3</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba Hezekia akaba abashabiire naagira ati: MUKAMA omurungi asaasire buri muntu, omaririire kusherura Ruhanga, MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkuru, n'obu araabe ateeziibwe nk'emigyenzo y'Omwanya ogurikwera oku eri. <verse eid="2CH 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 30:20" />MUKAMA yaahurira Hezekia, yaakiza abantu. <verse eid="2CH 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 30:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:15">Kur 12:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:6">13:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:22">Ezr 6:22</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Abaisraeli abo abaabaire bari Yerusaalemu baamara ebiro mushanju nibaijuka obugyenyi bw'emigaati etatumbisiibwe n'okushemererwa kwingi munonga; kandi Abaleevi n'abanyamurwa baaguma nibahimbisa MUKAMA buri izooba, nibamweshongorera n'amaani gaabo goona. <verse eid="2CH 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 30:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 5:5">Lev 5:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Hezekia yaagamba ebigambo by'okwezirikisa Abaleevi boona abayorekire obwengye omu murimo gw'okuheereza MUKAMA. Batyo abantu baarya eby'okurya by'obugyenyi okumara ebiro mushanju, nibahonga empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, nibasiima MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo.<verse eid="2CH 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 30:23" />Bwanyima omutwe gwona gwasiima kweyongyera ebindi biro mushanju omu bugyenyi; batyo baamara ebyo biro nibashemererwa. <verse eid="2CH 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 30:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:34">2 Bus 29:34</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda akaha omutwe gw'abantu enimi rukumi n'entaama enkumi mushanju kuba ebitambo; abanyiginya nabo baaha ogwo mutwe enimi rukumi n'entaama kakumi; n'abanyamurwa baingi baayeyeza. <verse eid="2CH 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 30:25" />Omutwe gwona ogw'Abayuda n'abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi, n'omutwe gwona ogwarugire omuri Israeli n'abashuhuuki abaarugire omu nsi ya Israeli n'abashuhuuki abaabaire batwire omuri Yuda, baashemererwa. <verse eid="2CH 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 30:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 7:8-10">2 Bus 7:8-10</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo haabaho okushemererwa kwingi munonga omuri Yerusaalemu, ahabw'okuba okwiha obu obusingye bwa Sulemaani mwene Daudi omugabe wa Israeli bwarugaho hakaba hatakabahoga bugyenyi nk'obwo omuri Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 30:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:23-27">Kub 6:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 26:15">Bir 26:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 68:5">Zab 68:5</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi baimuka, baashabira abantu omugisha; eiraka ryabo ryahurirwa, kandi okushaba kwabo kwahika omu mwanya gwe ogurikwera ogu atuuramu omu iguru.<verse eid="2CH 30:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="2CH 31" />
  <para style="s1">Omugabe Hezekia okushemeza emigyenzo y'ediini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 31:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 18:4">2 Bag 18:4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:21">Bir 16:21</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 16:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:13">Kur 34:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyo byona ku byahweire, Abaisraeli boona abaabaire bari aho baaza omu ndembo za Yuda, baashenyagura enyomyo, baatemagura Ashera, baasheenya ebyombeko by'omu myanya mikuru y'okuramizamu n'amatambiro omuri Yuda yoona, omuri Benyamiini, Efuraimu na Manaase, okuhitsya obu baabicwekyereize byona. Batyo Abaisraeli boona baagaruka omu ndembo zaabo, buri muntu omu butaka bwe.<verse eid="2CH 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 31:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 23:30">1 Bus 23:30</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 23:31">31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Hezekia yaabaganisa abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi omu bicweka, buri kicweka nk'omurimo gwakyo gw'okuheereza oku gwabaire guri, abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi okuguma nibatamba ebitambo by'okwotsya, okuhonga empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, okuheereza, okusiima n'okuhimbisiza omu marembo g'orusiisira rwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 31:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:7">2 Bus 35:7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:3-29:40">Kub 28:3—29:40</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omugabo ogu omugabe yaihire omu bintu bye kuguma naaha gukaba guri ogw'ebitambo by'okwotsya,–ebitambo by'okwotsya omu kasheeshe n'omu mwabazyo, ebya sabato, eby'okuboneka kw'ameezi n'eby'amagyenyi agaatairweho, nk'oku bihandiikirwe omu biragiro bya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 31:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:8-24">Kub 18:8-24</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yaaragiira abantu abaabaire batwire Yerusaalemu kuguma nibaha abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi emigabo ebashemereire, ngu nabo babone kwehayo omu biragiro bya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 31:5" />Ekiragiro ekyo ku kyaherize kiti kubuga, Abaisraeli baareeta emiganuro mingi munonga, engano, viinyo, amajuta, obwoki n'ebindi byona ebyarugire omu misiri; kandi baareeta ana kimwe kya ikumi ekya buri kintu, byaba bingi munonga. <verse eid="2CH 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 31:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lev 27:30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:28">Bir 14:28</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli n'Abayuda abaabaire batwire omu ndembo za Yuda nabo baareeta kimwe kya ikumi eky'ente n'entaama, n'ebintu ebyeziibwe, ebyabaire bishorooreirwe MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo, ebintu ebyo baabituuma emituumo. <verse eid="2CH 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 31:7" />Omu kwezi kwa kashatu nibwo baatandika kutuuma egyo mituumo, bakaheza omu kwezi kwa mushanju. <verse eid="2CH 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 31:8" />Hezekia n'abanyiginya ku baizire, baareeba egyo mituumo, baasiima MUKAMA n'abantu be Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 31:9" />Bwanyima Hezekia yaabuuza abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi eby'egyo mituumo. <verse eid="2CH 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 31:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:10">Mal 3:10</ref>. </char></note> Azaria omunyamurwa omukuru, ow'omu nju ya Zadoki, yaamugarukamu ati: Obu abantu baatandika kureeta emitoijo omu nju ya MUKAMA, tukatandika obwo kurya n'okuhaaga, n'okushaazya bingi; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akaha abantu be omugisha, nikyo ebi ebyashaagire bibeereire bingi biti.<verse eid="2CH 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 31:11" />Bwanyima Hezekia yaaragiira ku bateguura ebishengye by'enju ya MUKAMA; baabiteguura. <verse eid="2CH 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 31:12" />Baatamu emitoijo, ebicweka bya kimwe kya ikumi, n'ebintu ebyashoroirwe n'obwesigwa. Omukuru waabo owaabaire naabareeberera akaba ari Konania Omuleevi, owa kabiri ari Shimei omurumuna; <verse eid="2CH 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 31:13" />Yehieli, Azazia, Nahasi, Asaheeli, Yerimoosi, Yozabaadi, Elieli, Ismakia, Mahasi na Benaaya, nibo baabaire bari abareeberezi nibahwera Konania na Shimei omurumuna, nk'oku kyaragiirwe Hezekia omugabe na Azaria omukuru w'enju ya Ruhanga. <verse eid="2CH 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 31:14" />Kandi Koore mwene Imuna Omuleevi, omurinzi w'eirembo ry'oburugwa-izooba niwe yaabaire naategyeka emitoijo etoijeirwe Ruhanga n'omutima gwekundiire, naabaganisa ebintu ebibiikiirwe MUKAMA ahabw'empongano ezirikwera munonga. <verse eid="2CH 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 31:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:9-19">Yos 21:9-19</ref>. </char></note> Edeni, Minyamiini, Yeshua, Shemaaya, Amaria na Shekania bakaba bari abeesigwa nibamuhwera omu ndembo z'abanyamurwa, kubaganisiza beene waabo emigabo, abakuru n'abato nibabainganisa, nk'oku ebicweka byabo byabaire biri, <verse eid="2CH 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 31:16" />otaireho abaabaire nibahandiikwa nk'oku oruzaaro rwabo rwabaire nirukuratana, abeetwa abashaija okuruga aha myaka eshatu n'okukiraho, boona abaabaire bataaha omu nju ya MUKAMA, nk'okwetenga kw'omurimo gwa buri izooba oku kwabaire kuri, ngu babone kukora omurimo gwabo, nk'oku embu zaabo zaabaire nizikuratana. <verse eid="2CH 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 31:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:24-27">1 Bus 23:24-27</ref>. </char></note> Abanyamurwa bakahandiikwa, nk'oku amaju ga baishenkurubo gaabaire gari; n'Abaleevi abaabaire baine emyaka makumi abiri n'okukiraho baahandiikwa omu bicweka byabo, nk'oku omurimo gwabo gwabaire guri. <verse eid="2CH 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 31:18" />Abanyamurwa baahandiikwa n'abaana baabo abato boona n'abakazi baabo n'abatabani baabo na bahara baabo, okumarayo oruganda rwona; ahabw'okuba bakaba bari abeesigwa omu kwerinda kuguma bari abarikwera. <verse eid="2CH 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 31:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:34">Lev 25:34</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ahabw'abanyamurwa beene Arooni, abaabaire batwire omu byaro ebyehinguririize endembo zaabo, omuri buri rurembo hakaba harimu abantu abagambirweho amaziina kuba ab'okugaburira oyetwa omushaija weena omu banyamurwa, n'omuntu weena ow'omu Baleevi owaahandiikirwe. <verse eid="2CH 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 31:20" />Okwo nikwo Hezekia yaabitwarize omuri Yuda yoona, akakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA n'eby'oburyo kandi n'eby'obwesigwa. <verse eid="2CH 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 31:21" />Ebi yaakozire byona omu murimo gw'okuheereza omu nju ya Ruhanga, naakuratira ebiragiro n'ebyaragiirwe, omu kusherura Ruhanga we, akaba abikora n'omutima gwe gwona, kandi abigiriramu omugisha.<verse eid="2CH 31:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="2CH 32" />
  <para style="s1">Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria okuteera Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 32:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:1-22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 18:3-19:37">2 Bag 18:3—19:37</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 36:1-37:38">Isa 36:1—37:38</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hezekia ku yaaherize kukora ebyo n'okworeka obwesigwa bwe, Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria yaija yaateera Yuda, yaateera orusiisira kurwanisa endembo ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare, naateekateeka ngu naija kuzeekubuurira zoona. <verse eid="2CH 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 32:2" />Hezekia ku yaareebire Senakeribu yaija amaririire kuteera Yerusaalemu, <verse eid="2CH 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 32:3" />yaahanuura n'abakuru b'engabo ze n'abashaija be ab'amaani kwita enshuro ezaabaire ziri enyima y'orurembo; baamuhwera. <verse eid="2CH 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 32:4" />Abantu baingi munonga baateerana, baita enshuro zoona, n'akagyera akaabaire nikaraba omuri egyo nsi, ahakuba bakagira bati: Ebyo nikwo kwona Abaasiria baije, bashangye egi amaizi maingi? <verse eid="2CH 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 32:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 25:23">2 Bus 25:23</ref>. </char></note> Yaayezirika kukora, yaayombeka busya orugo rw'amabaare orwakumbagaziibwe, yaarwombekaho eminaara, kandi enyima yaarwo yaayombekayo orundi rugo, yaahamya Miilo omu rurembo rwa Daudi. Kandi yaaheesesa eby'okurwanisa n'engabo bingi munonga. <verse eid="2CH 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 32:6" />Yaataho abakuru b'engabo kutegyeka abantu, yaabateeranira ah'ari omu kubuga eky'aha irembo ry'orurembo, yaabagambira ebigambo by'okubagumya, naagira ati: <verse eid="2CH 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 32:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:15">2 Bus 20:15</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 6:16">2 Bag 6:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 31:6">Bir 31:6</ref>. </char></note> Mube ab'amaani, mugume; mutatiina, kandi mutahahaaza emitima ahabw'omugabe wa Asiria n'engabo ze nyingi ezi aine; ahabw'okuba ori hamwe naitwe naakira ori hamwe nabo. <verse eid="2CH 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 32:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:2">2 Bus 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:17">20:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:5">Yer 17:5</ref>. </char></note> Aha rubaju rwe aine emikono y'abantu-buntu, kwonka aha rubaju rwaitu twine MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu kutuhwera n'okuturwanira engamba zaitu. Abantu baayesiga ebigambo bya Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Senakeribu okutiinisa aba Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 32:9" />Bwanyima y'ebyo Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria, owaabaire agotsire Lakishi n'engabo ze zoona, yaatuma abagaragwa be Yerusaalemu ahari Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda n'aha bantu ba Yuda boona abaabaire bari Yerusaalemu, naagira ati: <verse eid="2CH 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 32:10" />Oku nikwo Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria arikugamba naagira ati: Mbwenu mwesigire ki okutegyereza kugoterwa omuri Yerusaalemu? <verse eid="2CH 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 32:11" />Hezekia, orikubagira ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu naija kutujuna omu mikono y'omugabe wa Asiria, tarikubabeiha, ngu mwitwe enjara n'eiriho? <verse eid="2CH 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 32:12" />Hezekia ogwo tiwe yaihireho emyanya ye mikuru ey'okuramizamu n'amatambiro, naaragiira Abayuda n'aba Yerusaalemu ati: Mushemereire kuguma nimuramiza omu maisho g'eitambiro rimwe ryonka, kandi n'okuritambiraho ebitambo byanyu? <verse eid="2CH 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 32:13" />Timurikumanya oku nyowe na baatatenkuru twagizire abantu boona ab'omu gandi mahanga? Baaruhanga b'ago mahanga bakabaasa kujuna ensi zaabo omu mikono yangye? <verse eid="2CH 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 32:14" />N'oha omuri baaruhanga boona ab'ago mahanga agu baatatenkuru baacwekyerereize kimwe owaabasize kujuna abantu be omu mikono yangye, naimwe mukabona kwesiga ku Ruhanga waanyu arikwija kubakiza? <verse eid="2CH 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 32:15" />N'ahabw'ekyo murekye kwikiriza Hezekia kubabeihabeiha n'okubahabya atyo, kandi murekye kumwesiga, ahabw'okuba tihariho ruhanga ow'eihanga ryona nari obugabe bwona orabaasize kujuna abantu be omu mikono yangye nari eya baatatenkuru, reero kaashwa Ruhanga waanyu!<verse eid="2CH 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 32:16" />Bwanyima abagaragwa be baayeyongyereraho ebindi bigambo baajuma Mukama RUHANGA n'omwiru we Hezekia. <verse eid="2CH 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 32:17" />Kandi Senakeribu yaahandiika ebaruha z'okugayisa MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli n'okumujuma, naagira ati: Nk'oku baaruhanga b'amahanga g'omu nsi batarajunire bantu baabo mu mikono yangye, nikwo na Ruhanga wa Hezekia atarikwija kujuna abe. <verse eid="2CH 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 32:18" />Ebyo bigambo baabigambira aba Yerusaalemu abaabaire bari aha rugo rw'amabaare n'eiraka rihango omu rurimi rw'Abayudaaya, ngu babatiinise, babahahaaze emitima, babone kukwata orurembo. <verse eid="2CH 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 32:19" />Baagamba ahari Ruhanga wa Yerusaalemu, nk'oku bagamba ahari baaruhanga b'ensi abakozirwe emikono y'abantu.<verse eid="2CH 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hezekia okutakira Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 32:20" />Ekyo kyareetera Hezekia omugabe na Isaaya nabi mwene Amozi kushaba nibatakira eiguru. <verse eid="2CH 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 32:21" />N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA yaayohereza maraika, yaacwekyereza abarwani boona ab'amaani, n'abakuru b'amahe n'abakuru b'engabo abaabaire bari omu rusiisira rw'omugabe wa Asiria. Atyo yaagaruka omu nsi ye aine enshoni. Ku yaahikire omuri hekalu ya ruhanga we, abu yaayezaariire baamwitiramu na rurara. <verse eid="2CH 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 32:22" />Okwo nikwo MUKAMA yaajunire Hezekia n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu omu mikono ya Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria, n'omu mikono y'abandi bazigu be boona; bwanyima akabaha okuhuumura embaju zoona. <verse eid="2CH 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 32:23" />Kandi abantu baingi baareetera MUKAMA emitoijo Yerusaalemu, na Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda baamutoijera ebintu by'obuguzi bwingi; okwiha obwo kyamureetera okurangaanwa omu mahanga goona.<verse eid="2CH 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okurwara kwa Hezekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 32:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 20:1-11">2 Bag 20:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:1-8">Isa 38:1-8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo Hezekia akarwara, yaahika aha ncwamba za rufu, yaashaba MUKAMA, yaamugarukamu, kandi yaamuha akamanyiso. <verse eid="2CH 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 32:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:2">2 Bus 19:2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:18">24:18</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:16">26:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 116:12">Zab 116:12</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Hezekia tiyaakora nk'embabazi ezi yaagiriirwe oku zaabaire ziri; ahabw'okuba omutima gwe gukagira amaryo. Ekyarugiremu ekiniga kya MUKAMA kyamwijaho, we n'Abayuda na Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 32:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:12">2 Bus 33:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 26:18">Yer 26:18</ref>, <ref loc="JER 26:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Hezekia yaayecureeza, yaayeteisa amaryo g'omu mutima gwe, we n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu; n'ahabw'ekyo ekiniga kya MUKAMA tikyabaijaho omu busingye bwa Hezekia.<verse eid="2CH 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 32:27" />Kandi Hezekia akaba atungire munonga, aine ekitiinisa kingi; yaayekorera amabiikiro g'efeeza, ezaabu, amabaare g'obuguzi bwingi, emigaju, engabo n'ebintu by'obuguzi bwingi eby'emiringo yoona; <verse eid="2CH 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 32:28" />yaayombeka n'ebitara by'okuhunikamu engano, n'amabiikiro ga viinyo n'amajuta, kandi n'emyanya y'okuraazamu amatungo g'emiringo yoona, n'amaka g'amasyo g'entaama. <verse eid="2CH 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 32:29" />Kandi yaayetungira endembo, n'amasyo g'ente n'ag'entaama nyingi munonga; ahabw'okuba Ruhanga akamuha ebintu bingi munonga. <verse eid="2CH 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 32:30" />Hezekia ogwo yaacungira ahu amaizi ga Gihoni aga ruguru gaabaire nigareetwa, yaagahaburira, yaagatooza aha rubaju rw'orurembo rwa Daudi orw'oburegyerwa-izooba. Hezekia yaagira omugisha omu bi yaabaire naakora byona. <verse eid="2CH 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 32:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:12">2 Bag 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 39:1">Isa 39:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 8:2">Bir 8:2</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omu bigambo by'entumwa z'abategyeki ba Babulooni, ezi baamutumireho kumubuuza eby'akamanyiso akaakozirwe omu nsi ye, Ruhanga akabimurekyera kumugyeza, ngu amanye ebiri omu mutima gwe byona.<verse eid="2CH 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 32:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 36:1-39:8">Isa 36:1—39:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Endiijo mirimo ya Hezekia n'ebirungi ebi yaakozire, reeba, bihandiikirwe omu bi nabi Isaaya mwene Amozi yaayorekirwe, n'omu kitabo ky'abagabe ba Yuda n'aba Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 32:33" />Bwanyima Hezekia yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa aha rubaju rwa ruguru rw'ebituuro bya batabani ba Daudi; aha kufa kwe Abayuda boona n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu baamuha ekitiinisa. Bwanyima omutabani Manaase yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2CH 32:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="2CH 33" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Manaase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 33:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:1-9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 21:1-9">2 Bag 21:1-9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Manaase akaba aine emyaka ikumi n'ebiri, obu yaatandika kutegyeka; yaategyekyera emyaka makumi ataano n'etaano Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 33:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:3">2 Bus 28:3</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, naakuratira emitwarize erikunugwa ey'amahanga agu MUKAMA yaabingire omu maisho g'Abaisraeli. <verse eid="2CH 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 33:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:14">2 Bus 30:14</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 31:1">31:1</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:4">2 Bag 18:4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:3">Bir 17:3</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba akagaruka yaayombeka ebyombeko by'emyanya mikuru y'okuramizamu ebi Hezekia ishe yaasheenyire, yaayombekyera Baali amatambiro, yaakora Ashera, yaaguma naaramya eihe ry'omu iguru ryona, naariheereza. <verse eid="2CH 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 33:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:6">2 Bus 6:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaakora n'amatambiro omu nju ya MUKAMA, ei MUKAMA yaagambireho ati: Omuri Yerusaalemu nimwo eiziina ryangye ririguma ebiro byona. <verse eid="2CH 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 33:5" />Kandi yaayombekyera eihe ry'omu iguru ryona amatambiro omu bikaari byombi eby'enju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 33:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:3">2 Bus 28:3</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:3">1 Sam 28:3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:10">Bir 18:10</ref>. </char></note> Yaarabya abatabani omu muriro omu ruhanga rwa mwene Hinoomu; yaaguma naaraguza abafumu ebiribaho, naarogyesa, naakoresa abateezi b'ebyatsi, naayehanuuza aha barikugambisa emizimu n'aha barogi. Yaakora ebibi bingi omu maisho ga MUKAMA, yaamugwisa kubi. <verse eid="2CH 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 33:7" />Kandi yaata ekishushani ekirikuramibwa eki yaakozire omu nju ya Ruhanga, ei Ruhanga yaagambiire Daudi n'omutabani Sulemaani, naagira ati: omuri egi nju n'omuri Yerusaalemu, ei naatooraine omu nganda za Israeli zoona, nimwo ndita eiziina ryangye kugumamu ebiro byona; <verse eid="2CH 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 33:8" />kandi Abaisraeli ku barita omutima aha kworobera ebi naabaragiire byona, n'ebiragiro ebyatairweho, n'emigyenzo yoona, ebyaragiirwe nibiraba omuri Musa, tindigaruka kwiha bigyere byabo omu nsi ei naateereireho baishenkurubo. <verse eid="2CH 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 33:9" />Atyo Manaase yaahabya Abayuda n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu, kyabareetera kukora ebibi ebirikukira eby'amahanga agu MUKAMA yaacwekyerereize omu maisho g'Abaisraeli.<verse eid="2CH 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 33:10" />Kandi MUKAMA yaagamba na Manaase n'abantu be, kwonka tibakyetaho. <verse eid="2CH 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 33:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:6">2 Bus 36:6</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 20:17">2 Bag 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:36">Bir 28:36</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo MUKAMA yaabateereize abakuru by'eihe ry'omugabe wa Asiria, bakakwata Manaase, bakamubohesa enjegyere n'emihama y'emiringa, bakamutwra Babulooni. <verse eid="2CH 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 33:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:26">2 Bus 32:26</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabaire ari omu busaasi, yaashaba MUKAMA Ruhanga we kumugirira embabazi, yaayecureeza munonga omu maisho ga Ruhanga wa baishenkuru. <verse eid="2CH 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 33:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:25">Dan 4:25</ref>. </char></note> Atyo yaashaba Ruhanga, nawe yaikiriza okweshengyereza kwe, kandi yaahurira okushaba kwe, yaamugarura Yerusaalemu omu bugabe bwe. Manaase yaamanyira aho MUKAMA ku niwe Ruhanga.<verse eid="2CH 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 33:14" />Bwanyima y'ebyo yaayombeka orugo rw'amabaare enyima y'orurembo rwa Daudi aha rubaju rwa Gihoni orw'oburengyerwa-izooba omu ruhanga, yaaruhitsya aha irembo ry'eby'enyanja, yaaruziguza Ofeli, yaarutunguura, rwahika ahaiguru munonga; kandi yaata abakuru b'amahe omu ndembo za Yuda zoona ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare. <verse eid="2CH 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 33:15" />Yaihaho baaruhanga b'abanyamahanga, n'ekishushani kiri ekirikuramibwa yaakiiha omu nju ya MUKAMA, n'amatambiro goona agu yaabaire ayombekire aha kabungo k'enju ya MUKAMA n'omuri Yerusaalemu, yaabinaga aheeru y'orurembo. <verse eid="2CH 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 33:16" />Kandi yaahunduuza eitambiro rya MUKAMA, yaaritambiraho ebitambo by'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye n'eby'okuhimbisa; kandi yaaragiira Abayuda boona kuheereza MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 33:17" />N'obu kiraabe kyabaire kityo, abantu baaguma nibatambira ebitambo omu myanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, kwonka nibabitambira MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo wenka.<verse eid="2CH 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 33:18" />Endiijo mirimo ya Manaase, n'okushaba oku yaashabire Ruhanga we, n'ebigambo ebi abahanuuzi baabaire bamugambira omu iziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, reeba bihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'ebyakozirwe abagabe ba Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 33:19" />Kandi n'okushaba kwe n'oku Ruhanga yaikiriize kuhurira okweshengyereza kwe, n'ekibi kye kyona, n'okucumura kwe, n'ahu yaayombekire ebyombeko omu myanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, akatamu Ashera n'ebishushani ebirikuramibwa, obu yaabaire atakeeteisize, ebyo byona bihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'ebyagambirwe abahanuuzi. <verse eid="2CH 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 33:20" />Bwanyima Manaase yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa omu nju ye, Amoni omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2CH 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 33:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:21-25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 21:19-24">2 Bag 21:19-24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amoni akaba aine emyaka makumi abiri n'ebiri, obu yaatandika kutegyeka; yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu emyaka ebiri. <verse eid="2CH 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 33:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:3">2 Bus 34:3</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 34:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, nk'ebi Manaase ishe yaakozire. Yaatambira ebishushani byona ebi Manaase ishe yaakozire, yaabiheereza. <verse eid="2CH 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 33:23" />Kandi Amoni ogwo tiyaayecureeza mu maisho ga MUKAMA, nk'oku Manaase ishe yaagizire, kureka yaaguma naayeyongyera kushiisha. <verse eid="2CH 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 33:24" />Bwanyima abagaragwa be baamugirira enaama, baamwitira omu nju ye. <verse eid="2CH 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 33:25" />Kwonka abantu b'omuri egyo nsi baita abaamugiriire enaama boona; baayemeka Yosia omutabani omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2CH 33:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="2CH 34" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Yosia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 34:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:1, 2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 22:1">2 Bag 22:1</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 22:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yosia akaba aine emyaka munaana obu yaatandika kutegyeka, yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu emyaka makumi ashatu na gumwe. <verse eid="2CH 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 34:2" />Yaakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA, yaatwaza nka Daudi ishenkuru, tiyaateishuka kutoora aha rubaju rwa buryo nari orwa bumosho. <verse eid="2CH 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 34:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:3">2 Bus 14:3</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba omu mwaka gwe gwa munaana ari aha ngoma, akiri muto, akatandika kusherura Ruhanga wa Daudi ishenkuru; kandi omu mwaka gwe gwa ikumi n'ebiri yaatandika kushemeza Yuda na Yerusaalemu, yaamaramu emyanya mukuru y'okuramizamu, na Ashera, n'ebishushani ebibaizire n'ebiheesire. <verse eid="2CH 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 34:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:6">2 Bag 23:6</ref>. </char></note> Baasheenyera omu maisho ge amatambiro ga Baabaali, yaatema ebishushani by'eizooba ebyabaire biri ahaiguru yaago, byagwa ahansi; yaasheenyagura Ashera, n'ebishushani ebibaizire n'ebiheesire, yaabicwa esingo, egyo singo yaagishuka aha bituuro by'abaabaire babitambira. <verse eid="2CH 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 34:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:20">2 Bag 23:20</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 13:2">1 Bag 13:2</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yaayokyeza amafuga g'abanyamurwa aha matambiro gaabyo; yaashemeza atyo Yuda na Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 34:6" />Kandi yaatwaza atyo n'omu ndembo za Manaase, Efuraimu na Simeoni ezaabaire zaabaire amatongo, nangwa n'okuhika Nafutaali, <verse eid="2CH 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 34:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:21">Bir 9:21</ref>. </char></note> yaasheenya amatambiro, yaahondahonda Ashera, n'ebishushani yaabicwa esingo, yaatemagura ebishushani by'eizooba byona, ebyabaire biri omu nsi ya Israeli yoona, yaabinaga ahansi. Bwanyima yaagaruka Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="2CH 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 34:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 22:3-20">2 Bag 22:3-20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwe gwa ikumi na munaana, ku yaaherize kushemeza ensi na hekalu, yaayohereza Shafani mwene Azalia, Maaseya omukuru w'orurembo na Yoa mwene Yoahazi omuhandiiki w'ebirikubaho, kuhunduuza enju ya MUKAMA Ruhanga we. <verse eid="2CH 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 34:9" />Baahika owa Hilukia omunyamurwa omukuru, baahayo empiiha ezaareetsirwe omu nju ya Ruhanga, ezi Abaleevi abakumiirizi baabaire bashoroize omu Bamanaase, Abaefuraimu, n'omu Baisraeli boona abaabaire batsigaireho, n'omu Bayuda n'Ababenyamiini boona, kandi n'omu batuuzi ba Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 34:10" />Baaziha abakozi abarikureeberera enju ya MUKAMA; bwanyima abakozi abarikukora omu nju ya MUKAMA baatandika kuzikoresa kuhunduuza enju n'okugigira nsya. <verse eid="2CH 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 34:11" />Baaziha ababaizi n'abombeki kugura amabaare agabaizire, embaaho z'okuteerana, n'emitambiko y'ebyombeko ebi abagabe ba Yuda baarekire bikasiisikara. <verse eid="2CH 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 34:12" />Abo bashaija baakora omurimo n'obwesigwa. Abaabaire nibabareeberera bakaba bari Yahasi na Obadia Abaleevi ab'omuri beene Merari, na Zekaria na Meshulaamu ab'omuri beene Kohasi. <verse eid="2CH 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 34:13" />Abandi Baleevi, abaabaire bari abanyabwengye omu kuteera ebirikugamba, baareeberera abeekorezi, kandi baaguma nibeezirikisa boona abaabaire nibakora emirimo y'emiringo yoona ey'okuheereza. Kandi abandi omu Baalevi bakaba bari abahandiiki, abatware n'abakumiirizi.<verse eid="2CH 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzoorwa kw'ekitabo ky'Ebiragiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 34:14" />Ku baabaire nibashohoza empiiha ezaaretsirwe omu nju ya MUKAMA, Hilukia omunyamurwa yaazoora ekitabo ky'Ebiragiro bya MUKAMA, ekyahandiikirwe Musa. <verse eid="2CH 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 34:15" />Hilukia yaagambira Shafani omuhandiiki ati: Nzoire ekitabo ky'Ebiragiro omu nju ya MUKAMA. Atyo yaakiha Shafani. <verse eid="2CH 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 34:16" />Shafani yaakitwarira omugabe, kandi yaagambira omugabe eby'omurimo ati: Ebi abairu baawe bakwatsiibwe babikozire byona; <verse eid="2CH 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 34:17" />batwaire empiiha zoona ezibaire ziri omu nju ya MUKAMA, baaziha abarikureeberera omurimo n'abakozi. <verse eid="2CH 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 34:18" />Kandi Shafani omuhandiiki yaagaruka yaagambira omugabe ati: Hilukia omunyamurwa yampa ekitabo. Atyo yaakishomera omugabe.<verse eid="2CH 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 34:19" />Omugabe ku yaahuriire ebigambo by'ebiragiro, yaataagura ebijwaro bye; <verse eid="2CH 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 34:20" />yaaragiira Hilukia, Ahikaamu mwene Shafani, Abudooni mwene Miika, Shafani omuhandiiki na Asaaya omugaragwa w'omugabe, naagira ati: <verse eid="2CH 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 34:21" />Mwirooko mumbuurize ahari MUKAMA, hamwe n'abatsigaire omuri Israeli na Yuda eby'ebigambo by'omuri eki kitabo ekizoirwe; ahabw'okuba ekiniga kya MUKAMA ekituriho ni kingi, ahakuba baatatenkuriitwe tibaroorobeire kigambo kya MUKAMA kukora ebihandiikirwe omuri eki kitabo byona.<verse eid="2CH 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 34:22" />N'ahabw'ekyo Hilukia n'abu omugabe yaabaire atumire, baaza owa Hulida nabikazi muka Shalumu, mwene Tokuhaasi, mwijukuru wa Hasira, omubiiki w'ebijwaro, (kandi ogwo mukazi akaba atwire Yerusaalemu omu kicweka kyayo kya kabiri), baabimuteekyerereza. <verse eid="2CH 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 34:23" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Mugambire omushaija obantumireho muti: <verse eid="2CH 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 34:24" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ndyareeta akabi aha mwanya ogu n'aha batuuzi baamwo, n'emikyeeno yoona ehandiikirwe omu kitabo ekishomeirwe omugabe wa Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 34:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:3">2 Bus 28:3</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 28:4">4</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 28:25">25</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba bakanfuruka, baayoterera baaruhanga abandi obubaane, ngu bangwise kubi n'ebi barikukora n'emikono yaabo byona, nikyo ekiniga kyangye kirishukirwa ahari ogu mwanya, kitaraazibwe. <verse eid="2CH 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 34:26" />Kwonka omugabe wa Yuda, obatumire kumbuuza, mumugire muti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba aha bigambo ebi ohuriire, naagira ati: <verse eid="2CH 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 34:27" />Ahabw'okugira omutima gworobi, ku ohuriire ebi ngambire aha mwanya ogu n'aha batuuzi baamwo, waayecureeza omu maisho gangye, waataagura ebijwaro byawe, wandirira omu maisho; n'ahabw'ekyo naanye nkuhuriire; nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba. <verse eid="2CH 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 34:28" />Reeba, ndyakushangisa baashwenkuru, oziikwe omu kituuro kyawe n'obusingye, kandi amaisho gaawe tigarireeba kabi koona aku ndireeta aha mwanya ogu n'abagutwiremu. Batyo baagyenda, baabigambira omugabe.<verse eid="2CH 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugabe Yosia okuragaana endagaano na Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 34:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:29-32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:1-3">2 Bag 23:1-3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omugabe yaatuma, yaateeranira hamwe abakuru boona aba Yuda na Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 34:30" />Omugabe yainamuka omu nju ya MUKAMA hamwe n'abashaija ba Yuda boona n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu, abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi, abantu boona abakuru n'abato; yaabashomera ebigambo byona eby'omu kitabo ky'endagaano ekizoirwe omu nju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 34:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:12">2 Bus 6:12</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 6:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 15:12">15:12</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaayemerera omu mwanya gwe, yaaragaana endagaano omu maisho ga MUKAMA, okumukuratira n'okworobera ebiragiro bye n'ebi yaahamize kandi n'ebi yaataireho, n'omutima gwe gwona n'amagara ge goona, n'okuhikiiriza ebigambo by'egyo ndagaano ehandiikirwe omuri ekyo kitabo. <verse eid="2CH 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 34:32" />Bwanyima yaareetera abaabaire bari Yerusaalemu na Benyamiini boona kwemera egyo ndagaano. N'ahabw'ekyo abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu baakora nk'endagaano ya Ruhanga, Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo, oku eri. <verse eid="2CH 34:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 34:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:3">2 Bus 28:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 33:2">33:2</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Yosia yaihaho ebirikunugwa byona omu nsi yoona ey'Abaisraeli, n'abaabaire bari omuri Israeli boona yaabagyema kuheereza MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo. Omu busingye bwe bwona tibararekire kukuratira MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo.<verse eid="2CH 34:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="2CH 35" />
  <para style="s1">Yosia okugaruraho obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 35:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:21-23">2 Bag 23:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:6">Kur 12:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yosia yaagaruriraho MUKAMA obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho omuri Yerusaalemu; baita omwana gw'entaama gw'Okuhingurwaho aha kiro kya ikumi na bina eky'okwezi kw'okubanza. <verse eid="2CH 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 35:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:11">2 Bus 29:11</ref>. </char></note> Yaagarura abanyamurwa aha murimo gwabo, yaabeezirikisa kukora omurimo gw'obuheereza omu nju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 35:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 17:9">2 Bus 17:9</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 30:22">30:22</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 8:7">Neh 8:7</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 8:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 2:7">Mal 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 23:26">1 Bus 23:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 33:10">Bir 33:10</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 10:11">Lev 10:11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaagambira Abaleevi abaabaire beegyesa Abaisraeli, akandi abayereziibwe MUKAMA, ati: Mute eshanduukye erikwera omu nju ei Sulemaani mwene Daudi omugabe wa Israeli yaayombekire; tihaakiriho kirigibaheekyesa obundi. Mbwenu muheereze MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, n'abantu be Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 35:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:26">1 Bus 23:26</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 8:14">2 Bus 8:14</ref>. </char></note> Mweteekateekye omu mbu zaanyu, nk'oku amaju ga baashwenkuriimwe gari, nimukuratira ebyaragiirwe Daudi omugabe wa Israeli, na Sulemaani omutabani. <verse eid="2CH 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 35:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 134:1">Zab 134:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi mwemerere omu mwanya ogurikwera nk'emitwe y'amaju ga baishenkuru ba beene waanyu abatari Baleevi oku eri, buri mutwe gugire ekicweka ky'enju ya baashwenkuriimwe Abaleevi. <verse eid="2CH 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 35:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:5">2 Bus 29:5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 30:2">30:2</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 30:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima mwite omwana gw'entaama gw'Okuhingurwaho, mweyeze, mweteekateekyere beene waanyu, mubone kukora nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA ekyagambirwe Musa oku kiri.<verse eid="2CH 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 35:7" />Ku baaherize, Yosia yaaha abantu abatari Baleevi abaana b'entaama n'ab'embuzi obukumi bushatu n'enimi enkumi ishatu okuruga omu masyo, kuba empongano z'Okuhingurwaho ahabwa boona abaabaire bari aho; ebyo byona bikaruga omu matungo g'omugabe. <verse eid="2CH 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 35:8" />Kandi abanyiginya nabo baaha abantu b'abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi eby'okuhonga, baabiha n'omutima ogwekundiire. Hilukia, Zekaria na Yehieli, abakuru b'enju ya Ruhanga, baaha abanyamurwa abaana b'entaama n'ab'embuzi enkumi ibiri na magana mukaaga, n'enimi magana ashatu, kuba empongano z'Okuhingurwaho. <verse eid="2CH 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 35:9" />Kandi Konania n'abarumuna Shemaaya na Netaneeli, hamwe na Hashabia, Yeyeli na Yozabaadi, abakuru b'Abaleevi, baaha Abaleevi abaana b'entaama n'ab'embuzi enkumi itaano, n'enimi magana ataano, kuba empongano z'Okuhingurwaho.<verse eid="2CH 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 35:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 30:16">2 Bus 30:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baaherize kweteekateekyera okwo kuheereza, abanyamurwa baayemerera omu mwanya gwabo, n'Abaleevi omu bicweka byabo, nk'oku omugabe yaaragiire. <verse eid="2CH 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 35:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:22">2 Bus 29:22</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 29:34">34</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baita omwana gw'entaama gw'Okuhingurwaho, abanyamurwa baamiisiira eshagama ei baahairwe Abaleevi, abaabaire nibabaaga. <verse eid="2CH 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 35:12" />Baihaho ebitambo by'okwotsya, baabibaganisa nk'emitwe y'amaju ga baishenkuru b'abatari Baleevi oku yaabaire eri ngu babone kubihongyera MUKAMA, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe omu kitabo kya Musa. Kandi n'enimi baazitwaza batyo. <verse eid="2CH 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 35:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:8">Kur 12:8</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 12:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:7">Bir 16:7</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima baayotsya omwana gw'entaama gw'Okuhingurwaho nk'oku kirikuragiirwa; kandi n'empongano ezirikwera baaziteeka omu nyabya, omu nyungu n'omu safuriya, ahonaaho baabitwara, baagaburira abantu boona. <verse eid="2CH 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 35:14" />Bwanyima baayeteekateekyera ebyabo ahabwabo n'ahabw'abanyamurwa, ahabw'okuba abanyamurwa beene Arooni bakaba bahugiire omu kutamba ebitambo by'okwotsya n'ebishaju okuhitsya obu bwaizire; batyo Abaleevi baateekateeka ebyabo ahabwabo n'ahabw'abanyamurwa beene Arooni. <verse eid="2CH 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 35:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:17-29">1 Bus 9:17-29</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 26:1-19">26:1-19</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abeeshongozi beene Asafu bakaba bari omu mwanya gwabo, nk'oku kyaragiirwe Daudi na Asafu, Hemani na Yedusuuni, omuhanuuzi w'omugabe; n'abakumiirizi bakaba bari aha marembo goona; abo boona bakaba batarikwenda kuruga aha mirimo yaabo, ahabw'okuba beene waabo Abaleevi bakaba nibabateekateekyera ebyabo.<verse eid="2CH 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 35:16" />Okwo nikwo omurimo gw'okuheereza MUKAMA gwona gwateekateekirwe eryo izooba kwijuka obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho n'okutambira ebitambo by'okwotsya aha itambo rya MUKAMA, nk'oku omugabe Yosia yaaragiirre. <verse eid="2CH 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 35:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:21">2 Bus 30:21</ref>. </char></note> Omu bunaku obwo Abaisraeli, abaabaire bari aho, baijuka obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho, n'obw'emigaati etatumbisiibwe okumara ebiro mushanju. <verse eid="2CH 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 35:18" />Kandi okwiha omu biro bya nabi Samueli omuri Israeli hakaba hatakabahoga bugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho nk'obwo; kandi tihariho mugabe omu bagabe ba Israeli boona owaijukire obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho nk'oku Yosia yaijukire, akwataniise n'abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi, n'aba Yuda na Israeli boona abaabaire bari aho, hamwe n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 35:19" />Omu mwaka gwa ikumi na munaana ogw'omu busingye bwa Yosia, nibwo baijuka obwo bugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho.<verse eid="2CH 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Yosia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 35:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:29">2 Bag 23:29</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 23:30">30</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:2">Yer 46:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo byona, Yosia ku yaaherize kushemeza hekalu, Neeko omugabe wa Misri yainamuka kuteera Kakemeshi aha mugyera Furaati, na Yosia yaahurura kurwana nawe. <verse eid="2CH 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 35:21" />Kwonka Neeko yaamutumaho entumwa, naamugira ati: Mbwenu nyowe naiwe nitufa ki, iwe omugabe wa Yuda? Hati tiiwe nyizire kurwanisa, kureka nyine enju ei ndikurwana nayo; kandi Ruhanga andagiire ngu nyehuute. Ruga Ruhanga omu kaso ori hamwe naanye, atakaakucwekyereza. <verse eid="2CH 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 35:22" />Kwonka Yosia yaayanga kumurugaho, kureka yaayehindura ngu arwane nawe; tiyaahurira bigambo bya Neeko ebirugire omu kanwa ka Ruhanga, yaaza omu rugamba omu ruhita rwa Megido. <verse eid="2CH 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 35:23" />Abarasi baarasha omugabe Yosia; nawe nikwo kugira abashaija be ati: Muunyihe omu rugamba ahakuba naahutaara munonga. <verse eid="2CH 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 35:24" />Batyo abashaija be baamwiha omu kigaari, baamuta omu kigaari kye ekya kabiri, baamutwara Yerusaalemu. Yaafa, yaaziikwa omu bituuro bya baishenkuru. Abayuda n'aba Yerusaalemu boona baamucurira. <verse eid="2CH 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 35:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 4:20">Tonz 4:20</ref>. </char></note> Na Yeremia yaamucurira; kandi abeeshongozi boona, abashaija n'abakazi, baaguma nibamugambaho omu kutonzya kwabo n'okuhitsya hati. Baakihindura omugyenzo omuri Israeli; reeba, bihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'Okutonzya.<verse eid="2CH 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 35:26" />Endiijo mirimo ya Yosia, n'ebirungi ebi yaakozire naakuratira ebihandiikirwe omu biragiro bya MUKAMA, <verse eid="2CH 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 35:27" />n'ebi yaakozire okwiha aha kutandika okuhitsya aha muheru, reeba, bihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'Abagabe ba Israeli n'aba Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 35:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="2CH 36" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Yuda abarikuhereeruka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 36:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:1-4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:30-34">2 Bag 23:30-34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima abantu b'omu nsi egyo baatwara Yehoahazi mwene Yosia, baamwemeka omu mwanya gwa ishe omuri Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2CH 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 36:2" />Yehoahazi akaba aine emyaka makumi abiri n'eshatu, obu yaatandika kutegyeka; yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu ameezi ashatu. <verse eid="2CH 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 36:3" />Bwanyima y'ago meezi ashatu omugabe wa Misri yaamwiha aha ngoma omuri Yerusaalemu, yaacwera ab'omuri egyo nsi etalanta z'efeeza igana n'etalanta emwe y'ezaabu. <verse eid="2CH 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 36:4" />Bwanyima omugabe wa Misri ogwo Neeko yaayemeka Eliakimu mukuru we kuba omugabe wa Yuda na Yerusaalemu, yaahindura eiziina rye, yaamweta Yehoyakimu; kandi yaakwata Yehoahazi omurumuna, yaamutwara Misri.<verse eid="2CH 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 36:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:36">2 Bag 23:36</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 23:37">37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yehoyakimu akaba aine emyaka makumi abiri n'etaano obu yaatandika kutegyeka, yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu emyaka ikumi na gumwe. Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA Ruhanga we. <verse eid="2CH 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 36:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:11">2 Bus 33:11</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:1">2 Bag 24:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:18">Yer 22:18</ref>, <ref loc="JER 22:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 36:30">36:30</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni yainamuka, yaamuteera, yaamubohesa emihama kumutwara Babulooni. <verse eid="2CH 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 36:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:13">2 Bag 24:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 1:7">Ezr 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:1">Dan 1:1</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 1:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:2">5:2</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Nebukadeneeza ogwo yaatwara Babulooni bimwe aha bintu by'enju ya MUKAMA, yaabita omu kikaari kye. <verse eid="2CH 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 36:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:5">2 Bag 24:5</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 24:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Endiijo mirimo ya Yehoyakimu, n'ebirikunugwa ebi yaakozire, n'ebyabaire bimureebwaho, bihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'abagabe ba Israeli n'aba Yuda; bwanyima omutabani Yehoyakiini yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2CH 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 36:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:9, 10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:8-17">2 Bag 24:8-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yehoyakiini akaba aine emyaka ikumi na munaana, obu yaatandika kutegyeka; yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu ameezi ashatu n'ebiro ikumi. Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 36:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:10-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:18-20">2 Bag 24:18-20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:1">Yer 52:1</ref>, <ref loc="JER 52:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Aha kutandika kw'omwaka Nebukadeneeza yaatuma, baamutwara Babulooni n'ebintu by'obuguzi bwingi eby'enju ya MUKAMA, yaayemeka mukuru we Zedekia kuba omugabe wa Yuda na Yerusaalemu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:1">Yer 37:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="2CH 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 36:11" />Zedekia akaba aine emyaka makumi abiri na gumwe, obu yaatandika kutegyeka; yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu emyaka ikumi na gumwe. <verse eid="2CH 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 36:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:3-7">Yer 21:3-7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:12-22">27:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:1-5">32:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:6-10">37:6-10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:17-26">38:17-26</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA Ruhanga we; tiyaayecureeza mu maisho ga Yeremia nabi, owaabaire amugambira ebigambo bya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2CH 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 36:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:8">2 Bus 30:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:3">Yer 52:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:15-18">Ezk 17:15-18</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaagomera omugabe Nebukadeneeza owaamurahiize ahari Ruhanga; yaagaruka yaagangaaza ebitsya, yaagumya omutima gwe, yaayanga kuhindukira MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 36:14" />Kandi abanyamurwa abakuru boona n'abantu nabo bakaba barengyesereize omu kucumura nibakuratira ebirikunugwa byona eby'abanyamahanga, baashiisha enju ya MUKAMA ei yaabaire ayereize Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="2CH 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 36:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 7:13">Yer 7:13</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:34">25:34</ref>; <ref loc="JER 26:5">26:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:19">29:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 35:15">35:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:4">44:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo akaba atuura naabatumaho entumwa ze, ahabw'okugirira abantu be, n'obutaaho bwe, esaasi; <verse eid="2CH 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 36:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:25">Enf 1:25</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 1:30">30</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:12">Yer 5:12</ref>, <ref loc="JER 5:13">13</ref>. </char></note> kwonka baaguma nibateerera enaku entumwa za Ruhanga, nibagaya ebigambo bye, nibashekyerera baanabi be, okuhitsya obu ekiniga kya MUKAMA kyaizire aha bantu be, bakabura oku baraakikire.<verse eid="2CH 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abayuda okutwarwa Babulooni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 36:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:17-20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 25:1-7">2 Bag 25:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:49">Bir 28:49</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 9:7">Ezr 9:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA yaabateeza omugabe w'Abakaludaaya, yaitira abatsigazi baabo omu nju y'Obutaaho bwabo oburikwera na rurara, tiyaagirira muntu weena saasi, omutsigazi nari empangare, omugurusi nari owaahikire omu ngingo zaabukuru; yaabahayo boona omu mikono y'ogwo mugabe. <verse eid="2CH 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 36:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:13-15">2 Bag 25:13-15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ebintu byona eby'enju ya MUKAMA, ebihango n'ebikye, n'eby'obutungi by'omuri egyo nju, n'eby'omugabe n'eby'abanyiginya be, ebyo byona yaabitwara Babulooni. <verse eid="2CH 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 36:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:9">2 Bag 25:9</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima baayotsya enju ya Ruhanga, baasheenya orugo rw'amabaare rwa Yerusaalemu, baayotsya zaanyaruju zaayo zoona, baacwekyereza n'ebintu byayo ebirungi. <verse eid="2CH 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 36:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:7">Yer 27:7</ref>. </char></note> Abaahonokire ahari rurara Nebukadeneeza yaabatwara Babulooni, baaba abahuuku be n'ab'abatabani, okuhitsya aha kutandika kw'obugabe bwa Perisi, <verse eid="2CH 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 36:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:45">Lev 25:45</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:34">26:34</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 26:35">35</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 26:43">43</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:9-12">Yer 25:9-12</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:2">Dan 9:2</ref>. </char></note> okuhikiiriza ekigambo kya MUKAMA ekyagambirwe Yeremia, ngu ensi eryaguma etyo okuhitsya obu eriheza kushemerererwa sabato zaayo; ahabw'okuba ebiro ebi yaamazire eri omushaka byona, ekaba eijuka sabato okumara emyaka makumi mushanju.<verse eid="2CH 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebya Kuuro omugabe wa Perisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 36:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:22, 23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 1:1-3">Ezr 1:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:28">Isa 44:28</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:10-14">Yer 33:10-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omu mwaka gw'okubanza ogw'omu busingye bwa Kuuro omugabe wa Perisi, MUKAMA akaimutsya omutima gwa Kuuro, ngu ekigambo kye ekyagambirwe Yeremia kihikiirire, yaaragiira kuranga ebigambo ebi omu bugabe bwe bwona, kandi n'okubihandiika, naagira ati: <verse eid="2CH 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 36:23" />Oku nikwo Kuuro omugabe wa Perisi arikugamba naagira ati: MUKAMA, Ruhanga w'eiguru, ampaire obugabe bwona obw'omu nsi, kandi anyehanangiriize kumwombekyera enju omuri Yerusaalemu ey'omuri Yuda. Mbwenu omuntu weena omuriimwe ow'omu bantu be, MUKAMA Ruhanga we agume nawe; kandi ainamukye.<verse eid="2CH 36:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 36" />
</usx>